<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">Teke-Tyee</book>
  <para style="h">MATYE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matye</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi mbwe yi ósono Matye</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Mbwe yi ósono</para>
  <para style="mt1">MATYE</para>
  <para style="imt">OSOMO</para>
  <para style="ip">Me Matye, muntolo-mpagha wu mu-Dzwife, mumõ mu binduono kwumu ya byele (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 12">12</ref></char>), áasono mukaana a Nsia yi Mbwe wu. Nde ásono mukaana wu kundaa ba-Dzwife ba baakasa kana mu Yiisu-Kriste. Ba-Dzwife bagyighili osoolo mikaana mi mili mu Ogwihini ku Okulu, ya Matye li mu osuo kundaa bo ti Yiisu li munde wu aagyi mu osa kuulu ti mi básono mu mikaana mimye mikeele. Mu kuulu, nde aakataŋana mye matala mwohono. Mukaana wu, Matye ásono nde mu matala ma bábyi ba-Dzwife ba baakasa kana mu Yiisu mu manzo ma bo mama lisamana. Bo bási bimvuŋunu bi bíkagyagha baara baala ka báli ba-Dzwife o. Matye li mu osuo ti Yiisu li Mfumu wu aakaluo ya litumu mu mi ookaluomo Nzaami kundaa babo ba bali a kana. Nde li mu osuo nzili yi nyaghara yi obaghala mikyene mi mili mu Ogwihini ku Okulu. Matye li mu osuo si ti Yiisu li si Mesi, Mubvwuhu wu ookakebe ba-Dzwife.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nsia yi Mbwe yi ósono Matye yili mu onama ngughu a nzili oyo yi óbaala mukaana wu ósono Mareke. Munsa mukaana a nde, Matye bvughu mandagha ma Yiisu mu bangughu ba mikwughu mitaana: Mu bikaba kii bitaana tee kii nsaama (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 5-7">5–7</ref></char>): Mukwughu ku yulu a munguo, li mukyene wu bumweẽ kundaa binduono bi Yiisu. Nde li mu otala minama ŋa kara li baara bo-a-bo ya ŋa kara li baara ya Nzaami. Mukwughu wu ekaba kii kwumu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 10">10</ref></char>): Mukwughu wu li mu osuo litumu ya maluo kundaa babo ba bali mu okayitsala Nsia yi Mbwe. Mukwughu wu ekaba kii kwumu ya bitere (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 13">13</ref></char>): Mukwughu wu bvughu maluo ma Emfumu ki Mayulu mu mankumu nsaama. Emfumu ki Mayulu eli ki esweme, lo kye eli mu okamoŋono epankala ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono mu matala ma ótsyiri Nzaami. Mukwughu wu ekaba kii kwumu ya mpuomo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18">18</ref></char>): Mukwughu wu li mu osuo bumweẽ bu baara ba bafaana osomo mu Emfumu ki Mayulu. Mukwughu wu bikaba makwumu-mwolo ya bina ya makwumu-mwolo ya bitaana (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24-25">24–25</ref></char>): Mukwughu wu bikaba makwumu-mwolo ya bina ya makwumu-mwolo ya bitaana li mu osuo bunu binduono bifaana okebe museene a Nzaami wu masini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bu me bu baakakaba mukaana wu:</para>
  <para style="io1">- Bankagha-kwuru ba Yiisu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">1.1-17</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">- Oburu ya bumwana bu Yiisu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-2:23">1.18–2.23</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">-Maluo ma Dzã Muboghoro: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">-Oboghoro o Yiisu ya bigyeele kundaa dyabulu: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3.13–4.11</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">-Esala e Yiisu mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile (luo, gyihi ya dzuhu mampwumu ma baara): <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4.12–18.35</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">-Midzye mi Yiisu ku Yerusaleme: <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 19-20">19–20</ref></char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">-Bitsughu bi Yiisu bibi masini ku Yerusaleme <char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 21-28">21–28</ref></char>:</para>
  <para style="io2">Mukakana wu lipfu,</para>
  <para style="io2">Lipfu li nde,</para>
  <para style="io2">Osighili o nde mu lipfu,</para>
  <para style="io2">Omoŋono o nde kundaa baara.</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Musyi a dzumu li Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luk 3.23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Musyi a dzumu li Yiisu-Kriste, Dabvide, li nkagha-kwuru a Yiisu, Abarahame li nkagha-kwuru a Dabvide.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abarahame áburu Idzake, Idzake áburu Dzakobe, Dzakobe áburu Yuda ya bambwee ya banaana ba nde ba babaghala. <verse eid="MAT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Yuda áburu Faredze ya Dzara mu Tamare. Faredze áburu Eserõ, Eserõ áburu Arame. <verse eid="MAT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Arame áburu Aminadabe, Aminadabe áburu Naasõ, Naasõ áburu Salamone, <verse eid="MAT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salamone áburu Bohese mu Rahabe. Bohese áburu Obede mu Rute, Obede áburu Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yese áburu mukogho Dabvide.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Dabvide áburu Salomõ mu mukala a Uri, <verse eid="MAT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Salomõ áburu Roboame, Roboame áburu Abiya, Abiya áburu Adzafe, <verse eid="MAT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Adzafe áburu Dzodzafate, Dzodzafate áburu Dzorame, Dzorame áburu Odzyase, <verse eid="MAT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Odzyase áburu Yohatame, Yohatame áburu Akadze, Akadze áburu Edzekyase, <verse eid="MAT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Edzekyase áburu Manase, Manase áburu Amose, Amose áburu Dzodzyase, <verse eid="MAT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Dzodzyase áburu Dzekonya ya bambwee ya banaana ba nde ba babaghala mu ena ki bábiri baara mu minsunughu ku Babilone.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ŋa mbihi a ŋa bábiri baara mu minsunughu ku Babilone, Dzekonya áburu Salatyele, Salatyele áburu Dzorobabele, <verse eid="MAT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Dzorobabele áburu Abiwude, Abiwude áburu Elyakime, Elyakime áburu Adzore, <verse eid="MAT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Adzore áburu Sadoke, Sadoke áburu Akime, Akime áburu Eliwude, <verse eid="MAT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliwude áburu Eleyadzare, Eleyadzare áburu Matane, Matane áburu Dzakobe, <verse eid="MAT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Dzakobe áburu Dzodzefe mulumu a Mari, me mu nde báburu Yiisu wu baakata Kriste.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Mu obo, mu obaana Abarahame tee Dabvide, biseene bili kwumu ya bina (14). Mu obaana Dabvide tee mu ena ki bábiri baara mu minsunughu ku Babilone, biseene bili kwumu ya bina (14). Ya mu obaana matala mamo tee ŋa báburu Kriste biseene bili kwumu ya bina (14).<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oburu o Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luk 2.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Bu me bu báburu Yiisu-Kriste: Ngughu a nde Mari áli mukaha wu ógwi Dzodzefe bilyimi. Lo nsomo bakala nzo mo, Mari ákeghele mu lileene li Mufulu a Ngili. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Dzodzefe mulumu a nde, áli mbwuru wu bunsumu. Ya nde bu ágwene odzyi otwuhu Mari budzwa ŋa mihi mi baara, nde ábagha bitsimi bii okahaba bala mu ensweghe. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Mu matala ma ákabulutsimi nde obo, ngye-yulu a Mfumu áyamoŋono a nde mu nzolo ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Dzodzefe mwana a Dabvide, ka bara nzalamweẽ mu ogwolo Mari, mukala a we mu nzo a we o. Mu kuulu, mu lileene li Mufulu a Ngili nde aakeghele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aakeghele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbaala ti: aabagha yimi</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Nde sa aburu mwana wu baghala ya we sa gwa nde nkwumu Yiisu, mu kuulu nde sa abvwuhu baara ba nde mu masumu ma bo.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Mandagha mwohono mamo mámoŋono mu kuulu mi ólyele Mfumu mu mubighili mikeele:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />«Mono, mutughu wu munkyini sa akeghele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">Nde sa aburu mwana wu baghala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:23">ya sa bata nde mu nkwumu yi a Emanwele.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:23">Mbaala ti: «Nzaami ŋa kara li bihi-a-be.»<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Bu asighili kunsa ensama, Dzodzefe ási bwunu a bu ótumu nde ngye-yulu a Mfumu, ya ágwolo mukala a nde álo nde mu nzo. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Lo nde ka ábvughu mbughu ya Mari o, tee matala ma áburu nde mwana wu baghala wu ágwi nde nkwumu Yiisu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Banga-a-mayele bayimono Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:8-20">Luk 2.8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Báburu Yiisu ku Beteleeme, mu nsie yi a Yude, mu matala ma óli Erode mukogho. Mono, banga-a-mayele báfi ku ookapala tala, ya báyato ŋa Yerusaleme. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Ya bákabulufwulu ti: «Mukogho a ba-Dzwife wu baaburu kunu ali? Mu kuulu bihi liimono ŋomaŋomo a nde ku ookapala tala, ya bihi liigyi mu oyagwa nde baana.» <verse eid="MAT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Mukogho Erode bu agyughu obo, nde ya baara ba Yerusaleme bwohono, mikolo mi bo míkala maã-maã. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Nde ábvughu bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami bwohono ya baluo-mikyene ba báli ŋa kara li ekaana, ya áfwulu bo kunu-ako bafaana oburu Kriste. <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Ya bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Ku Beteleeme, lili Yude, mu kuulu mubighili ásono bu:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />
    <char style="qt">“We Beteleeme, mu nsie yi a Yude</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">We ka li ebvu-bvulu ŋa kara li mabvulu mama Yude o</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Mu kuulu, me mu we akala oopala mfumu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Wu aabiri Isarayele, baara ba me</char>.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:1">Mis 5.1</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Mu obo, Erode bu ati banga-a-mayele mbili mu ensweghe, ásagha ogyighili ogyahaba kundaa bo munsa matala ŋomaŋomo aamoŋono. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Ya nde ágweghe bo ku Beteleeme ya ályele ti: «Ligye ligyighili ofwulu baara mu mi mitala mwana, ya be limana omono nde, liyalyele me, mu kuulu mehe si ngye yingwa nde baana.»<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9" />Bo bu bamana ogyughu mi ólyele mukogho, bágyene. Ya bo báfirimono ŋomaŋomo wu bámono bo ku ookapala tala, ákatswama ku nkulu a bo, tee ku áyitemene nde mu engye-angye ŋa ebini ki óli mwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10" />Bu bamono ŋomaŋomo, bo básomo kunsa muyayaã wu alagha. <verse eid="MAT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Bu basomo munsa nzo, bámono mwana ya Mari, ngughu a nde. Bo bábwi masu mu nsie mu ogwa nde baana. Bádzubulu bimpogholo bi bo, ya bágwi nde bikaba: Oore, muyiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malyimi ma baakatsughu mu ogwa mpihi yi mbwe</char></note> ya mananaase mama miire<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miire mananaase mama ntala ya mama mpihi yi mbwe</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Ŋa mbihi, Nzaami ágyehe bo mu nzolo, banyaã obvughuru kundaa Erode. Bo bábvughuru ku nsie a bo mu nzili nkimi.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obara ku Edzipite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Banga-a-mayele bu babvughuru, ngye-yulu a Mfumu áyamoŋono kundaa Dzodzefe mu nzolo ya ályele nde ti: «Temene, gwolo mwana ya ngughu a nde, bara a bo ku Edzipite. Yikala oko tee mu matala ma akala aandyele me we ti bvughuru. Mu kuulu, Erode sa asagha mwana mu kuulu adzwa nde.» <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Mu mpyibi gyini oyo, Dzodzefe átemene, ágwolo mwana ya ngughu a nde, ya áyisweme ku Edzipite. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Nde ákala oko tee matala ma ókpi Erode. Myehene mimye, mu kuulu mandagha ma ólyele Mfumu mu muŋma a mubighili makeele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:15">«<char style="qt">Me aanti mwana a me mbili, apala mu Edzipite.</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Odz 11.1</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzwa ku biba-baana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Erode bu amono ti banga-a-mayele baapfiri nde, nde ákolo nkehe yi alagha. Ya nde ágweghe bambumbulu ku Beteleeme ya mu bitsulu bi nsie bi nde byehene, mu kuulu bayidzwa biba-baana bibi babaghala byehene bibi bamvulu buolo, ya ku nsie, embe-embe ya matala ma ólyele nde banga-a-mayele. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Oŋo me ŋa ótswughu ndagha yi ólyele mubighili Dzeremi ti:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />«<char style="qt">Likyi li lili mu ofa ku Rama</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Likyi li bilili ya minyoõ mi milagha</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Rasyele li mu olili baana ba nde</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Ya nde aabihi babuono nde, mu kuulu baana ba nde ka baafirisyili o</char>.»<verse eid="MAT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvughuru ku Isarayele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Erode bu akpi, ngye-yulu a Mfumu áyimoŋono kundaa Dzodzefe mu nzolo ku Edzipite, <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Temene, gwolo mwana ya ngughu a nde, ya bvughuru ku nsie yi a Isarayele, mu kuulu babo ba baakasagha odzwa mwana baakpi». <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Dzodzefe átemene, ágwolo mwana ya ngughu a nde, ya ábvughuru ku nsie yi a Isarayele. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Lo nde bu agyughu ti Arakelaose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mwana a Erode. Nde ágyiŋi ŋa ebini e taara a nde. Empu e nde ébaana bamvulu bana nsomo baburu Yiisu ya egyili bamvulu nsaama ŋa mbihi a ŋa báburu Yiisu. </char></note> li mu okatumu nsie a Yude ŋa ebini e taara a nde Erode, Dzodzefe ámono nzalamweẽ mu ogye oko. Nzaami bu agyehe nde mu nzolo, nde áyisweme ku bitsulu bi nsie bibi ku Ngalile. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Bu ato, nde áyikala mu bvulu lili Nadzarete, mu kuulu mandagha ma ólyele mibighili magye mu mana: «Sa balyele nde ti nde musi Nadzarete.»<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Maluo ma Dzã Muboghoro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Dzã 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Mu bitsughu bibye, Dzã Muboghoro ámoŋono ku syehe lili Yude, ákabuluta mukwughu wu: <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />«Ligyiŋi mayele, mu kuulu Emfumu ki Mayulu eebehene!» <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Wu me munde wu ókabighili mubighili Edzayi, ŋa ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">«<char style="qt">Likyi li munde wu li mu okakehe engumbu ku syehe</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">Ligyighili nzili a Mfumu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">lisa mankwulu ma nde makala nsumu</char>!»<verse eid="MAT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Dzã, áli a enkuru ki bátwu mu mfu a nyama wu a nkwumu syamo, ya ákuru musili wu a mu nkobo a nyama mu bala li nde. Nde ákabuludza bansense ya nyuŋu wu ebiri. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Baara baba Yerusaleme, baba Yude lwohono, ya baba etsulu e nsie kyehene kii Dzurudẽ, bákagye kundaa nde, <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />ya nde ákaboghoro bo mu nzala yi a Dzurudẽ bu bákakihi masumu ma bo ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Bu amono ba-Faridzyẽ balagha ya ba-Saduseyẽ ba bákagya kundaa nde mu kuulu nde aboghoro bo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Etswumu ki bampili! Nande aasuo be bu liibara nkehe a Nzaami yili mu ogya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Liikasuo mu bigyighili ti be liigyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Ya ka likakala a bitsimi bi mu beme o ti: “Taara a bihi Abarahame!” Mu kuulu, me ndyele be ti: Nzaami kughu okirili mameẽ ma makala baana kundaa Abarahame! <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ekwu ayi baatwulu mu otsyiri midza mi miti. Mu obo, nswe muti wu aagwene okaburu bimburu bi bibwe, sa bakpaa nde ya batsili nde ku mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />Me ndi mu okaboghoro be mu madza mu nkooro a ogyiŋi mayele. Lo munde wu li mu ogya ŋa mbihi a me, bvulu me mpini, me ka nkughu onyana misyi mi bikoghoro bi nde o. Nde sa aboghoro be mu Mufulu a Ngili ya mu mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Nde li a nkwogho yi mampala ŋa kwogho e nde mu okabala bimburu ya bisagha, sa akwomo mbala a nde, sa akwu bimburu bi bele bi nde kunsa etaghala, lo sa atsughu bisagha ku mbaa yi aagwene okadzimi.»<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oboghoro o Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu fi ku Ngalile, gyi ku Dzurudẽ kundaa Dzã mu kuulu aboghoro nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Lo Dzã ka ákadzyi o, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Me ndi a nzala ati baboghoro me kundaa we, lo we firigya kundaa me!» <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Mu matala ma, nyaã okala obo. Mu kuulu ofaana okala obo kundaa bihi a we mu kuulu likuhu myehene mi ookatumu Nzaami.» Oŋo Dzã ákihi. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Bu basaaboghoro nde, ŋaana oŋo Yiisu ápala mu madza. Ya mono, mayulu mádzubulu kundaa nde, ya nde ámono Mufulu a Nzaami mu okayakumunu ti beeme, ya gyi ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Ya ndagha yífi mu mayulu ya yílyele ti: «Wu me Mwana a me wu mukolo. Mu nde me aankamono esee.»<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Dyabulu gyeele Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Mufulu ábiri Yiisu ku syehe, mu kuulu dyabulu agyeele nde. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Yiisu bu akuru nswele mu bala mu bitsughu makwumu mana (40) ya mampyibi makwumu mana (40), ku masini, nzala yífuru nde. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Nga-a-bigyeele áyasele ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti we li Mwana a Nzaami, sa ti mameẽ ma makighiri mampa.» <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Lo Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: Básono ti: <char style="qt">Mbwuru ka akala mweẽ yini a mu mampa o, lo mu mandagha mwohono ma maakapala mu muŋma a Nzaami</char>.<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Oŋo dyabulu ábiri nde ku Yerusaleme, bvulu lili ngili, átwulu nde ku yulu a nsweẽ a Nzo a Nzaami, <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />ya ályele kundaa nde ti: Kala ti we li Mwana a Nzaami, bwa ku nsie, mu kuulu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">Nde sa agwa litumu kundaa bangye-yulu ba nde mu nkooro a we</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">ya bo sa bagyagha we mu myaã mi bo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">mu kuulu kwulu e we enyaã okubu limeẽ</char>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Bik 91.11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>.<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: Básono si ti: <char style="qt">Ka agyeele Mfumu Nzaami a we o</char>.<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Dyabulu áfiribiri nde ku yulu a munguo wu a nkara mutele. Nde ásuo nde bimfumu bi nsie byehene ya nsia a bye, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />ya ályele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Me sa ngwa we bilogho byehene bi, kala ti we kunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a me mu ogwa me baana.» <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Satana, mara ŋa bele a me! Mu kuulu básono ti: <char style="qt">We Mfumu Nzaami a we faana obuono, ya yini a nde we faana osamana</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Det 6.13</ref></char></note>». <verse eid="MAT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Oŋo dyabulu ányaã nde, ya mono, bangye-yulu báyabehene ya nde ya bábaana okabaha nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbaala ti: ogwa nde bilogho bi-odza.</char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu baana esala e nde ku Ngalile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Yiisu bu agyughu ti baalo Dzã mu boloko, nde ágyene ku Ngalile. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Nde ásihi Nadzarete ya áyikala ku Kaperenawume, mu bele a mubu, mu etsulu e nsie kii Dzabulõ ya Nefetali, <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />mu kuulu mandagha ma ólyele mubighili Edzayi makeele:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />
    <char style="qt">Etsulu e nsie kii Dzabulõ, etsulu e nsie kii Nefetali</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">
    <char style="qt">nzili yi a mubu, ku ngulu a Dzurudẽ</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:15">
    <char style="qt">Ngalile lili baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o</char>!<verse eid="MAT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />
    <char style="qt">Baara ba báli kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">
    <char style="qt">baamono otsyeme ku onene</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">
    <char style="qt">ya kundaa babo ba bali kunsa edzwunu kii lipfu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:16">
    <char style="qt">otsyeme omoŋono</char>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:23-9:1">Edz 8.23–9.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>!<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Obaana matala mamo, Yiisu ábaana oluo ya ákabululyele ti: «Ligyiŋi mayele mu kuulu Emfumu ki Mayulu eeyabehene!»<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binduono bi Yiisu bina bibi nsomo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Bu ákabuludzye mu mukogho a mubu a Ngalile, Yiisu ámono baana buolo ba taara mumõ, Simõ wu baakata ti Piere ya Andere mbwee a nde, mu okatere likoho mu mubu, mu kuulu bo báli bilebe banswi. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Linama me, ya me sa nsa be bilebe baara.» <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ŋaana oŋo, bo basaabulunyaã nkoho a bo, ya banama nde. <verse eid="MAT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Bu afirisehe ŋa nkulu, nde áfirimono baana buolo bakimi ba taara mumõ: Dzake ya Dzã, baana ba Nzebede ba babaghala munsa bwara bu bunene. Bo báli ya taara a bo Nzebede mu okagyighili nkoho. Yiisu áti bo mbili. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Ŋaana oŋo, bo básaabulunyaã bwara bu bunene ya taara a bo ya bánama nde.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu luo ya dzuhu babyele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Yiisu ákabulugye mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngalile kyehene, mu okabululuo munsa manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife, ya ákabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Emfumu. Nde ákabuludzuhu mabyele mwohono ya bipfwumu byehene ŋa kara li baara. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Nsia a nde yítsaŋama mu Siiri lwohono. Ya bákayabiri kundaa a nde baara bwohono ba báli a mabyele mama mawa-mawa ya ba bákamono mpara: banga a mifulu mi mibi, banga a nzyere, ba ópki binama, ya nde ákadzuhu bo. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Ya mampwumu ma baara ma máfi ku Ngalile, ku etsulu e nsie kii mabvulu-kwumu, ku Yerusaleme, ku Yude, ya ku ngulu a Dzurudẽ, mábwi onama nde.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s1">Maluo ma Yiisu ŋa yulu a munguo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13">Mar 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-13">Luk 6.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Yiisu bu amono mampwumu ma baara, ákumu ku yulu a munguo, ya bu abwi nsini, binduono bi nde bísele kundaa nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Bu atsughu ndagha, nde ábwi oluo ya olyele bo ti:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Esee kii ngaŋma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luk 6.20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />«Esee kundaa bawele mu Mufulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:3">mu kuulu Emfumu ki Mayulu eli kii ndaa bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Esee kundaa ba bali mu okalili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:4">mu kuulu Nzaami sa abuono bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Esee kundaa babo ba bali badzuunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:5">mu kuulu bo sa babagha pfa li nsie yi ósiini a bo Nzaami!<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Esee kundaa babo ba bali a nzala ya nyoro a bunsumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:6">mu kuulu bo sa bagyughuru!<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Esee kundaa babo ba baakamono bana nyiĩ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:7">mu kuulu sa bamono bo si nyiĩ!<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Esee kundaa babo ba bali a mikolo mimi tse-tsee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:8">mu kuulu bo sa bamono Nzaami!<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Esee kundaa babo ba baakasa ti edzuunu ekala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:9">mu kuulu sa bata bo baana ba Nzaami!<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Esee kundaa babo baala bali mu okamwehẽ bo kimini mu nkooro a bunsumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 5:10">mu kuulu Emfumu ki Mayulu eli kii ndaa bo!<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />Esee kundaa be kala ti baara batughu be, bamwehẽ be kimini, ya babili mandagha mwohono ma mabi mama mpya mu be, mu nkooro a me. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Likala a emiini ya likala kunsa muyayaã! Mu kuulu mufuru a be mu mayulu li munene. Me obo si bákamwehẽ mibighili mi mítswama nsomo ya be kimini.»<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungba ya otsyeme o nsie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9.50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luk 14.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />«Be lili munbga a nsie. Lo, kala ti munbga ka afirisyili a ese o, lo mu ema bakughu ofiribvurulu nde kye? Lo nde ka afirisyili a esala o. Bafaana otsili nde ku mbala ya baara badzyara nde.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />Be lili otsyeme o nsie nsyini. Bvulu li bátwu ŋa yulu a munguo ka likughu osweme o. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ka baakanahaba mwindi ya bafughu nde nkuru o, lo baakatwulu nde ŋa yulu a ebini ki baakwulu mwindi, ya nde aakagwa otsyeme kundaa baara bwohono ba bali munsa nzo. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Mu obo, nyaã otsyeme o be omoŋono ŋa mihi mi baara bwohono, mu kuulu bo bamono bigyighili bi be bi bibwe, ya basyighi Taara a be wu li mu mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala Mikyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />«Ka litsimi o ti me aangyi mu oyatsala Mikyene mi Moyidze bwunu we maluo ma mibighili. Me ka aangyi mu otsala o, lo mu osa kuulu ti mye mikeele. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, tee mu matala ma ooluru yulu ya nsie, lo ti esono kii nkwumu i, bwunu we empi-mpiri ki esono nga-emõ, ka bamaha kye mu Mikyene o, tee ŋa ookeele mandagha mwohono. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Mu obo, nswe munde wu aatsala mukyene si mumõ mu mi mibvulu busala mi, ya luo baara mu osa bumõ, sa bata nde wu bvulu busala mu Emfumu ki Mayulu. Lo munde wu aasalala mye ya aaluo mye, sa balyele ti nde mbwuru wu munene mu Emfumu ki Mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Me ndyele kundaa be ti, kala ti bunsumu bu be ka bubvulu bubu ndaa baluo-mikyene ya bubu ndaa ba-Faridzyẽ o, lo be akala ka lisomo mu Emfumu ki Mayulu o.»<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala nkehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />«Be áli liigyughu bályele kundaa bakwuru ti: “Ka dzwa o”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Opala 20.13; Deteronome 5.17</char></note>. Munde wu aadzwa bafaana osa nde muyala. <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Lo me, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe munde wu aakolo nganda-mbwuru a nde nkehe, bafaana osa nde muyala. Munde wu aalyele nganda-mbwuru a nde ti: “Ewulu!” Bafaana osa nde muyala kundaa Ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">emvuŋunu ki bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife ba bákalamana mandagha</char></note>. Munde wu aalyele ti: “Nga-a-lala!” Lo bafaana otubu nde ku mungele a mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />Lo kala ti we li mu ogwa ekaba ŋa ebini ki baakagwa bikaba, ya we libili mweẽ ti nganda-mbwuru li a ndagha ya we, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />lo nyaã ekaba e we oŋo, matswama yigwihini ya nde, ŋa nseele sa yabvughuru ya gwa ekaba e we.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />Sa maswa mu ogwihini ya mbwuru wu liibaŋana ya we, ŋaala be ya nde nkini lili mu nzili. Kala pele, nde sa atyeghe we kundaa nsughu a lamana, nsughu a lamana sa agwa we ŋa myaã mi bambumbulu, ya bambumbulu sa balo we munsa boloko. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa we ti: We ka apala omo o, tee ŋa aamana ofiri we mupara wu masini mu ebyimi ki li a we.»<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala bukala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />«Be áli líigyughu bályele ti: “Ka bvughu mbughu ya mulumu bwunu we ya mukala a nganda-mbwuru o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Opa 20.14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Det 5.18</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Lo, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe mbwuru wu aatala mukaha ya sughu mukolo mu nde, nde maabvughu mbughu ya nde munsa mukolo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Kala ti lihi li we lili ku ngo-kwogho liikabwihi we mu masumu, sogholo lo ya tsili lo la ya we. Mu kuulu, obvulu bubwe kundaa we mu opfihili esighi emõ mu bisighi bi nyuru a we, ya banyaã otsili nyuru a we yohono ku mungele a mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Kala ti ngo-kwogho e we eekabwihi we mu masumu, tsyiri kye ya tsili kye la ya we. Mu kuulu, obvulu bubwe kundaa we mu opfihili esighi emõ mu bisighi bi nyuru a we, mu kuulu nyuru a we yohono yinyaã ogye ku mungele a mbaa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala odzwa bala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat 19.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />«Báfirilyele si ti: “Kala ti mbwuru byi mukala a nde, lo agwa nde mukaana wu ookpi bala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:2">Det 24.2</ref></char></note>” <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Lo me, me ndyele kundaa be ti: “Nswe munde wu aabyi mukala a nde, kala ti ka oli mu nkooro a enkwunu o, lo nde sa atsiini nde mu obwa mu bukala. Ya kala ti mbwuru kye mukaha wu baabyi ku bala, lo nde bwi mu bukala.”»<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala olaba mikihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />«Be áli líifirigyughu bályele kundaa bakwuru ti: “Ka laba mukihi wu a mpya o, lo we faana ogyighili ndagha yi álaba we mukihi kundaa Mfumu”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Bun 19.12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:3">Mut 30.3</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:22-24">Det 23.22-24</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Lo me, me ndyele kundaa be ti, si okala a bunu, ka likalaba mukihi o, ngu okala mu nkwumu a yulu, mu kuulu lilo likubu li Nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Ngu okala mu nkwumu a nsie, mu kuulu yo yili ebini ki ookatwulu Nzaami myili, ngu okala mu nkwumu a Yerusaleme. Mu kuulu lo lili bvulu li Mukogho wu Munene. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Ka laba mukihi mu mutswi a we si o, mu kuulu we ka kughu osa ti lifu si limõ lipeŋeme bwunu we lipyini o. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Nyaã mbiili a we yikala kala “heẽ” lo “heẽ”, kala “pele”, lo “pele”. Mandagha mwohono ma baakabwehe ŋa yulu kundaa Nga-a-bubi maakafa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala obvurulu etere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luk 6.29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />«Be áli liigyughu bályele ti: “Lihi mu lihi, ya lyini mu lyini”. <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Lo me, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Kala ti mbwuru si be bubi, ka libvurulu nde etere o. Lo, kala ti mbwuru kaha we limpala mu tama lili ku ngo-kwogho, taama nde si tama li like. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Kala ti mbwuru dzyi osa we mumfwunu mu kuulu agwolo enkuru e we kii butulu, gwa nde si enkuru e we ki ela kii kobo. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Kala ti mbwuru si we enkwili mu odzyara mankpaã pfwunu (1 000) mu myili ya nde, lidzyara mapfwunu mwolo (2 000) ma mankpaã ya nde. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />Gwa kundaa munde wu aaluomo we. Kundaa munde wu dzyi osuomo kundaa we, ka bihi o.»<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Odzyi mitaara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luk 6.27-28</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />«Be áli líigyughu bályele ti: “Dzyi nganda-mbwuru a we ya bele mutaara a we<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Bun 19.18</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Lo me, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Liikadzyi mitaara mi be, ya liikasamana mu babo ba baakamwehẽ be kimini. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Me obo be liikala baana ba Taara a be wu li mu mayulu, mu kuulu nde aakapaha tala li nde mu baara ba babwe ya ba babi. Ya aakanohõ mvulu mu banga-a-bunsumu ya mu ba bagwene a bunsumu. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Mu obo, kala ti be okadzyi yini a ba baakadzyi be, nsa mufuru be liibagha? Mintolo-mpagha ka oli bumõ mye si miikasa o? <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Ya kala ti be mboro okagwa yini a kundaa bankele ba be ba babaghala ya ba bakaha, lo nsa ndagha yi okiŋimi be liikagyighili? Baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, bo ka baakasa bumõ o? <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Be me baala likala baara ba bakughu, ti bu oli Taara a be mukughu mu mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala ogwa bikaba kundaa bawele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />«Lisa mayele mu ogwene osuo bunsumu bu be ŋa mihi mi baara mu nzala a omoŋono kundaa bo. Kala pele, be ka libagha mufuru kundaa Taara a be wu li mu mayulu o. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Mu matala ma aakakaba we kundaa bawele, ka fulu mvulu-a-mvulu o, ti bu ookasa bampibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bampibi baara banga-a-bifa byele, ku mbala bo baakasuo efa ekimi, ki ebwe, lo kunsa mukolo a bo bitsimi bikimi, bi bibi. Bo bali baara banga a mpya</char></note> mu manzo ma lisamana ma ba-Dzwife, ya mu manzili, mu kuulu baara basyighi bo. Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Bo áyi babagha mufuru a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Lo we, mu matala ma aakakaba we kundaa bawele, kwogho e we kii engbambogho enyaã osoolo mi ookasa ngo-kwogho e we, <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />mu kuulu ekaba e we ekala kii ensweghe, ya Taara a we wu aakamono mu ensweghe, sa abvurulu we kye.»<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala lisamana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luk 11.2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />«Ŋa liikasamana be, ka likakala ti anga bampibi ba baakadzyi okasamana mu mukiri mu manzo mama lisamana mama ba-Dzwife o, ya mu mapfulu ma minsagha, mu kuulu baara bamono bo. Mu engaŋma, me ndyele be ti: Bo áyi babagha mufuru a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Lo we, mu matala ma dzyi we osamana, somo munsa ngwumu a we, dzughubu muŋma a nzo, ya samana Taara a we mu ensweghe. Ya Taara a we wu aakamono mu ensweghe sa agwa we mvuru.»<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bu lifaana okasamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />«Mu matala ma liikasamana be, ka likapaha mandagha malagha o ti bu ookasa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ba baakatsimi ti Nzaami sa agyughu bo kala ti babili ku olagha. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ka likapaha mandagha malagha ti bo o. Nzaami a be soolo bi lili a be nzala bye nsomo be liluomo. <verse eid="MAT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />Mu obo, be lifaana okasamana bu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">“Taara a bihi wu li mu mayulu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">Nyaã nkwumu a we yikala yi a ngili.<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />Nyaã emfumu e we egya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">nyaã dzyi li we likala ŋa nsie ti bu oli ku yulu.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Gwa bihi lolo li, bi-odza bi bihi bibi nswe etsughu.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Sa bubi bu bihi kolokolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:12">ti bu liikasa bihi si kolokolo kundaa babo ba baakasa bihi bubi.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Ka nyaã bihi libwa mu bigyeele o,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">Lo kwulu bihi mu bubi.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Mu kuulu emfumu, lileene ya nsia bili bibi we, mu mibvu nswe mibvu. Aamene.]»<verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />«Kala ti be lisi bubi bu baara kolokolo, Taara a be wu li ku mayulu sa asa be si kolokolo. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Lo, kala ti be ka lisi baara kolokolo o, Taara a be si ka asa masumu ma be kolokolo o.»<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maluo mu mi mitala okuru nswele mu bala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />«Ŋa liikakuru be nswele mu bala, ka likakala a bidzili bibi nyiĩ o, ti bu ookasa bampibi. Bidzili bi bo biikakighiri mu kuulu bagyighili osuo kundaa baara ti bo baakuru nswele mu bala. Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Bo áyi bábagha mufuru a bo. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Lo we, ŋa aakakuru we nswele mu bala, aakaswagha busu bu we, ya aakagyogho mutswi a we mananaase. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Mu kuulu nyaã omoŋono kundaa baara ti we aakuru nswele mu bala, ya Taara a we wu aakamono mu ensweghe, sa agwa we mvuru.»<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Busini bubu ku yulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luk 12.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />«Ka likakwu busini mu beme ŋa nsie yi o, mu kuulu minkeghere ya bansiele biikabyihi bo, ya banga-a-pfyibi baakabulu bidzughubu ya baakaturu. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Lo liikakwu busini bu be ku yulu, oko kuulu minkeghere ya bansiele ka biikabyihi bo o, ya banga-a-pfyibi ka baakabulu bidzughubu ya baakaturu o. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Mu kuulu ŋa oli busini bu we, me oŋo si ŋa ookala mukolo a we.»<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lihi lili mwindi a nyuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luk 11.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />«Lihi lili mwindi a nyuru. Kala ti lihi li we lili nsiili, lo nyuru a we yohono sa yikala kunsa otsyeme. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Lo, kala ti lihi li we libyele, lo nyuru a we yohono sa yikala kunsa mpyibi. Kala ti otsyeme ku oli mu we oli ti mpyibi, lo mpyibi oyo yili nkara yi a laŋa-laŋa.»<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzaami bwunu we nzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luk 16.13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />«Ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu osalala bamfumu buolo o. Mu kuulu nde sa abele mumõ ya sa adzyi wu muke, bwunu we nde sa anabara mu mumõ ya sa atsaala wu muke. Be ka likughu osalala Nzaami emõ ya Nzi o.»<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa kana mu Nzaami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luk 12.22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />«Mu obo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Ka likanyoõ mu nkooro a laama li be o, mu mi mitala bi liidza, bwunu we bi liiŋma, ya mu nkooro a nyuru, mu bi liilaha. Laama ka libvulu mupfunu ya bi-odza o? Ya nyuru ka yibvulu binkuru o? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Litala baŋmini ba yulu: Bo ka baakakunu o, ya ka baakatolo o, bo ka baakakwu mu bitaghala o, ya Taara a be wu li ku yulu, aakabuŋunu bo. Lo bunu, be ka libvulu bo mupfunu o? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Nande ŋa kara li be kughu obwehe bitsughu mu laama li nde mu minyoõ?»<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />«Mu emakye be lili mu okabulunyoõ mu nkooro a binkuru? Litala bu ookamene bifulu mu ebiri: Bye ka biikasala o, ya ka biikatwu biko o. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Me ndyele kundaa be ti: Si kala Salomõ ndeme, kunsa nsia a nde yo yohono, ka ábululaha enkuru ki ebvulu bubwe ti efulu nga-emõ mu bye o. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Kala ti Nzaami aakalaha bisagha bibi manseghe obo, biili lolo li bye bili, ya mbala-tsughu sa batsili bye ku mbaa, lo bunu, nde ka kughu obvululaha be o, baara baala kana li lisala? <verse eid="MAT 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />Ka likakala a minyoõ ya ka likabulubili o ti: “Emakye liidza? Bwunu we emakye liiŋma? Bwunu we emakye liilaha?” <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Mu kuulu bye byehene bibye, baara bwohono ba bagwene osoolo Nzaami baakabulusagha bye ku ogwene a okolo. Taara a be wu a ku yulu soolo ti be lili a nzala a bilogho byehene bibye. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Nsomo, litswama sagha Emfumu e Nzaami ya bunsumu bu nde, sa babwehe be bye byehene bibye ŋa yulu. <verse eid="MAT 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />Mu obo, ka likakala a minyoõ o mu mi mitala etsughu kii mbala, mu kuulu etsughu kii mbala sa ekala a minyoõ mu kyeme. Nswe etsughu eli ya mpara a kye.»<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ka likalamana banganda-baara o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luk 6.37-38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />«Ka likalamana o, mu kuulu banyaã olamana be si. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu liikalamana be banganda-baara, me bwunu obo si akala baalamana be, ya eteese ki liikateese be banganda-baara, me mu kyini ekye si akala baateese be. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Mu emakye we li mu okatala lisele li lili mu lihi li nganda-mbwuru a we, lo we ka li mu okamono mubaa wu li mu lihi li weme o? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Bwunu we, bunu we kughu olyele kundaa nganda-mbwuru a we ti: “Nyaã me maha lisele mu lihi li we”, ŋaala weme li a mubaa mu lihi li we? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Mpibi, matswama maha mubaa mu lihi li weme, ya we bu gyighili omono, we sa bagha bu omaha lisele mu lihi li nganda-mbwuru a we.»<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />«Ka ligwa bilogho bibi ngili kundaa bambwa o, ya ka litsili nsia kundaa bangubulu o, kala pele, bo sa badzyara yo, ya bo bakaala mihi kundaa be, bakaghala be.»<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluomo, osagha ya okoboro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luk 11.9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />«Liluomo, ya sa bagwa be, lisagha, ya be sa libagha, likoboro, ya sa badzubulu be, <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />mu kuulu, nswe munde wu aakaluomo, baakagwa nde, wu aakasagha aakabagha, ya baakadzubulu kundaa munde wu aakakoboro. <verse eid="MAT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />Nande ŋa kara li be kughu ogwa mwana a nde limeẽ, kala ti nde luomo limpa? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Bwunu we, kala ti nde luomo nswi, nde gwi nde ntaala? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Kala ti be baara ba babi lisoolo ogwa bilogho bi bibwe kundaa baana ba be, lo Taara a be wu li ku mayulu, bunu akughu ogwene ogwa bilogho bi bibvulu bubwe kundaa babo ba baaluomo nde bye?»<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />«Mu obo, myehene mi lidzyi ti baara basa mu be, be si lisa bumõ mu bo. Mu kuulu, mimye me Mikyene mi Moyidze ya Mibighili.»<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muŋma a nzo wu asala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luk 13.24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />«Lisomo mu muŋma a nzo wu asala, mu kuulu muŋma a nzo wu munene ya nzili yi nene biikabiri ku obyihi ya baara balagha baakasomo mu yo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Muŋma a nzo li asala, ya nzili yi aakabiri ku laama yili yi aaswele, ya babo ba baakamono yo ka bali balagha o.»<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mibighili mimi mpya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luk 6.43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />«Lisa mayele mu mibighili mimi mpya! Mye mili mu okagya kundaa be mu efaana ki bindoomo, lo kunsa kara mye mili bango baba nsihi. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Be sa ligyahaba mye mu bigyighili bi bo. Mu munsene-a-nsene ka bakughu oka bimburu bi bviini o, bwunu we mu mungaama ka bakughu oka mburu a finge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Finge mburu a muti yifaana a kunu ti anga manga, kunu ti anga mayighi.</char></note> o. <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Muti wu mubwe aakaburu bimburu bi bibwe, ya muti wu mubi, aakaburu bimburu bi bibi. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Muti wu mubwe ka kughu oburu bimburu bi bibi o, ya muti wu mubi ka kughu oburu bimburu bi bibwe o. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Nswe muti wu aagwene oburu bimburu bi bibwe, nde wu okpaa ya wu otsili ku mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Me mu obo, be sa lisoolo mibighili mu bimburu bi bo.»<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Binduono bibi ngaŋma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luk 13.25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />«Ka oli nswe munde wu aakalyele kundaa me ti: “Mfumu, Mfumu!” Aasomo mu Emfumu ki Mayulu o, lo munde wu aakagyighili waa li Taara a me wu li mu mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Mu etsughu ekye, baara balagha akala baalyele kundaa me ti: “Mfumu, Mfumu, bihi ka líkabighili mu nkwumu a we o? Bihi ka líkabyi mifulu mi mibi mu nkwumu a we o? Bihi, ka líkasa bimamaã mu nkwumu a we o?” <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Oŋo me sa ndyele kundaa bo ti: “Me ka nsoolo be si mu tala limõ o! Limara ŋa bele a me, be ba liikasa bubi!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:9">Bik 6.9</ref></char></note>”»<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi manzo mwolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luk 6.47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />«Mu obo, nswe mbwuru wu aagyughu mandagha ma ndyele me ma ya salala mo, nde li efaana kii baghala nga-a-mayele wu aatwu nzo a nde ŋa yulu a limeẽ. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Mvulu bu anoõ, ndwuru yigyi, efulu egyi ya enyihi nzo oyo, lo yo ka yibwi o, mu kuulu batwu bitsini bi nzo oyo ŋa yulu a limeẽ. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Lo nswe wu aagyughu mandagha ma me ma, ya ka asalala mo o, nde li ti baghala wu ewulu wu aatwu nzo a nde ŋa yulu a dzyele. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Mvulu bu anoõ, ndwuru yi gyi, efulu egyi ya enyihi nzo oyo. Nzo yibwi, ya yisaatsaŋama.»<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu kabululuo ya litumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ankoho, mu matala ma ómana Yiisu oluo mandagha mamo, mampwumu ma baara mákiŋimi mu maluo ma nde, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />mu kuulu nde ka ákaluo ti bu ookaluo baluo-mikyene o, lo nde ákaluo ti mbwuru wu li ya litumu.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu nga-a-buala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1.40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Mu matala ma ófi Yiisu ku yulu a munguo, mampwumu ya mampwumu ma baara máyanama nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Ya, nga-a-buala mutsyini áyasele kundaa nde, ya ákunu mabuo mu nsie ŋa nkulu a nde ya ályele nde ti: «Mfumu, kala we dzyi, lo we kughu otsehebe me.» <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yiisu bu alabala kwogho, ábyeme nde ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Me ndzyi, kala wu atsyeme!» Ya ŋaana oŋo, nde átsyeme mu buala bu nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Yiisu áfirilyele kundaa nde ti: «Yughu! Ka lyele kundaa mbwuru ti mumõ o, lo gye yisuo nyuru kundaa ngaa a nzaami, ya yigwa ekaba ki ótumu Moyidze, mu osuo kundaa baara bwohono ti we aadzughu.»<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu musala a mukwuru a bambumbulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luk 7.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43-54">Dzã 4.43-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Mu matala ma ókasomo Yiisu mu bvulu lili Kaperenawume, mfumu a ekuru ki bambumbulu nkama (100) mumõ áyasele kundaa nde ya ábuono nde <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />mu olyele bu: «Mfumu, musala a me baakwoho ku nzo, binama bi nde biikpi, ya nde li mu okamono mpara yi alagha.» <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Me sa ngya ya me sa ndzuhu nde.» <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Lo mukwuru a bambumbulu nkama ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, me ka ndi wu a kughu o kuulu we somo mu nzo a me. Lo tsughu yini a ndagha mõ, ya musala a me sa adzughu. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Mu kuulu, meme si ndi kunsa litumu li bakwuru ba me, ya me ndi a bambumbulu ba aakantumu me. Kala ti me ndyele kundaa mumõ ti: “Gye!”, Lo nde gyene, kala ti me ndyele kundaa wu muke ti: “Gya!”, Lo nde gyi, ya kala ti me ndyele kundaa musala a me ti: “Sa esala ki!”, Lo nde si kye.» <verse eid="MAT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Yiisu bu agyughu obo, nde ákiŋimi ya ályele kundaa ba bákabulunama nde ti: «Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, me nkini aamono mbwuru wu li a kana li linene lili bu mu Isarayele o. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Me ndyele be yo, balagha sa bamara ku ookapala ya ku ookadzyama tala mu oyadza kyiri ebini emõ ya Abarahame, Idzake ya Dzakobe mu Emfumu ki Mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Lo baana ba Emfumu ki Mayulu sa batsili bo kunsa mpyibi yi a laŋa-laŋa yi a ku mbala. Oko sa okala a bilili ya odza myini.» <verse eid="MAT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Ya Yiisu ályele kundaa mukwuru a bambumbulu nkama ti: «Bvughuru ku nzo a we, ya nyaã okala bwunu a bu aasi we kana.» Mu matala maana mamo, musala a nde ádzughu.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu babyele balagha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Yiisu bu asomo ku nzo a Piere, nde ámono buko bu Piere wu mukaha ágyoŋomo mu nkooro a mukaama. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yiisu ábyeme kwogho e nde, ya mukaama áfi. Nde átemene ya ákaba Yiisu bi-odza.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Nkonkolo bu yito, báyabiri kundaa Yiisu baara balagha banga a mifulu mi mibi. Ya mu ndagha a nde, Yiisu ábyi mifulu mimye ya ádzuhu babyele bwohono, <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />mu kuulu mandagha ma, ma áli ólyele mubighili Edzayi makeele: «Nde aagwolo bipfwumu bi bihi ya aabiri leme li mabyele ma bihi-a-be.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Edz 53.4</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba badzyi onama Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luk 9.57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Yiisu bu amono mpwumu a baara yi áadzyi nde, nde ágwi litumu kundaa binduono bagye ya nde mu ngulu yinke yi a mubu. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Muluo-mikyene mumõ áyasele ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Muluo, nswe ku aagye we, me sa nama we.» <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mibagha mili a miŋma mi baakasweme, ya baŋmini ba mayulu bali a manzo, lo Mwana a mbwuru ka li a ŋa aasiili mutswi o.» <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Mukimi mu binduono bi nde ályele kundaa nde ndiri: «Mfumu, gwa me muswa me mangye yindzyighi taara a me.» <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Lo Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Nama me ya nyaã ba bákpi badzyighi bibyimi bi bo.»<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu si ti efulu ki enene edzuunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4.35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Ya Yiisu bu asomo mu bwara bu bunene, binduono bi nde bínama nde. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Ensihibi, efulu ki enene ébwi ofulu ŋa yulu madza ma mubu. Mampo ma madza mábaana oluhu bwara. Lo Yiisu áli mu ensama. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Binduono bígyi ŋa bele a nde, bísiili nde ya bílyele ti: «Mfumu, bvwuhu bihi! Bihi likpi!» <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili a nzalamweẽ? Be baara baba kana li lisala!» Mu obo, nde átemene, áfyeẽ efulu ya madza ma mubu mu ebaghala, ya edzuunu ki enene ékala. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Baara bákiŋimi ya bákalyele ti: «Nsa mbwuru wu, wuulu bifulu ya mubu biikagyughu nde!»<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu banga a mifulu mi mibi buolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Ya Yiisu bu ato mu ngulu a mubu yinke, mu nsie yi a basi Ngadara, baara buolo banga a mifulu mi mibi bápala kunsa mampyeme ya báyabwana nde. Bo báli a ebaghala ki elagha, me mu obo mbwuru ti mumõ ka ákaluru mu nzili oyo o. <verse eid="MAT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Bo bábaana okehe bingubu ti: «Mwana a Nzaami! Nki ndagha yili ŋa kara a bihi ya we? We bu aagyi ŋa mu oyamwehẽ bihi mpara nsomo matala mato?» <verse eid="MAT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Ankoho, la-la ya bo óli a mukaã a bangubulu wu munene wu áakabuludza. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Mifulu mi mibi míbuono Yiisu ya mílyele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti we bihi aabyi, lo gweghe bihi mu mukaã a bangubulu.» <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yiisu ályele kundaa mye ti: «Ligye!» Mifulu mimye mípala ya míyisomo mu bangubulu. Ya mono, mukaã a bangubulu ábwi okumunu ku nsie a munguo mu ntyini, bo báyibwa mu mubu ya bákpi mu madza. <verse eid="MAT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Bankyele ba bangubulu básuru a ntyini ya bábvughuru kunsa bvulu, ya bályele mandagha mwohono mamõ bu máluru, ya mi óbwana a baara banga a mifulu mi mibi. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Mu obo, baara ba bvulu lwohono bápala mu oyibwana Yiisu, ya bu bamono nde, bábuono nde amara mu etsulu e nsie e bo.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mbwuru wu ókpi binama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Yiisu bu asomo mu bwara bu bunene, ápala mubu ya ágyene ku bvulu lili ndaa ndeme. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Baara báyabiri mbwuru wu ókpi binama kundaa nde wu bálaha ŋa yulu a laba. Yiisu bu amono kana li bo, ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala a bukyini mwana a me! Masumu ma we basi mo kolokolo.» <verse eid="MAT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Ankoho, ndaama a baluo-mikyene bákatsimi kunsa mikolo mi bo ti: «Mbwuru wu li mu okatsaala Nzaami!» <verse eid="MAT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Yiisu bu abaghala bitsimi bi bo, ályele ti: «Mu emakye be lili a bitsimi bi bibi mu mikolo mi be? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Nsa ndagha yibvulu oleŋe? Olyele ti: “Masumu ma we basi mo kolokolo”, bwunu we olyele ti: “Temene ya dzyara”? <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Mu kuulu be ligyahaba ti Mwana a mbwuru li a litumu lii osa masumu kolokolo ŋa yulu a nsie.» Mu obo nde ályele kundaa mbwuru wu ókpi binama ti: «Temene, gwolo laba li we ya bvughuru ku nzo a we.» <verse eid="MAT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Baghala átemene ya ágyene ku nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Mampwumu ma baara bu mamono obo, mábagha nzalamweẽ, ya mábwi osyighi Nzaami wu aagwi kundaa baara litumu lili obo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ti Matye mbili mu onama nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yiisu ámara oŋo ágyene. Nde bu ákagye, ámono baghala mumõ, nkwumu a nde Matye, wu áabwi nsini ŋa ebini ki baakatolo mpagha. Nde ályele kundaa nde ti: «Nama me!» Matye átemene ya ánama nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Yiisu bu ákadza mu nzo a Matye, mintolo-mpagha milagha ya banga-a-masumu bágyi mu odza emõ ya nde ya binduono bi nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ba-Faridzyẽ bu bamono obo, bályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Mu emakye Muluo a be ali mu okadza ya mintolo-mpagha ya banga-a-masumu?» <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yiisu bu agyughu obo, ályele ti: «Ka oli baara baba nsiili bali a nzala a ngaa-libughu o, lo babo ba bali babyele. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Ligye ligyighi ndagha yi: “Mukolo wu a nyiĩ me ndzyi, lo ka otsughu me banyama mu mikaba o”. Mu kuulu, me ka aangyi mu ota baara baba bunsumu mbili o, lo mu babo banga-a-masumu.»<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efwulu mu mi mitala okuru nswele mu bala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Binduono bi Dzã bígyene kundaa Yiisu ya bífwulu nde ndiri: «Mu emakye bihi ya ba-Faridzyẽ liikakuru nswele mu bala, lo binduono bi we ka biikakuru nswele mu bala o?» <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Bandughu ba wu aakye bakughu okala kunsa nyiĩ mu matala maala wu aakye li nkini ya bo? Lo bitsughu sa bigya biili sa bamaha wu aakye ŋa kara li bo, me oŋo bo akala baakuru nswele mu bala.»<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />«Ka oli a mbwuru wu kughu olo epighi mu enkuru ki ekulu mu mupa wu munyaghara o. Kala pele mupa munde wu baabwehe sa akaghala enkuru ekye ku oluru. <verse eid="MAT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />Ka baakaloŋono si bviini li linyaghara mu manduru ma makulu mama mu bibaana bi banyama o, kala pele manduru sa makagha, bviini litsaŋama ya manduru mapfighili. Lo bviini li linyaghara okaloŋono mu manduru ma manyaghara mama mu bibaana bi banyama, me obo bakughu okele bye binsa byele.»<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mukaha ya siili mutughu mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5.21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ŋaala Yiisu nkini áli mu okalyele bo mandagha mamo, mu-Dzwife mumõ wu áali mfumu áyabehene, ákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ŋa nkulu a nde, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mwana a me wu mukaha maakpa, lo ya naã kwogho ŋa yulu a nde, ya nde sa akala mweẽ». <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yiisu ya binduono bi nde bu batemene, bánama nde.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Mukaha mutsyini wu ókabulupala makili mu bamvulu kwumu ya buolo (12) ágyi ku mbihi a Yiisu ya ábyeme nto a enkuru e nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Mu kuulu nde ákatsimi kunsa mukolo a nde ti: «Kala me mbagha bu obyeme enkuru e nde, me sa mbvwughu.» <verse eid="MAT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Lo, Yiisu bu akaghala, ámono mukaha munde, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala a bukyini, mwana a me! Kana li we liibvwuhu we.» Ya mu matala maana mamo, mukaha ásaabvwughu.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Yiisu bu ayato ku nzo a mfumu munde, ámono ba baakafulu bilue bi bifaana ti biwebe-a-webe ya mpwumu a baara yi áakalili mu mpini. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Lipala ku mbala be bwohono, mutughu ka aakpi o, nde ensama aagyoŋomo.» Lo bo bábwi osebe nde. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Mpwumu a baara bu yipala ku mbala, Yiisu ásomo mu nzo, ákwara kwogho ki mutughu, ya mutughu ásighili. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Nsia yítsaŋama mu etsulu e nsie kyehene.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu binkpa-mihi byele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Mu matala ma ómara Yiisu ŋa ebini ekye, binkpa-mihi byele bíbwi onama nde ya bíkabulukehe bingubu ti: «Mwana a Dabvide, mono bihi nyiĩ!»<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Yiisu bu ato ku nzo, binkpa-mihi bíyasele ŋa bele a nde, nde áfwulu kundaa bo ti: «Be lili a kana ti me nkughu ogyighili obo?» Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Eẽ, Mfumu!» <verse eid="MAT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Obo me buulu, nde ábyeme mihi mi bo ya ályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Nyaã okala kundaa be bwunu a bu oli kana li be.» <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Mihi mi bo mímono. Ŋa nseele, mu ebaghala, Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Liyighili ogyughu, kparaa, mbwuru si mumõ anyaã osoolo ndagha yi!» <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Lo bo bu bapala, báyitsala nde nsia mu etsulu e nsie kyehene.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu nkini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15">Luk 14.15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Mu matala ma ópala binkpa-mihi, báyabiri nkini wu áali a mufulu wu mubi kundaa Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Yiisu bu abyi mufulu wu mubi munde, nkini ábaana obili. Mampwumu ma baara mákiŋimi ya mályele ndiri: «Bihi nkini límaamono yi a bu mu Isarayele o!» <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Lo ba-Faridzyẽ bákalyele ti: «Mu mpaana a mukwuru a mifulu mi mibi nde ali mu okapaha mifulu mi mibi.»<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mono mampwumu ma baara nyiĩ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:6">Mar 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luk 10.2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Yiisu ákabulugye mu mabvulu ya mala mwohono. Nde ákabululuo mu manzo ma lisamana, ákabulutsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Emfumu ki Mayulu, ya ákabuludzuhu mabyele mwohono ya bipfwumu byehene. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Yiisu bu amono mampwumu ma baara, nde ámono mo nyiĩ kunsa mukolo, mu kuulu mo máli makolo, ya ka máli a bukyini o, <char style="qt">ti anga bindoomo bi bigwene a munkaala bibuolo</char>. <verse eid="MAT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Bi-otolo bilagha mu nseghe, lo ba baatolo bali basala. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Mu obo, libuono mfumu nga-a-nseghe agweghe basala ba balagha ba baatolo mu nseghe a nde.»<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bantumu kwumu ya buolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Yiisu bu ati binduono bi nde kwumu ya byele (12) mbili, nde ágwi bo litumu lili obyi mifulu mi mibi ya odzuhu mabyele mwohono ya bipfwumu byehene. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Ma me mankwumu ma bantumu kwumu ya buolo (12): Wu a nsomo Simõ ya Andere mbwee a nde, Dzake ya Dzã mbwee a nde, baana ba Nzebede <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" />Filipe ya Baretelemi, Toma ya Matye muntolo-mpagha, Dzake mwana a Alefe ya Tade, <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simõ mu-Nzelote ya Yuda Isikaryote, munde wu átyeghe Yiisu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gweghe bantumu kwumu ya buolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar 6.7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Ba me baara kwumu ya buolo (12) ba ógweghe Yiisu ya ba ályele nde ti: «Ka ligye kundaa baara baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o, ya ka lisomo mu bvulu si limõ lili basi Samari o. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Lo ligye ku oli bindoomo bi nzo a Isarayele bi bídzimini. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Bu lili mu okabulugye, likabululuo ya okabululyele ti: “Emfumu ki Mayulu eeyabehene!” <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Lidzuhu babyele, lisiili ba bákpi mu lipfu, litsehebe banga-a-buala, libyi mifulu mi mibi. Be liibagha kuu ogwene ogwa nzi, ligwa si kuu ogwene oluomo nzi. <verse eid="MAT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />Ka ligwolo si oore o, ngu okala ngele, ngu okala nzi mu miswele mi bala mi be, <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />ngu okala empogholo, ngu okala binkuru byele bi bila, ngu okala bikoghoro, ngu okala mukaana. Mu kuulu musala faana obagha bi-odza bi nde.»<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />«Ŋa liisomo be mu bvulu bwunu we mu bula, lifwulu kala ti oli a mbwuru wu a kughu mu ogyagha be, ya likala mu nzo a nde tee matala ma liimara be oŋo. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Ŋa liisomo be munsa nzo a baara, ligwa bo mboro. <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Kala ti nzo oyo yili yi a kughu, lo nyaã edzuunu e be ekala mu yo. Lo kala ti yo ka yili yi a kughu o, lo nyaã edzuunu e be ebvughuru kundaa beme. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Nswe munde wu agwene ogyagha be ya wu agwene ogyughu mandagha ma be, lipala munsa nzo oyo, bwunu we bvulu lilo, likubulu lifufunu li myili mi be. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti: Mu etsughu kii Muyala, baara ba bvulu lilo sa babagha masyeme ma mabvulu mama baara ba Sodome ya Ngomore.»<verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimini li lili mu ogya ku nkulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Mar 13.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luk 21.12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />«Ligyughu, me ngweghe be ti bindoomo ŋa kara li bango. Likala yeelee ti bantaala, ya likala a mikolo mi mitsyeme ti anga mabeeme. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Lisa mayele mu baara, mu kuulu bo sa batyeghe be ku mambala ma miyala ya bo sa bakaha be nswa-nswa munsa manzo ma bo mama lisamana. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Sa babiri be ŋa nkulu a bamfumu ba bitsulu bi mansie ya mikogho, mu nkooro a me, me oŋo be liikala bumpughulu bu me ŋa nkulu a bo, ya kundaa baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Ŋa akala baatyeghe be, ka likala a nzalamweẽ o ti bunu liibili bwunu we mayo liilyele, mu kuulu mu matala mamo, sa bagwa be mandagha ma akala liibili. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Ka be akala liibili o, lo Mufulu a Taara a be akala aabili mu be.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />Mwana a taara sa atyeghe mwana a taara mu lipfu, ya taara sa atyeghe mwana a nde. Baana sa bakala mitaara mi bataara ya bangughu ba bo, ya sa batumu baara badzwa bo. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Baara bwohono sa babele be mu nkooro a nkwumu a me. Lo munde wu aasa mukama tee ku masini, nde sa abvwughu. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Mu matala ma akala baamwehẽ be mpara mu bvulu limõ, libara mu bvulu li like. Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti, be ka limana odzeŋene mabvulu ma Isarayele mwohono o, nsomo-a-nsomo Mwana a mbwuru agya.»<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />«Enduono ka eluru muluo a kye o, ya nkana si mumõ ka luru mfumu a nde o. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Ofaana okala ti enduono ekala ti muluo a kye ya nkana akala ti mfumu a nde. Kala ti bati mfumu a nzo Beledzebule, lo mayo baagwene olyele mu ba bali munsa nzo a nde?»<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />«Mu obo ka libara bo o! Mandagha mwohono ma másweme sa mamoŋono, mansweghe mwohono sa basoolo mo. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Mandagha ma aandyele me be kunsa mpyibi, be lilyele mo mu mwiĩ wu ebala. Mandagha ma liikagyughu be mu mamfwunu, be lita mo mukwughu ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">see li nzo lili eyala</char><char style="ft" closed="false">see li nzo li batwu mu ebagha kii eyala. Ku yulu a see lilo baara bákabwa nsini mu okamoŋo, mu okasamana ya mu okagwolo mpyee mu nkonkolo.</char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Ka likabara baara ba baakadzwa nyuru o, lo ka bakughu odzwa muwumunu o. Lo liikabara munde wuulu kughu odzihibi muwumunu ya nyuru ku mungele a mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />Ka baakatyeghe binswini-a-nswini byele mu mupara mumõ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mupara mumõ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mufuru wu a esala wu etsughu etsyini o</char></note>. Lo emõ mu bye ka ekughu obwa ŋa nsie o, kala ti Taara a be ka gwi muswa o. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Ya kundaa be, si okala mfu a be, Nzaami soolo mutala a yo yohono. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Mu obo, ka likala a nzalamweẽ o! Be libvulu binswini-a-nswini bi bilagha mu mupfunu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />«Mu obo, nswe munde wu aakihi ŋa nkulu a baara ti nde li wu a me, lo mehe si sa nkihi ti nde li wu a me ŋa nkulu a Taara a me wu li ku mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Lo nswe munde wu aatunu me ŋa nkulu a baara, lo mehe si sa ntunu nde ŋa nkulu a Taara a me wu li ku mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka oli edzuunu o, lo mamvulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luk 12.51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14.26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />«Ka litsimi o ti me aayambiri edzuunu ŋa nsie. Me ka aangyi mu oyabiri edzuunu o, lo lipee. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Me aangyi mu okabala mumpala ya taara a nde, mutughu ya ngughu a nde, mukala a mwana ya buko bu nde wu mukaha. <verse eid="MAT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />Ya mitaara mi mbwuru, sa mikala baara ba bali ya nde munsa nzo a ndeme».<verse eid="MAT 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />«Nswe munde wu dzyi taara a nde, bwunu we ngughu a nde ku obvulu me, nde ka faana mu okala wu a me o. Nswe munde wu dzyi mwana a nde wu baghala bwunu we wu mukaha ku obvulu me, nde ka faana okala wu a me o. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Nswe munde wu aagwene obiri kuruwa li nde ya onama me, ka faana okala wu a me o. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />Munde wu aakele laama li nde, sa apfihili lo, ya munde wu aapfihili laama li nde mu nkooro a me, sa afiribagha lo.»<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munde wu aabwana a be, me abwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Mar 9.41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />«Nswe munde wu aabwana a be, lo meme nde abwana, ya munde wu aabwana a me bwana a munde wu áagweghe me. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />Nswe munde wu aabwana a mubighili mu kuulu nde li mubighili, sa abagha mufuru wu baakagwa mubighili. Ya nswe munde wu aabwana a mbwuru wu li nsumu mu kuulu nde li nsumu, nde sa abagha mufuru wu a mbwuru wu li nsumu. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />Nswe munde wu aagwa si ebaha ki madza mama mudzili kundaa mumõ mu bike-bike bi mu kuulu kye eli enduono e me, mu engaŋma me ndyele be ti, nde ka apfihili mufuru a nde o.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dzã Muboghoro gweghe bantumu kundaa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Yiisu bu amana ogwa mikyene mimye kundaa binduono bi nde kwumu ya byele (12), nde ámara oŋo, áyiluo ya áyitsala nsia yi mbwe mu mabvulu ma bo. <verse eid="MAT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Ya Dzã, munsa boloko mu áli nde, ágyughu bu bákabili mu bigyighili bi Kriste. Nde ágweghe binduono bi nde, <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />mu oyifwulu kundaa nde ti: «We me munde wu li mu ogya, bwunu we mukimi bihi lifaana okebe?» <verse eid="MAT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ligye lilyele kundaa Dzã mi lili mu ogyughu ya omono: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />Binkpa-mihi bili mu omono, bikara bili mu odzyara, banga-a-buala bali mu otsyeme, binkpa-matswi bili mu ogyughu, ba bákpi bali mu osighili mu lipfu, ya bali mu otsala Nsia yi Mbwe kundaa bawele. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Esee kundaa munde wu aagwene obwihi kana li nde mu nkooro a me!»<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Binduono bibye bu bibvughuru, Yiisu ábwi obili kundaa mampwumu mu mi mitala Dzã: «Emakye be liiyitala ku syehe? Edzyara ki oli mu okanyihi efulu? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Bu be emakye liiyimono? Baghala wu aalaha binkuru bibi ntala? Bu tala babo ba baakalaha binkuru bi bibwe mu manzo ma mikogho baakakala. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Emakye be liiyimono? Mubighili, eẽ? Me ndyele kundaa be ti, nde bvulu ku oluru ya mubighili. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Me mu mi mitala nde básono bu: <char style="qt">Mono, me ntswahaba ntumu a me ku nkulu a we, mu ogyighili nzili a we</char>. <verse eid="MAT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" /><char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele be yo: Ŋa kara li ba báburu mu mukaha, ka oli a mbwuru wu áli wu bvulu Dzã Muboghoro o. Lo wu bvulu bugye mu Emfumu ki Mayulu bvulu nde mu bukwuru. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Obaana mu matala ma Dzã Muboghoro tee mu matala ma, bali mu odzwana a Emfumu ki Mayulu mu mpini. Me banga-a-ngirini bali mu okagwohono kye. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Mu kuulu mibighili myehene, ya Mukyene a Moyidze míkabighili tee mu matala ma Dzã. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Kala ti be likughu okihi yo, me nde, Eli wu áakaagya. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />Nyaã nga-a-matswi, agyughu!<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />Ya nande me nkughu obvughu eseene ki? Kye efaana ti anga bike-bike bi biibwi nsini ŋa mbala a baara bwohono, ya bili mu okalyele mu mpini kundaa bambaala bike-bike ti:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />“Bihi liifulu be bilue bi bifaana ti biwebe-a-webe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">lo be ka liikini o.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">Bihi liigyimi ekwumu kii lipfu, lo be ka liilili o!”<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />Mu kuulu Dzã aagyi, nde ka akadza ya okaŋma o, ya baara baalyele ti: “Nde li a mufulu wu mubi!” <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Mwana a mbwuru aagyi, nde li mu okabuludza ya okabuluŋma, ya bo bali mu okalyele ti: “Nde li nga-a-elyili ya enkolo-mala, ndughu a mintolo-mpagha ya banga-a-masumu!” Lo Bunsughu buumoŋono bubu nsumu mu bigyighili bi nde.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabvulu ma mabihi osa kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, Yiisu ábwi ofyeẽ mabvulu mamo mu ási nde emvulu-ngughu ki bimamaã bi nde, mu kuulu mo ka mágyiŋi mayele o. <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />«Nyiĩ kundaa we bvulu lili Koradzine! Nyiĩ kundaa we, bvulu lili Betesayida! Mu kuulu kala ti bimamaã bi bási ŋa kara li be mu mabvulu mama Tire ya Sidõ bási bye, nkini li edzighi baara baba oko bakaalaha mangooro ya ogyogho lifuru a mbaa mu osuo ti bo baagyiŋi mayele. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Mu obo me ndyele be ti: Mu etsughu kii mumfwunu a baara, ebili e be sa ebvulu kii Tire ya Sidõ. <verse eid="MAT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />Ya we bvulu lili Kaperenawume, sa bakuhubu we tee ku yulu? Pele! Sa basurulu we tee ku nsie a ba bákpi! Mu kuulu kala ti bimamaã bi bási ŋa kara li we, áli ku Sodome bási bye, nkini bvulu lilo lili tee lolo bu. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Me obo me ndyele be ti: Mu etsughu kii mumfwunu a baara, ebili kii nsie a Sodome sa ebvulu busala ya kii we».<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obagha bumpoholo kundaa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luk 10.21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Mu matala mamo Yiisu ályele ti: «Me nsyighi we Taara, Mfumu a yulu ya nsie, mu kuulu we aasweghe mandagha mamo ŋa mihi mi bansughu ya banga-a-mayele, lo we aasuo mo kundaa bike-bike. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Eẽ, Taara, we aadzyi ti okala obo.»<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />«Taara a me ágwi me byehene. Ka oli a mbwuru si mumõ wu soolo Mwana o, kala ka oli yini a Taara o. Ya ka oli a munde wu soolo Taara o, kala ka oli yini a Mwana o ya munde wu odzyi Mwana osuo kundaa Taara.»<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />«Ligya kundaa me, be bwohono ba liikolo mu obiri maleme, ya me sa ngwa be bumpoholo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Lilaha nkogholo a me ya ligyighi kundaa me, mu kuulu me ndi wu adzuunu ya me ndi a mukolo wu a bunya-nyaã, ya be sa libagha ogwumu ku miwumunu mi be. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Mu kuulu nkogholo a me ka yili a mpara mu obiri o, ya leme lili ndaa me lileŋe.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ya etsughu kii sabate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2.23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Mu matala mamo, Yiisu ákaluru munsa manseghe ma bele, mu etsughu kii sabate. Binduono bi nde bífuru nzala ya bíbwi oka binsia bi bimburu ya odza bye. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ba-Faridzyẽ bu bamono obo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Mono, binduono bi we bili mu ogyighili mi bálighi ogyighili mu etsughu kii sabate». <verse eid="MAT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Lo Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Bunu, be kálitaã mi ógyighili Dabvide o, mu matala ma ófuru nde nzala ya ba bákakala ya nde? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Bunu-abo nde ásomo mu Nzo a nzaami, ya áli mampa ma bágwi ekaba kundaa Nzaami, maala nde ya ba bákakala ya nde ka báli a muswa mu odza o, lo yini a bangaa ba nzaami? <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Bwunu we be ka lítaã mu Mukyene o ti, mu etsughu kii sabate, munsa Nzo a nzaami, bangaa ba nzaami baakatsumunu ngili a etsughu kii sabate ku ogwene a obagha ebili? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Lo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Oli ŋa, yibvulu Nzo a nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" />Kala ti áli liigyahaba mbaala a bisono bi: <char style="qt">Me ki ndzyi mukolo wu a nyiĩ, lo ka okadzwa banyama mu bikaba o</char>, nkini be ka likaakagwa ebili kundaa baara ba bagwene osoolo ndagha o. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Buulu Mwana a mbwuru li Mfumu a sabate.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baghala nga a kwogho ki ekpi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:6">Mar 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yiisu bu amara oŋo, ágyene munsa nzo a bo yi lisamana. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Mu nsa omo, óli a baghala wu áali a kwogho ki ekee. Ba-Faridzyẽ bu bákasagha ndagha yi baaburulu nde, bágwi nde efwulu ki: «Bunu, oli a muswa mu odzuhu mubyele mu etsughu kii sabate?» <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Ya Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Nande ŋa kara li be wuulu kala ti nde li a endoomo etsyini, ya kye ebwi mu dzunu mu etsughu kii sabate, nde ka ayipaha kye o? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Buta mbwuru bvulu mupfunu ya endoomo! Mu obo, oli a muswa mu ogyighili bubwe mu etsughu kii sabate.» <verse eid="MAT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Oŋo nde ályele kundaa baghala ti: «Labala kwogho e we». Nde álabala kye ya kye ébvughuru nsiili ti kwogho ki eke. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Ba-Faridzyẽ bu bapala, bákuru mfwunu yi osagha bunu baadzwa Yiisu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu li musala wu osuolo Nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yiisu bu asoolo obo, ámara oŋo. Ya mampwumu ma baara malagha mákanama nde, ya nde ádzuhu bo bwohono. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Yiisu átswi bo mukele, banyaã otsala nde nsia ti nde na ali, <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />mu kuulu mandagha ma ólyele mubighili Edzayi matswighi:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />«<char style="qt">Mono musala a me wu aanswolo me</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">wu ndzyi me, ya mu nde me aankamono esee</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Me sa ntwulu Mufulu a me mu nde</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">ya nde sa alyele bunsumu kundaa baara ba mansie</char>.<verse eid="MAT 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />
    <char style="qt">Nde ka baŋana ya mbwuru o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">
    <char style="qt">ka akehe bingubu o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:19">
    <char style="qt">ka bagyughu likyi li nde mu minsagha o</char>.<verse eid="MAT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />
    <char style="qt">Nde ka abogholo edzyara ki bamaafuru o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">nde ka adzihibi musyi a mwindi wu li nkini mu okatsuru o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">tee ŋa aasa nde ti bunsumu bulughulu</char>.<verse eid="MAT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />
    <char style="qt">Ya bikaana byehene sa bisa emiini mu nkwumu a nde</char>.»<verse eid="MAT 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ya Beledzebule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:22-30">Mar 3.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Báyabiri kundaa Yiisu mbwuru mumõ wu áali a mufulu wu mubi, nde áli enkpa-mihi ya nkini. Yiisu ádzuhu nde. Mbwuru wu áali nkini ábwi obili ya ábwi omono. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Mampwumu ma baara mwohono mákiŋimi ya mályele ti: «Wu ka Mwana a Dabvide o?» <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Lo ba-Faridzyẽ bu bagyughu obo, bályele ti: «Mbwuru wu mu lileene li Beledzebule, mfumu a mifulu mi mibi, ali mu okabyi mifulu mi mibi.» <verse eid="MAT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Yiisu bu agyahaba bitsimi bi bo, ályele kundaa bo ti: «Kala ti baara ba bali a emfumu baakadzwana bo-a-bo, lo emfumu ekye sa ebwa. Ya baara baba bvulu bwunu we baba dzumu limõ kala ti bakaghaba, bvulu lilo bwunu we dzumu lilo ka lilaama o. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Kala ti Satana byi Satana, lo nde li mu okaghaba ya ndeme, bunu-a-bo emfumu e nde ekughu olaama? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Kala ti me mu lileene li Beledzebule ndi mu okabyi mifulu mi mibi, lo baana ba be mu lili nande baakabyi mye? Mu obo, bomo sa bakala bansunghu-a-lamana ba be. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Lo, kala ti mu Mufulu a Nzaami me ndi mu okabyi mifulu mi mibi, lo Emfumu e Nzaami ayi eeyato kundaa be. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Bwunu we, bunu-a-bo mbwuru akughu osomo mu nzo a nga-a-mpini ya ogwolo bilogho bi nde byehene, kala ti nde ka tswama okuru nde misyi o? Lo, nde amana osa obo, nde kughu ogwohono byehene bi bili mu nzo a nde.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />Nswe munde wuulu ka ali ya me o, li mutaara a me, ya munde wu aagwene obvughu baara ya me, nde li mu otsala.<verse eid="MAT 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Me mu obo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Sa basa baara kolokolo mu masumu ma bo mwohono ya otsaala kwohono, lo munde wu aatsaala Mufulu a Ngili ka bakughu osa nde kolokolo o. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />Ya kala ti mbwuru lyele ndagha yi mbi mu Mwana a mbwuru, sa basa nde kolokolo. Lo munde wu aabili bubi mu Mufulu a Ngili, ka basa nde kolokolo o, ngu okala mu matala ma, ngu okala mu matala ma maagya.»<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muti ya bimburu bi nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luk 6.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />«Kala ti muti li mubwe, lo bimburu bi nde si bili bi bibwe. Ya kala ti muti li mubi, lo bimburu bi nde si bili bi bibi. Mu kuulu muti okagyahaba nde mu bimburu bi nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Etswumu ki bampili ki! Bunu-abo be likughu olyele mandagha ma mabwe, ŋaala be lili baara ba babi? Mu kuulu mandagha ma maakapala mu muŋma, me ma maalwulu mu mukolo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />Mbwuru wu mubwe aakapaha bilogho bi bibwe bi bili mu nkiri-mbughu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkiri-mbughu, ebini ki baakasweghe busini. </char></note> a nde yi mbwe. Mbwuru wu mubi aakapaha bilogho bi bibi bi bili mu nkiri-mbughu a nde yi mbi. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Me ndyele kundaa be ti: Mu etsughu kii Muyala, nswe mbwuru sa agwa mvuru mu mandagha ma magwene a mupfunu ma ápaha mu muŋma a nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Me mu mbiili a we, we akala alughulu, ya me mu mbiili a we, we akala abwa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Baara baluomo elyimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luk 11.29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Ŋaana oŋo, baluo-mikyene bana ya ba-Faridzyẽ babake bályele kundaa Yiisu ndiri: «Muluo, bihi lidzyi ti we, we suo bihi elyimi nga-emõ.» <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Eseene kii lolo, ki eli ebi ya ki eegwene okanama Nzaami eli mu oluomo elyimi! Lo ka oli a elyimi ki baasuo kundaa be o, kala ti ka oli yini a elyimi kii mubighili Dzonase o. <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" /><char style="qt">Bwunu a bu ósi Dzonase bitsughu bitere ya mampyibi matere munsa mweẽ a nswi wu munene</char>, bwunu obo si Mwana a mbwuru aasa bitsughu bitere ya mampyibi matere ku nsini a nsie. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Mu etsughu kii muyala, baara baba bvulu li Ninibve sa batemene ya bafwunu baara baba eseene ki. Bo sa babwihi eseene ki, buulu baara ba Ninibve bágyiŋi mayele mu maluo ma Dzonase. Lo oli ŋa, wu bvulu Dzonase. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Mu etsughu kii muyala, Ngasa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngasa, mukogho wu mukaha</char></note> wu a nsie yi a Sude, sa atemene ya afwunu eseene ki, ya sa abwihi kye, mu kuulu Ngasa ámara ku bitsulu bi nsie bi bibvulu la mu oyagyughu bunsughu bu Salomõ. Lo oli ŋa, wu bvulu Salomõ!»<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Obvughuru o mufulu wu mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luk 11.24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />«Ŋa ookapala mufulu wu mubi mu nyuru a mbwuru, nde aakagye mu bibini bibi syehe mu okabulusagha ŋa aagwumu. Lo kala ti nde ka abagha kye o, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />oŋo nde aalyele bu: “Me mbvughuru ku nzo a me yi nkulu, omo mu áampala me”. Ya nde bu ayabvughuru, nde sa ayabagha yo mukaŋana, yi bagyighili okuomo ya bunkere. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Oŋo nde aayigwolo ya nde mifulu nsaama mikimi mi mibvulu nde mu bubi, mye myehene misomo ya mibagha bibini omo. Bunsiili bu mbwuru munde bubu masini sa bubvulu bubi ya bubu nsomo. Bwunu obo si ookala mu eseene ki ebi ki.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngughu ya bambwee ba Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yiisu áli nkini mu okabili kundaa mampwumu ma baara, ngughu ya bambwee ba nde bátemene ku mbala ya bákasagha obili ya nde. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />[Mbwuru mumõ áyalyele kundaa nde ti: «Ngughu a we ya bambwee ba we bali ku mbala ya badzyi obili ya we.»] <verse eid="MAT 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa munde wu áakabili ya nde ndiri: «Nande li ngughu a me? Ya bana bali bambwee ba me?» <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Ŋa nseele nde álabala kwogho kundaa binduono bi nde ya ályele ti: «Limono ngughu a me ya bambwee ba me. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />Nswe munde wu aasa waa li Taara a me wu li mu mayulu, me munde li mbwee bwunu we naana a me wu baghala, nkele a me, ya ngughu a me.»<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mukunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Mu etsughu ekye, Yiisu bu apala mu nzo, áyabwa nsini ŋa mukogho a mubu. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Mampwumu ma baara malagha máyabvuŋunu ŋa bele a nde, ya mu obo, nde ásomo munsa bwara ya ábwi nsini, ya mpwumu a baara yohono yísyili mu mukogho a madza. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Mu mankumu, nde ályele mandagha malagha kundaa bo ti: «Mukunu mutsyini ápala mu oyinyahala nsia mu nseghe.<verse eid="MAT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Mu matala ma ákanyahala nde nsia, ndaama a nsia yíbwi mu mukogho a nzili. Baŋmini bágyi ya bátooro yo yohono. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Yinke yíbwi mu oli mameẽ, ŋaala nsie ka yíli yi alagha o. Yo yímene mu maswa, lo mu nkooro a nsie yiili ka yíli a mubighi o, <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />mwiĩ bu abala ya buulu misumunu ka míli a midza o, mye mídzighi ya míkee. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Yinke yíbwi kunsa mingaama, ya mingaama bu mikulu mísi yo mpiŋi. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Yinke yíbwi mu nsie yi mbwe ya yíburu bimburu: Yini bimburu nkama (100), yinke bimburu makwumu masemene (60), ya yimõ bimburu makwumu matere (30). <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />Munde wu li a matswi, agyughu!»<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mu emakye Yiisu aakabili mu mankumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar 4.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Binduono bu biyasele kundaa nde, bífwulu nde ti: «Mu emakye we li mu okabulubili ya bo mu mankumu?» <verse eid="MAT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Kundaa be baagwi bwehe ba osoolo mpaana a Emfumu ki Mayulu, lo ka kundaa bo o. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Mu kuulu, kundaa munde wu li a elogho, sa bafirigwa nde, ya sa akala a bye bi bilagha, lo kundaa munde wu gwene a elogho, sa bamaha nde ekye ki ali a nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Me mu obo me ndi mu okabulubili ya bo mu mankumu, mu kuulu si kala ti bo batala, lo bo omono we, ya si kala ti bo banama, lo bo ogyughu we ya obaghala we, <verse eid="MAT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />ya mpaala mandagha ma ma ólyele mubighili Edzayi makeele mu bo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">Be sa ligyighili ogyughu, lo ka libaghala o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">Be sa ligyighili otala, lo ka limono o</char>.<verse eid="MAT 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />
    <char style="qt">Mu kuulu mukolo a ekaana ki ayi aakubu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">bo baakuru matswi ma bo ya baadzwi mihi mi bo</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">Mu kuulu banyaã omono mu mihi mi bo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ya banyaã ogyughu mu matswi ma bo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ya banyaã obaghala mu mikolo mi bo</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">Ya bakwono ogyiŋi mayele</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">ya me ndzuhu bo</char>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Edz 6.9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>.»<verse eid="MAT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />«Esee kundaa be mu kuulu mihi mi be mili mu omono, ya matswi ma be mali mu ogyughu. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" /><char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Mibighili milagha ya baara baba bunsumu balagha bákasagha omono mi lili mu omono be, lo bo ka bámono mye o, bákasagha ogyughu mi lili mu ogyughu be, lo ka bágyughu mye o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:10-12">1 Pie 1.10-12</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu baala nkumu yi a mukunu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar 4.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />«Be me baala ligyughu mbaala a nkumu yi a mukunu: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Ba baakagyughu ndagha a Emfumu e Nzaami ya bakwono obaghala, bo bali efaana kii mukogho a nzili munde wu oobwi mburu. Wu Mubi agwolo gyi ya gwohono byehene bi baakunu mu mikolo mi bo. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Nsie yi a mameẽ mu oobwi mburu, me munde wuulu bu agyughu ndagha a Nzaami, gyagha yo maswa-maswa ya esee. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Lo, nde ka li a midza mu ndeme o, nde mbwuru wu gwene a mukama. Ya ŋa oogya mpara bwunu we makimini mu nkooro a Ndagha a Nzaami, ŋaana-oŋo nde bwi. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Nsie yi a mingaama mu oobwi mburu, me munde wu gyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, lo minyoõ mi nsie ya ntono a busini biikasa Ndagha a Nzaami mpiŋi ya yo ka yiikaburu bimburu o. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Nsie yi mbwe mu oobwi mburu, me munde wuulu bu agyughu Ndagha a Nzaami, baghala yo. Nde aakaburu bimburu, limõ ligwi nkama (100) a bimburu, lini ligwi bimburu makwumu-masemene (60), li like ligwi bimburu makwumu-matere (30).»<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a esagha ki ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu nkimi. Nde ti: «Emfumu ki Mayulu efaana ya mbwuru wu aakunu nsia yimbwe mu nseghe a nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Mu matala maala baara baagyoŋomo ensama, mutaara a nde gyi, kunu nsia a esagha ki ebi ŋa kara li bele ya gyene. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Bele limene ya liburu binsia, esagha ki ebi si epala. <verse eid="MAT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />Basala ba mfumu nga-a-nzo bagyi ya balyele kundaa nde ndiri: “Mfumu, bunu, we ka oli nsia yimbwe aakanu mu nseghe a we o? Bu esagha ki ebi ki kunu-ako eefi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Nde bvuhulu kundaa bo ti: “Me mutaara aasi obo.” Basala balyele kundaa nde ti: “Bunu, we dzyi ti bihi liyitumunu esagha ekye?” <verse eid="MAT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />Nde lyele kundaa bo ti: “Pele! Mara bu litolo esagha ki ebi, be litumunu si bele nzili mõ ya kye. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Linyaã bye binsa byele bikulu tee ku baatolo bimburu. Ya mu matala ma baatolo, me sa ndyele kundaa ba baatolo ti: Limatswama otolo bisagha bi bibi, likuru bye mu biko ya litsughu bye mbaa. Ŋa nseele be likwu bele kunsa etaghala e me.”»<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a nsia a muti a mutaade</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu nkimi ti: «Emfumu ki Mayulu efaana ti nsia a muti wu a nkwumu mutaade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutaade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">liburu li libvulu busala mu nsia yo yohono.</char></note> yi ogwolo mbwuru ya akunu mu nseghe a nde. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Yo yibvulu busala mu nsia yo yohono. Lo ŋa yiikapala yo, yo yiikabvulu miswoho myehene mimi mu ebwa mutele. Yo yiikakala muti wuulu baŋmini ba yulu baakayatwu manzo ma bo mu mampala ma nde.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a pfini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luk 13.20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yiisu áfirita bo nkumu nkimi ti: «Emfumu ki Mayulu efaana a pfini li oogwolo mukaha ya atwulu mu mankpaã matere ma farine, tee ku oofuulu mankpaã ma farine mwohono.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluo mu mankumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar 4.33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Mandagha mwohono mamo Yiisu ákalyele mo kundaa mampwumu ma baara bwohono mu mankumu. Ya nde ka ákabili ya bo ku ogwene a ma mankumu o. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Mu kuulu mandagha ma áli olyele mubighili makeele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">Me sa ndzubulu muŋma a me mu obili mu mankumu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">me sa ndyele bo mandagha mama ensweghe obaana mu ebaana e nsie</char>.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Bik 78.2</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu baala nkumu yi a esagha ki ebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Yiisu bu abulusihi mampwumu ma baara, áyisomo mu nzo, ya binduono bi nde bíyasele kundaa nde, ya bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Gwa bihi mbaala a nkumu yi a esagha ki ebi mu nseghe.» <verse eid="MAT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Munde wu aakanyahala nsia yi mbwe me Mwana a Mbwuru. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Nseghe me nsie, nsia yi mbwe me baana ba Emfumu ki Mayulu, esagha ki ebi me baana ba Nga-a-bubi. <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />Mutaara wu aakanyahala nsia a esagha ki ebi me dyabulu, otolo bimburu me masini ma nsie, ba baakatolo bimburu me bangye-yulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />Mu obo, bwunu a bu baakatumunu esagha ki ebi ya otsughu kye kyehene ku mbaa, me obo si akala ookala ku etsughu kii masini ma nsie. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Mwana a mbwuru sa agweghe bangye-yulu ba nde. Bo sa bapaha mu Emfumu e nde, byehene bi biikabwihi baara mu masumu, ya ba baakagyighili bubi. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Ya sa batsili bo kunsa mungele a mbaa, oko ku ookala bilili ya odza myini. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Oŋo banga-a-bunsumu sa basehene ti anga tala mu Emfumu e Taara a bo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:3">Dan 12.3</ref></char></note>. Nyaã nga-a-matswi, agyughu!»<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Busini bu básweghe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />«Emfumu ki Mayulu efaana ti busini bu básweghe kunsa nseghe, buulu mbwuru ámono bo, áfirisweghe bo. Mu emiini kyehene, nde sa ayityeghe bilogho bi nde byehene ya ayaswumu nseghe oyo.»<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi nsia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />«Emfumu ki Mayulu efirifaana ti munta-nkaala wu li mu okabulusagha nsia a bolo yi mbwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />Bu amono lisia limõ lili ntala yi alagha, nde yityeghe bye byehene bi ali a bye, ya yaswumu lisia lilo.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi likoho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />«Emfumu ki Mayulu efaana ti likoho li batubu mu mubu li likogho banswi baba mawa-mawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Bu lilwulu, bilebe-banswi bidzuru lo mu mukogho a madza, ya baara bu babwi nsini mu mukogho, babwi osuolo banswi ba babwe ba baalo mu mankuru ya batsili ba bagwene a mupfunu. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Bwunu obo si ookala mu etsughu ki masini ma nsie. Bangye-yulu sa bagya, sa bakabala ba babi ya ba banga-a-bunsumu, <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />ya sa batsili ba babi ku mungele a mbaa. Oko ku ookala bilili ya odza myini.»<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bilogho bi bikulu ya bi binyaghara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />«Bunu, be liibaghala mandagha mwohono ma?» Bo bakihi ti: «Eẽ.»<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Obo me buulu, nswe muluo-mikyene wu báluo mu mi mitala Emfumu ki Mayulu, faana ti mfumu nga-a-nzo wu paha munsa nkiri-mbughu a nde, bilogho bi binyaghara ya bi bikulu.»<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basi Nadzarete ba bihi osa kana mu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar 4.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Yiisu bu amana ota mankumu mamo, ámara oŋo. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Bu agyi ku etsulu e nsie e ndeme, ku Nadzarete nde ábwi oluo bo mu nzo a lisamana a bomo ya bo bwohono ba bákagyughu nde bákiŋimi ya bályele ti: «Kunu oofi nde bunsughu bu ya bimaã bi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Bunu, wu ka li mwana a munkomo-manzo o? Ngughu a nde ka Mari o? Ya Dzake, Dzodzefe, Simõ ya Yude ka bali bambwee ba nde o? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Ya bankele ba nde bwohono ka ba bali ŋa kara li bihi o? Kunu-ako nde aabagha myehene mi?» <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Bo bákakubu makya mu nkooro a nde. Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mubighili, ka baakagwa nde budiziri bibini byehene, lo ka mu nsie a ndeme ya mu dzumu li ndeme o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Dzã 4.44</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="MAT 13:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Ya oko Yiisu ka ási bimaã bilagha o, mu kuulu bo ka báli a kana o.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s1">Lipfu li Dzã Muboghoro</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Mu matala mamo, Erode mfumu a Ngalile, ágyughu nsia a Yiisu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />ya ályele kundaa basala ba nde ti: «Munde Dzã Muboghoro aasighili ŋa kara li ba bápki! Ya me mu obo nde ali a lileene lili okabulusa bimaã».<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Mu kuulu, Erode áli agwi litumu basyimi Dzã, bakuru nde misyi ya balo nde mu boloko mu nkooro a Erodyade, mukala a Filipe, mbwee a nde<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6.17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Mu kuulu Dzã ákalyele kundaa nde ti: «We ka li a muswa wu ogwolo mukaha munde o<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:16">Bun 18.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Erode ákadzyi odzwa Dzã, lo nde ákabara mpwumu a baara mu kuulu yo yíkamono ti Dzã li mubighili.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Lo etsughu kii kyiri ki ndibili-a-mweẽ a etsughu ki báburu Erode bu eto, mwana a Erodyade wu mukaha áyakini ŋa nkulu a baara ba ógwi Erode mampighi, ya Erode ámono esee mu nde. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Mu obo Erode ágwi nde misiini ya álaba mukihi ti: «Nswe elogho ki aaluomo we me, me sa ngwa we kye». <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Mu luo li ngughu a nde, nde ályele kundaa Erode ti: «Gwa me ŋa munsa ndoõ mutswi a Dzã Muboghoro!» <verse eid="MAT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Mukogho ányoõ, lo mu nkooro a mukihi wu aalaba ya mu nkooro a baara ba aagwi nde mpighi, nde ágwi litumu bayabiri nde mutswi a Dzã. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Erode átumu baara munsa boloko bayikehe Dzã bolo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Báyabiri mutswi a Dzã munsa ndoõ ya bágwi nde kundaa mutughu, ya mutughu ágyene a nde kundaa ngughu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Binduono bi Dzã bígyi, bígwolo ebyimi e nde ya bídzyighi kye. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, bo báyitwoho nsia kundaa Yiisu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu buŋunu mafwunu mataana ma babaghala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Dzã 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Yiisu bu agyughu nsia oyo, nde ámara oŋo mu bwara ya ágyene ngasighi ku nkolo yi gwene a baara. Lo mampwumu ma baara bu masoolo obo, mápala mu mabvulu mamo ya mánama nde mu myili. <verse eid="MAT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Nde bu apala mu bwara, ámono mpwumu a baara yi nene ya nde ámono bo nyiĩ, ya ábwi odzuhu babyele ba bo.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Nkonkolo bu yito, binduono bi Yiisu bíyasele ku bele a nde ya bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Ebini ki eli ki e nkeẽ ya bwihi ayi ku ogyili. Bvurulu mampwumu ma baara magye mu mala mu oyiswumu bi-odza.» <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Lo [Yiisu] ábvuhulu kundaa bye ti: «Bo ka bali a nzala a obvughuru o, ligwa bo bi-odza beme.» <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Bye bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Bihi ki lili a kye ŋa, yini a mampa mataana ya banswi buolo.» <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Mu obo, nde ályele kundaa binduono ti: «Ligya a me bye ŋa.» <verse eid="MAT 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Ya nde átumu mampwumu ma baara mabwa nsini ŋa yulu a nsele. Nde ágwolo mampa mataana ya banswi buolo, átala ku yulu, áseme bye, átsyiri bye ya ágwi kundaa binduono bi nde, ya binduono bíkaba bye kundaa mampwumu ma baara. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Bo bwohono báli, bágyughuru. Ya bábiri bitubu kwumu ya byele (12) bi bílwulu mu bitsulu bi bísyili<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:42-44">2 Mik 4.42-44</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Babo ba báli bye áli bakughu oto mapfwunu mataana (5 000) ma babaghala, gwene otala bakaha ya baana ba basala.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzyara mu yulu a madza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6.45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Dzã 6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Ya ŋaana oŋo, Yiisu ásini binduono bi nde bisomo munsa bwara ya bitswama ku nkulu a nde ku ngulu a mubu, mu edzighi ki ákabvurulu nde mampwumu ma baara. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ya bu amana obvurulu mampwumu ma baara, nde ákumu ku yulu a munguo, mu oyisamana ngasighi. Ŋa ogyili bwihi, nde áli oŋo, ngasighi. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Bwara áli ayi la ya mukogho a mubu. Mampo ma madza ma manene mákabwa mu bo mu nkooro a efulu kii mpini ki ékagya. <verse eid="MAT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Ku bele a ku ookya bwihi, Yiisu ágyene kundaa bo mu okabuludzyara mu yulu a mubu. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Binduono bu bimono nde mu okadzyara ŋa yulu a madza ma mubu, enkwughu ki enene ésughuru mu bo ya bályele ti: «Ekye etoomo!» Ya mu nzalamweẽ, bo bábwi okehe bingubu. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Ŋaana oŋo, [Yiisu] átsughu ndagha kundaa bo ti: «Likala a bukyini, wu me me, ka likala a nzalamweẽ o!» <verse eid="MAT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, kala ti wu me we, lo gwa litumu mu kuulu me ngya kundaa we mu yulu a madza.» <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yiisu ályele nde ti: «Gya!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 14:29">Piere ásughuru mu bwara, ábwi odzyara mu yulu a madza ya ábaana ogye kundaa Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Lo bu amono efulu kii mpini, Piere ábagha nzalamweẽ, ya nde ábaana odzyama. Nde ákehe engubu ya ályele ti: «Mfumu, bvwuhu me!» <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Ya ŋaana oŋo, Yiisu bu alabala kwogho, ákwara nde ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mbwuru nga a kana li lisala, mu emakye we aasi mikeme?» <verse eid="MAT 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ya bu basomo mu bwara, efulu édzuunu. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Ba báli mu bwara bákunu mabuo mu nsie ŋa nkulu a nde ya bályele ti: «Mu engaŋma we li Mwana a Nzaami!»<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu dzuhu babyele ku Ngenedzarete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar 6.53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Bu bapala mu ngulu a mubu, bo báto mu etsulu e nsie kii Ngenedzarete. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Baara baba ebini ekye bu bagyahaba Yiisu, bátsala nsia a nde mu etsulu e nsie kyehene, ya báyabiri babyele bwohono kundaa nde. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Bábuono nde mu kuulu nde anyaã bo babyeme yini a nto a enkuru e nde. Baara bwohono ba bábyeme kye bádzughu.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ekulu ki bakwuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Ba-Faridzyẽ ya baluo-mikyene báfi ku Yerusaleme ya bágyi kundaa Yiisu, ya báfwulu kundaa nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />«Mu emakye binduono bi we biigwene okanama ekulu ki bakwuru? Mu kuulu bo ka baakaswagha myaã mu matala mama odza o.» <verse eid="MAT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Be mu emakye liigwene okanama mandagha ma ookatumu Nzaami ya be okasalala ekulu ki bakwuru ba be? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Mu kuulu Nzaami ályele ti: <char style="qt">Gwa taara ya ngughu a we budziri</char>, ya ályele si ti: <char style="qt">Munde wu aabiili taara a nde bwunu we ngughu a nde epwolo, bafaana odzwa nde</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Opa 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">21.17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Det 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Bun 20.9</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Lo be, be liikalyele ti nswe munde wu aalyele kundaa taara a nde bwunu we kundaa ngughu a nde ti: “Bibye bi kaangwa me we mu obaha we, bili ekaba ki aangwa me kundaa Nzaami”, <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />lo mbwuru wu obo, ka li a nzala a ogwa taara bwunu we ngughu a nde budziri o. Obo me bu liikakahaba be Ndagha a Nzaami mu nkooro a ekulu ki bakwuru ba be. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Bampibi! Mubighili Edzayi ágyighili obighili mu be ŋa ályele nde ti:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />
    <char style="qt">Ekaana ki okasyighi me yini a mu bibolo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="qt">lo mikolo mi bo mili la ya me</char>.<verse eid="MAT 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />
    <char style="qt">Nsamana a bo mu me yi a bwunu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="qt">mu kuulu maluo ma bali mu okabululuo bo yini a mandagha ma ookatumu embwuru baakanama</char>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Edz 29.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>.»<verse eid="MAT 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bi biikasumunu mbwuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar 7.14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, bu ati mpwumu a baara mbili, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ligyughu ya libaghala! <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Ka oli ki eekasomo mu muŋma eekasumunu mbwuru o, lo me mimye mi miikapala mu muŋma, miikasumunu mbwuru.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Oŋo binduono bíyasele ku bele a Yiisu ya bílyele kundaa nde ti: «We gyahaba ti ba-Faridzyẽ baamono mpara mu mikolo ŋa baagyughu bo mandagha ma we mamo?» <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Nswe muti wuulu ka oli Taara a me mu yulu aakunu nde o, sa batumunu nde. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Linyaã bo! Bo bali binkpa-mihi bi biikabulubiri bambaala [binkpa-mihi]. Kala ti enkpa-mihi eekabulubiri mbaala enkpa-mihi, bye binsa byele sa biyibwa mu dzunu.» <verse eid="MAT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Gwa bihi mbaala a nkumu [yi].» <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yiisu ábvuhulu ti: «Behe si nkini ka lili a mayele ma obaghala o? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Bunu, be ka lisoolo o ti bye byehene bi biikasomo mu muŋma, biikasughuru mu mweẽ, ya baakatsili bye ku nto a nkwulu? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Lo mandagha ma maakapala mu muŋma ku mukolo maakafa, ya me mo maakasumunu mbwuru. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Mu kuulu mu mukolo ookapala bitsimi bi bibi, odzwa baara, obvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda-mbwuru, enkwunu, pfyibi, bumpughulu bubu mpya, otsaala babake. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Bibye biikasumunu mbwuru! Lo odza kuulu myaã oswagha we, ka okughu osumunu mbwuru o.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kana li mukaha wu a ku Kaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7.24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Ŋa nseele Yiisu ámara oŋo, ágyene ku etsulu e nsie kii Tire ya Sidõ. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Mukaha mutsyini wu musi kaana wu áakakala mu etsulu e nsie ekye, ágyi kundaa Yiisu, ákakehe bingubu kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, Mwana a Dabvide, mono me nyiĩ! Mufulu wu mubi li mu okamwehẽ mwana a me wu mukaha kimini.» <verse eid="MAT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Yiisu ka ábvuhulu nde si ndagha mo o. Binduono bi nde bíyasele ya bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Bvurulu mukaha wu, mu kuulu nde li mu okayakehe bingubu ŋa mbihi a bihi-a-be.» <verse eid="MAT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Yini a kundaa bindoomo bi basi Isarayele bi bídzimini baagweghe me.»<verse eid="MAT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Lo mukaha munde ágyi, ákunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a nde ya ályele ti: «Mfumu, baha me!» <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yiisu ábvuhulu ndiri: «Ka oli bubwe o mu ogwolo mampa ma baana ya otsili mo kundaa baana ba bambwa.» <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Mukaha ályele ti: «Bwunu obo Mfumu! Lo baana ba bambwa baakadza mfi-mfihini yi aakabwa ku nsie a tabele li bamfumu ba bo.» <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Oŋo Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa mukaha ti: «Mukaha, kana li we lili li linene! Nyaã okala kundaa we bwunu a bu dzyi we.» Ya mwana a nde wu mukaha ádzughu mu matala maana mamo.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu babyele balagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Yiisu bu amara oŋo, ágyene ku mukogho a mubu wu a Ngalile. Nde ákumu ku yulu a munguo ya ábwi nsini oko. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Mampwumu ma baara balagha mágyi kundaa nde, báyabiri banga a bipfwumu, binkpa-mihi, bikara, bankini ya babyele balagha bakimi. Bo bátwulu bo ŋa myili mi nde, ya nde ádzuhu bo. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Baara bákiŋimi mu omono bankini mu obili, banga-a-bipfwumu mu odzughu, bikara mu odzyara, binkpa-mihi mu omono. Ya bo bákasyighi Nzaami a Isarayele.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu buŋunu mafwunu mana ma babaghala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Yiisu áti binduono bi nde mbili, ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Me ndi a nyiĩ a mpwumu a baara yi, mu kuulu bitsughu bitere ayi bamaasa ŋa ya me, ya bo ka bali a bi-odza o. Me ka ndzyi obvurulu bo ya nzala o, mara bayibwa-kulu mu nzili.» <verse eid="MAT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Binduono bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Kunsa syehe kunu, kunu-ako liibagha mampa ma malagha ma oogyughuru mpwumu a baara yi alagha yi?» <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mampa kpe be lili a mo?» Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Nsaama, ya mana a binswi-nswi.» <verse eid="MAT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Yiisu átumu mpwumu a baara yibwa nsini ŋa nsie, <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />ágwolo mampa nsaama ya banswi, bu abvuhulu matuono kundaa Nzaami, nde átsyiri mo ya ágwi mo kundaa binduono bi nde. Ya binduono bi nde bíkaba mo kundaa mampwumu ma baara. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Bo bwohono báli ya bágyughuru. Ya bábiri bitubu nsaama bi bilwulu mu bitsulu bi bísyili. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Babo ba báli bye báli mapfwunu mana (4 000) ma babaghala, gwene a otala bakaha ya baana ba basala. <verse eid="MAT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Ŋa mbihi, bu abvurulu mampwumu ma baara, nde ásomo munsa bwara ya ágyene ku etsulu e nsie kii Mangandane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mangandane</char><char style="ft" closed="false">bwunu we Mangandala. </char></note>.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ basagha elyimi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luk 12.54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ báyabehene kundaa Yiisu, ya bátsihi nde. Bo báluomo nde asuo bo elyimi ki eefa ku yulu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: [«Ŋa ookadzyama tala, be liikalyele ti: “Sa okala a matala ma mabwe, buulu yulu libie.” <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Ya mu epala be liikalyele ti: “Lolo mvulu sa anoõ, mu kuulu yulu lipyini.” Be lisoolo obaghala bifa bi mayulu, lo be ka likughu obaghala bilyimi bibi matala o!] <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Eseene ki ebi ya kii gwene a mukama mu Nzaami ki eli mu okasagha elyimi! Ka basuo kye elyimi o, kala ti ka kii Dzonase o.» Ya nde ábulusihi bo oŋo ya ágyene.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pfini li ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8.14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Binduono bi Yiisu bu bipala mu ngulu yinke yi mubu, bye bídzimini ogwolo mampa. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bye ti: «Limono ya lisa mayele mu pfini li ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ!» <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Bo bábwi otsimi bomo ya bályele ti: «Ampe mu kuulu bihi ka liigwolo mampa o.» <verse eid="MAT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Lo Yiisu bu asoolo bitsimi bi bo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Baara baba kana li lisala, mu emakye be liitsimi ti mu nkooro a bu ligwene a mampa? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Be nkini liibaghala o? Be limaadzimini nsimi a mampa mataana ma liikaba kundaa mapfwunu mataana (5 000) ma babaghala. Ya mutala a bitubu bi liitolo? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Ngu okala mampa nsaama ma liikaba kundaa mapfwunu mana (4 000) ma babaghala. Ya mutala a bitubu bi liitolo? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Bunu, be ka liibaghala o ti me ka aambili kundaa be mu nkooro a mampa o, ŋa aandyele me be ti: “Limono ya lisa mayele mu pfini li ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ!”»<verse eid="MAT 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Oŋo bo bághala ti Yiisu ka ákabili mu osa mayele mu pfini li mampa o, lo mu maluo ma ba-Faridzyẽ ya ba-Saduseyẽ.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere lyele ti Yiisu me Kriste</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8.27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Yiisu bu ato mu etsulu e nsie ki eli bele ya bvulu lili Sedzare lili Filipe, nde áfwulu kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Mu mbiili a baara, Mwana a mbwuru nande ali?» <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Mu bana ti me Dzã Muboghoro, babake ti me Eli, bakimi ti me Dzeremi bwunu we mumõ ŋa kara li mibighili». <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Yiisu áfwulu bo ti: «Lo mu be, me nande ndi?» <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simõ Piere ábvuhulu ti: «We li Kriste, Mwana a Nzaami wu a mweẽ.» <verse eid="MAT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Mu obo, Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Esee kundaa we, Simõ mwana a Dzonase, buulu ka oli musunu ya makili biisuo we ndagha oyo o, lo Taara a me wu li mu mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Ya mehe si me ndyele kundaa we ti: We li limeẽ, ya ŋa yulu a limeẽ li me sa ntwu Libwunu li me. Ya lileene li lipfu ka libvulu lili lo mu mpini o. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Me sa ngwa we mankogholo ma Emfumu ki mayulu. Mamo ma aakuru we ŋa nsie, sa bakuru mo mu mayulu. Ya mamo ma akala aanyana we ŋa nsie, sa banyana mo mu mayulu.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Mu obo nde átswi binduono bi nde mukele binyaã olyele kundaa mbwuru si mumõ ti nde me Kriste.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bili mu lipfu ya osighili o nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Mar 8.31–9.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luk 9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Obaana mu matala mamo, Yiisu ábwi osuo epankala kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Me mfaana okumu ku Yerusaleme ya omono mpara yi alagha ŋa myaã mi bakwuru, bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya baluo-mikyene, bafaana odzwa me, ya mu etsughu kii bitere, me sa nsighili mu lipfu.» <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" />Piere ábiri Yiisu mu libee, ábwi ofyẽ nde ya ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mfumu, nyaã Nzaami akala we mu mimye! Pele, mandagha mamo manyaã obwa mu we!» <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Lo nde bu akaghala, ályele kundaa Piere ti: «Satana, mara ŋa nkulu a me! We li kya mu nzili a me, mu kuulu bitsimi bi we ka bili bitsimi bi Nzaami o, lo bili bibi baara.»<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bunu-abo baakanama Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Ŋaana oŋo, Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «Kala ti mbwuru dzyi onama me, lo atunu nyuru a ndeme, agwolo kuruwa li nde ya anama me. <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Mu kuulu, nswe munde wu dzyi obvwuhu laama li nde, sa apfihili lo. Lo munde wu aapfihili laama li nde mu nkooro a me, nde sa afiribagha lo. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Nsa ndaana mbwuru aakala a yo, kala ti nde bagha busini bu nsie nsyini ya pfihili laama li nde? Bwunu we, emakye mbwuru akughu ogwa ki eli a mupfunu mu oswumu laama li nde? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Mu kuulu, Mwana a mbwuru li mu ogya ya bangye-yulu ba nde kunsa nsia a Taara a nde. Ya oŋo nde sa agwa kundaa mbwuru-mbwuru bwunu a bu oli bigyighili bi nde. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Mu engaŋma me ndyele be ti: Babake ŋa kara li ba lili ŋa, ka bakpa o nsomo bamono Mwana a mbwuru mu ogya mu Emfumu e nde.»<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s1">Okighiri o Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9.2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Bitsughu bisemene bu biluru, Yiisu ágwolo Piere, Dzake ya Dzã mbwee a Dzake, ya ábiri bo mu libee ku yulu a munguo wu mula. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Efa e nde e sobo ŋa nkulu a bo: Edzili e nde ébwi osehene ti tala, binkuru bi nde bípeŋeme ti otsyeme. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Mono, Moyidze ya Eli báyamoŋono kundaa bo, mu okabili ya nde <verse eid="MAT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piere ályele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Mfumu! Oli bubwe ti bihi-a-be likala ŋa. Kala ti we dzyi, lo me ntwu bibvulu bitere ŋa, emõ kii we, emõ kii Moyidze, ya emõ kii Eli.» <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Nde áli nkini mu okabili, mono, edzi kii otsyeme éfughu bo, ya mono, likyi lífi kunsa edzi ya lílyele ti: «Wu me Mwana a me wu mukolo, mu nde me aankamono esee, ligyughu nde!» <verse eid="MAT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Binduono bu bigyughu obo, bíbwi mapfumunu masu mu nsie, bye bíli a nzalamweẽ yi alagha. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Yiisu áyasele, bu aberene bo ályele ti: «Litemene! Ka likala a nzalamweẽ o.» <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Bu basiili masu ma bo, bo bámono yini a Yiisu ngasighi.<verse eid="MAT 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ŋaala bo mu okakumunu munguo, Yiisu átswi bo mukele wu: «Ka lilyele kundaa mbwuru si mumõ o, mandagha ma liimono be, tee etsughu ki oosighili Mwana a mbwuru ŋa nsa ba bákpi.»<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Binduono bífwulu kundaa nde ti: «Mu emakye baluo-mikyene baakalyele ti Eli faana ogya nsomo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Mal 3.23</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ngaŋma! <char style="qt">Eli faana ogya mu obvurulu bilogho byehene nsumu</char>. <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Lo me ndyele kundaa be ti Eli maagya, ya baara ka baasoolo nde o, lo baasi nde nswe mimye mi baadzyi bo. Bwunu obo si, bo sa bamwehẽ Mwana a mbwuru mpara.» <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Ŋaana oŋo binduono bíbaghala ti nde mu Dzã Muboghoro ákabili kundaa bo.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu mwana nga-a-mufulu wu mubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9.14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luk 9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Bu bato ŋa bele a mpwumu a baara, mbwuru mumõ áyakunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a Yiisu, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />ya ályele ti: «Mfumu, mono mwana a me wu baghala nyiĩ, mu kuulu nde li a ebyele ki nzyere ya li mu okamono mpara yi alagha. Emvulu-gughu nde aakabwa ku mbaa bwunu we mu madza. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Me aambiri nde kundaa binduono bi we, lo bye ka biileene odzuhu nde o.» <verse eid="MAT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yiisu ábvuhulu ti: «Aa! Eseene ki egwene a kana ya ki egwuŋumu! Tee nki matala me aankuru mukolo mu be? Ligya a me nde ŋa.» <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yiisu áŋaã mufulu wu mubi ebaghala, nde ápala mu mwana ya mu matala maana mamo, mwana ádzughu. <verse eid="MAT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Mu obo binduono bíyasele kundaa Yiisu, bífwulu nde ŋa ebini kii bo ngasighi ti: «Mu emakye bihi liikwono obyi mufulu wu mubi munde?» <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Mu nkooro a kana li be li lisala. Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, kala ti be lili a kana li linene ti liburu li muti a mutaade, be sa lilyele kundaa munguo wu ti: “Mara ŋa. Gye kunii”, ya nde sa agye. Ka oli a ndagha yi liikuono a be o.» [<verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />Lo yini a mu lisamana ya mu okuru nswele mu bala be likughu obyi mufulu wu obo].<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu firibili mu lipfu ya osighili o nde mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9.30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luk 9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Etsughu nga-emõ, bu babvuŋunu ku Ngalile, Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Sa batyeghe Mwana a mbwuru ŋa myaã mi baara, <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />bo sa badzwa nde, ya mu etsughu kii bitere, nde sa asighili mu lipfu.» Binduono bísomo kunsa minyoõ mi milagha.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofiri mpagha a Nzo a nzaami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Bu bato ku Kaperenawume, mintolo-mpagha míyasele kundaa Piere ya mífwulu kundaa nde ti: «Bunu, Muluo a be ka aakafiri mpagha a Nzo a nzaami o?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:11-16">Opa 30.11-16</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Nde ábvuhulu ti: «Nde aakafiri yo.» Piere bu abvughuru ku nzo, Yiisu átswama olyele kundaa nde ti: «Simõ, we bunu tsimi, mikogho mi nsie, kundaa bana miikaluomo mi bátsyiri ya mpagha? Kundaa baana ba bomo bwunu we kundaa banzyi?» <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piere ábvuhulu ti: «Kundaa banzyi». Yiisu ályele ti: «Mu obo, baana ka baakafiri o. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Mu kuulu bihi a we linyaã okala makya kundaa baara, gye yitubu ndobo mu mubu. Gwolo nswi wu a nsomo wu aalobo we, dzubulu muŋma a nde, we sa mono mupara. Gwolo nde ya gye yigwa bo nde mu nkooro a me ya we.»<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s1">Wu bvulu bukwuru mu Emfumu ki mayulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9.33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Mu matala mamo, binduono bi Yiisu bíyasehe kundaa nde ya bifwulu nde ti: «Nande bvulu bukwuru mu Emfumu ki mayulu?» <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Nde bu ati mwana wu asala mbili, átwulu nde ŋa kara-a-kara li bo <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />ya ályele ti: «Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, kala ti be ka ligyiŋi mayele ya likala ti anga baana ba basala o, lo be ka lisomo mu Emfumu ki mayulu o. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Mu obo, nswe munde wu akughulu ti anga mana mwana wu, me munde wu bvulu bukwuru mu Emfumu ki mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />Ya munde wu aagyagha mwana ti anga wu mu nkwumu a me, lo meme nde agyagha.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Osa mayele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar 9.42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />«Nswe munde wu aabwihi mu lisumu, mumõ mu bike-bike bi biikasa kana mu me bi, lo bubwe bakuru nde limeẽ li linene mu nkyighi, batsili nde ku nsie a mubu. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Nyiĩ kundaa baara ba nsie yi, mu kuulu mi miikasa ti baara bakubu makya, mili milagha! Mu engaŋma, okubu makya ofaana okala, lo nyiĩ kundaa mbwuru wu aakasa ti babake bakubu makya! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Kala ti kwogho bwunu we kwulu e we eekabwihi we mu masumu, tsyiri kye tsili, kye la ya we. Obvulu bubwe kundaa we mu osomo mu laama li engaŋma ya kwogho bwunu we kwulu etsyini, ya bu kala a myaã ya myili minsa myele ya batsili we ku mbaa yi a mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Ya kala ti lihi li we liikabwihi we mu masumu, lo sorolo lo, tsili lo la ya we. Obvulu bubwe kundaa we mu osomo mu laama lili engaŋma ya lihi limõ, ya bu kala a mihi minsa myele ya batsili we ku mungele a mbaa.»<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />«Lisa mayele! Ka libele mwana si mumõ mu bike-bike bi o, mu kuulu me ndyele kundaa be ti, mu mayulu, bangye-yulu ba bo baakatemene matala mwohono ŋa nkulu a Taara a me wu li mu mayulu. [<verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />Mu kuulu Mwana a mbwuru aagyi mu obvwuhu babo ba bádzimini.]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a endoomo ki édzimini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luk 15.3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />Be bunu litsimi? Kala ti mbwuru li a bindoomo nkama (100), ya emõ mu bye egwuŋumu, nde ka asihi bindoomo makwumu-wa ya wa (99) ku yulu a munguo mu oyisagha ekye ki eegwuŋumu o? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Ya kala ti nde mono kye, mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, nde sa akala a esee ki ebvulu mu kye, ya ki ali a nde mu bindoomo makwumu-wa ya wa (99) bi biigwene ogwuŋumu. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Bwunu obo si, Taara a be wu li mu mayulu dzyi ti si mumõ mu bike-bike bi ka dzimini o.»<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ŋa ookabwa nganda-mbwuru mu masumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />«Kala ti nganda-mbwuru gyighili we ndagha yi mbi, gye yimono nde ya syeme nde ŋa o be buolo. Kala ti nde gyughu we, lo we aafiribagha nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Lo, kala ti nde ka gyughu we o, gwolo mbwuru mumõ bwunu we baara buolo bakimi bakala ya we, mu kuulu ligyighili ndagha oyo ŋa nkulu a bampughulu buolo bwunu we batere. <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Kala ti nde bihi ogyughu bo, lo lyele ndagha oyo ŋa nkulu a emvuŋunu e nzaami. Ya kala ti nde bihi ogyughu emvuŋunu e nzaami, lo nyaã nde akala kundaa we ti anga mbwuru wu aagwene okasa kana mu Nzaami, bwunu we muntolo-mpagha.»<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />«Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe ndagha yi akala liikuru be ŋa nsie sa bakuru yo mu mayulu, ya nswe ndagha yi akala liinyana be ŋa nsie, sa banyana yo mu mayulu.» <verse eid="MAT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />Me firindyele be ti: «Kala ti baara buolo ŋa kara li be bagwihini ŋa nsie mu oluomo ndagha nswe ndagha mu lisamana, lo Taara a me wu li mu mayulu sa agyighili bo yo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Mu kuulu, oŋo ŋa oobvuŋunu baara buolo bwunu we batere mu nkwumu a me, me ndi ŋa kara li bo.»<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a musala wu aagwene okasa kolokolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Oŋo, Piere áyasele ŋa ndaa Yiisu ya áfwulu nde ti: «Mfumu! Mansa kpe me mfaana osa nganda-mbwuru kolokolo, kala ti nde gyighili me ndagha yi mbi? Tee mansa nsaama?» <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Me ka ndyele kundaa we ti tee mansa nsaama o, lo tee mansa makwumu nsaama (70) mbala nsaama. <verse eid="MAT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />Me mu obo Emfumu ki mayulu efaana ti bu: Mukogho mutsyini ádzyi ti basala ba nde basuo nde bu basalala bo nzi a nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Mu obaana, báyabiri kundaa nde munde wu áli a ebyimi ya nde kii mafwunu mwolo (10 000) ma mipara. <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Buulu nde ka áli a nzi yi ofiri ebyimi ekye o, mfumu a nde ágwi litumu batyeghe nde, mukala a nde, baana ba nde ya bilogho bi nde byehene, mu kuulu bafiri ebyimi e nde. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Mu obo, musala ábwi ŋa nsie a myili mi mfumu a nde, ákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ya ályele ti: “Makuru mukolo a we mu okebe, ya sa me mfiri ebyimi e we kyehene.” <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Mfumu bu ámono musala a nde nyiĩ, nde ányaghala ebyimi e nde, ya ányaã nde agye. <verse eid="MAT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />Musala munde bu apala, ábwana a mumõ mu banganda ba nde baba esala wu áli a ebyimi ya nde kii nkama (100) a badenali baba bisyeẽ. Nde ábwirili nde, ápyere nde ŋa bolo, ya ályele kundaa nde ti: “Firi ebyimi ki ásuomo we kundaa me.” <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Nganda a nde ákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ŋa nkulu a nde, ya ábuono nde ti: “Makuru mukolo a we mu okebe, ya me sa mfiri ebyimi e we kyehene.” <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Lo wu muke ábihi, nde ágyene áyilo nde mu boloko tee mu matala ma áfiri nde ebyimi ekye. <verse eid="MAT 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />Basala babake bu bamono mi míluru, basomo kunsa minyoõ mi milagha ya báyitwoho myehene mi míluru kundaa mfumu a bo. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Mu obo, mfumu áti nde mbili ya ályele kundaa nde ti: “We li musala wu mubi! Me aanyaghala ebyimi e we kyehene mu nkooro a bu aabuono we me. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Wehe si, we áli faana omono nganda a we nyiĩ ti bu aamono me we nyiĩ.” <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Ya mu nkehe, mfumu ágweghe nde mu oyisala engaama tee ŋa aamana nde ebyimi kyehene ofiri». <verse eid="MAT 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />Yiisu áfiribwehe ndiri: «Bwunu obo si Taara a me wu li mu mayulu akala aasa mu be, kala ti mbwuru-mbwuru mu be ka si nganda kolokolo mu mukolo a nde mumõ o.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s1">Maluo ma Yiisu mu mi mitala odzwa mabala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Yiisu bu amana ogwa maluo mamo, nde ámara ku Ngalile, ya ágyene ku etsulu e nsie kii Yude, ku ngulu a mwele wu a Dzurudẽ. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Mampwumu ma baara mánama nde, ya oko nde ádzuhu babyele balagha.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Ba-Faridzyẽ báyasele kundaa Yiisu mu otsihi nde. Bo báfwulu nde ti: «Mu mikyene mi bihi-a-be, mbwuru li a muswa mu obyi mukala a nde mu nswe ebili?» <verse eid="MAT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Be nkini lítala mandagha ma básono mu mukaana a Nzaami o ti: “<char style="qt">Mu ebaana, Mugyighili ámyene bo baghala ya mukaha</char>?” <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Ya Nzaami ályele ti: “<char style="qt">Me mu obo, baghala faana osihi nzo a taara ya ngughu a nde mu oyikala emõ ya mukala a nde, ya bo bansa buolo sa bakala mbwuru mumõ</char>”. <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Mu obo, bo ka bafirikala baara buolo o, lo bo ayi mbwuru mumõ. Nyaã mbwuru ka kabala ba óbvughu Nzaami o!» <verse eid="MAT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Ba-Faridzyẽ báfwulu nde ti: «Mu emakye Moyidze ágwi baghala muswa wu ogwa mukala a nde mukaana wu odzwa mabala, ŋa ali mu okabyi nde?» <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Mu nkooro a mikolo mi be mi mikubu Moyidze ágwi be muswa mu obyi bakala ba be. Lo ku ebaana, ka óli obo o. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Lo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe munde wu aabyi mukala a nde, kala ti ka oli mu enkwunu o, ya nde kye mukaha mukimi, lo nde bukala asi.» <verse eid="MAT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Binduono [bi nde] bílyele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti leme me lilo mulumu afaana okala a lo ŋa nkulu a mukala a nde, lo ka oli mupfunu mu okye o.» <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Ka oli baara bwohono baabaghala maluo [ma o]. Lo yini a babo ba ógwi Nzaami muswa mu obaghala mo. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Baara bana ka bakye o, mu kuulu bo bali bamfi obaana emburu-ngughu. Ba bake, bákala bamfi mu ku bágwogholo bo. Ba bake si bákala bamfi mu nkooro a Emfumu ki mayulu. Nyaã wu kughu obaghala, abaghala!»<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yiisu seme bike-bike</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10.13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Baara báyabiri bike-bike kundaa Yiisu, kuulu nde anaã bye myaã ya asamana mu nkooro a bye. Lo binduono bísyeme baara babo. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Mu obo, Yiisu ályele ti: «Linyaã bike-bike bigya, ka likahaba bye mu ogya kundaa me o, mu kuulu Emfumu ki mayulu eli kii ba bali ti anga bye.» <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Ya bu amana onaã bye myaã, nde ámara ŋa ebini ekye.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ya mumpala wu esini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10.17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Ya mono, baghala mutsyini áyasele kundaa Yiisu, ya ályele nde ti: «Muluo, emakye ki ebwe me mfaana osa mu obagha laama lili mibvu ya mibvu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu emakye we li mu ogwa me efwulu mu mi mibwe? Yini a mumõ li mubwe. Kala ti we dzyi osomo mu laama lili mibvu ya mibvu, kebe mikyene.» <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Baghala munde áfwulu kundaa Yiisu ti: «Nki mikyene?» Yiisu ábvuhulu nde ti: «<char style="qt">Ka dzwa o, ka bvughu mbughu ya mukala bwunu we mulumu a nganda-mbwuru o, ka kala mpughulu wu a mpya o, ka turu o,</char> <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" /><char style="qt">gwa taara a we ya ngughu a we budziri</char>, ya <char style="qt">Dzyi nganda-mbwuru ti anga weme.</char>» <verse eid="MAT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Mumpala munde ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mye myehene mimye me aakansalala mye. Emakye me nkughu ofirisa?» <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Kala ti we dzyi okala mukughu, lo gye, tyeghe bi li a we ya gwa nzi kundaa bawele, ya we sa bagha busini mu mayulu. Ŋa mbihi oŋo, gya, nama me!» <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Lo, mumpala munde bu agyughu ndagha oyo, ágyene kunsa minyoõ, mu kuulu nde áli a busini bulagha. <verse eid="MAT 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Yiisu ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele yo kundaa be, oli mpara kundaa esini mu osomo mu Emfumu ki mayulu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Me firindyele kundaa be ti, ka oli a mpara o kundaa nyama wu baakata Syamo mu oluru mu kuhu li nyoõ, lo obvulu a mpara kundaa esini mu osomo mu Emfumu e Nzaami.» <verse eid="MAT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Binduono bi Yiisu bu bigyughu ndagha oyo, bíkiŋimi ku olagha ya bílyele ti: «Lo nande kughu obvwughu?» <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yiisu bu atala kundaa bo, ályele ti: «Kundaa baara, ka okughu okala o, lo kundaa Nzaami myehene mikughu okala.» <verse eid="MAT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Mu obo, Piere ályele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Mono, bihi liisihi byehene mu onama we. Bunu ookala kundaa bihi?» <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa be ti, mu matala ma obwa Mwana a mbwuru nsini ŋa likubu li nde lili nsia mu nsie yi nyaghara, be ba liinama me, behe si sa libwa nsini ŋa makubu kwumu ya mwolo (12) mu osa madzumu kwumu ya mwolo (12) mama Isarayele muyala. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />Ya nswe munde wu aasihi manzo, bankele ba nde ba babaghala ya ba bakaha, taara, ngughu, baana, bwunu we manseghe mu nkooro a nkwumu a me, lo nde sa abagha bye ku obvulu mansa nkama (100), ya sa abagha pfa lili laama lili mibvu ya mibvu. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Balagha ba bali ba bansomo mu matala ma, sa bakala binsiele-mbihi, ya balagha ba bali binsiele-mbihi sa bakala ba bansomo.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi basala baba tala lili masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />«Emfumu ki mayulu eli ti anga mfumu a nzo wu pala mu epala-epala, mu kuulu agwolo basala ba baayisala mu nseghe a nde yi a bviini. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Nde ágwihini ya basala babo mu ofiri bo denali mumõ mu etsughu, ya nde ágweghe bo ku nseghe a nde yi a bviini. <verse eid="MAT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />Mu tala lili wa, nde bu afiripala mu nzo, ámono baara bakimi ba bátemene ŋa ebini emõ gwene a ki baasa. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: “Behe si ligye ku nseghe a me yi a bviini, ya me sa ngwa be mufuru wu a kughu.” <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Bo bágyene. Ya nde bu áfiripala mu tala lili embehe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.5</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Embehe </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tala lili kwumu ya mwolo (12), li baakata si ntaŋa a minsene.</char></note>, ya mu lili kwumu ya mataana (15), nde ási bwunu obo. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Ku bele a tala lili kwumu ya nsaama (17), nde bu afiripala, ámono babake bátemene oŋo ya nde ályele kundaa bo ti: “Mu emakye be liitemene ŋa bwihi butsyini, ku ogwene a elogho osa?” <verse eid="MAT 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mu kuulu ka oli a mbwuru wu aagwolo bihi mu osala o.” Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: “Behe si ligye ku nseghe a me yi a bviini.” <verse eid="MAT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />Nkonkolo bu yito, nga-a-nseghe a bviini ályele kundaa wu aakatumu basala ba nde ti: “Ta basala mbili, ya gwa bo mufuru a bo, obaana mu ba aangwolo me nseele ya mana mu baba nsomo.” <verse eid="MAT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />Baba tala lili kwumu ya nsaama (17) bágyi, ya mbwuru-mbwuru ábagha denali mumõ-mumõ. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ŋa masini, ba bansomo bágyi, ya bo bákatsimi ti bo sa babagha mufuru wu bvulu, lo boho si bábagha denali mumõ-mumõ mu mbwuru. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Bu bagyagha mufuru, bo bábwi oŋuŋunu mu nga-a-nzo. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Bo bályele ti: “Baba nsiele ba baasala yini a tala limõ, lo we ofuru bo mutala mumõ ya bihi ba liimono mpara mu osala bwihi bu mpwuŋu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bwihi bu mpwuŋu</char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbaala ti etsughu ki etsyini.</char></note> kunsa kyaŋana kii mpini!” <verse eid="MAT 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />Nga-a-nseghe ábvuhulu kundaa mumõ mu bo ti: “Ndughu a me, me ka ndi a epfwumu kundaa we o, bihi a we ka liigwihini mu denali mumõ o? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Gwolo mufuru a we ya mara ŋa. Me ndzyi ogwa kundaa wu aagyi nsiele wu ti bu aangwi me we. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Me ka ndi a muswa wu ogyighili mi ndzyi mu nzi a me o? Bunu, we mukolo mubi mu kuulu me ndi mbwuru wu mubwe?” <verse eid="MAT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Mu obo, baba nsiele sa bakala baba nsomo, ya baba nsomo sa bakala baba nsiele.»<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu firibili mu lipfu ya osighili o nde mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10.32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Mu matala ma ókagye Yiisu ku Yerusaleme, mu nzili nde ábiri [binduono] kwumu ya byele (12) mu libee, ya ályele kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />«Mono! Bihi-a-be lili mu okakumu ku Yerusaleme, ya sa bagwa Mwana a mbwuru ŋa myaã mi bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya baluo-mikyene. Bo sa bagwolo mukakana wu odzwa nde, <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />ya sa bagwa nde ŋa myaã mi baala ka bali ba-Dzwife o. Bo sa basa nde munsensehẽ, bakaha nde nswa-nswa, bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa, ya mu etsughu kii bitere, nde sa asighili mu lipfu.»<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oluomo o ngughu a Dzake ya Dzã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10.35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Ŋaana oŋo, ngughu a baana ba Nzebede ásele kundaa Yiisu ya baana ba nde ba babaghala. Ya nde ákunu mabuo mu nsie mu oluomo ndagha mõ kundaa nde. <verse eid="MAT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yiisu áfwulu nde ti: «We emakye dzyi?» Nde ábvuhulu kundaa Yiisu ti: «Sa kuulu ti, ŋa aakala we mukogho, baana ba me buolo ba babwa nsini ya we, mumõ ku ngo-kwogho, ya wu muke ku engbambogho.» <verse eid="MAT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yiisu ábvuhulu ti: «Be ka lisoolo mi lili mu okaluomo be o. Bunu, be likughu oŋma ebaha kii kimini ki aaŋma me?» Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ndiri: «Bihi likughu.» <verse eid="MAT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ebaha e me, be sa liŋma kye. Lo mu mi mitala obwa nsini ku ngo-kwogho e me ya ku engbambogho e me, me ka ndi a litumu lilo o, bibini bibye bili bibi babo ba ogyighili Taara a me bye.»<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Mar 10.42-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:24-27">Luk 22.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Binduono kwumu bibike bu bigyughu obo, ka bámono esee mu naana ya mbwee o. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Yiisu áti bo mbili ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Be lisoolo ti bitumu bi mansie biikamwehẽ baara mpara mu litumu li bo, ya baara baba mupfunu baakasuo leme li emfumu e bo ŋa yulu a babake. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Ka ofaana okala obo ŋa kara li be o. Lo, munde wu dzyi okala mukwuru ŋa kara li be, nyaã nde akala esala e be. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />Ya kala ti mbwuru mu be dzyi okala wu a nsomo, nyaã nde akala nkana a be. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Me mu obo Mwana a mbwuru ka agyi mu kuulu baara basalala nde o, lo mu osalala ya ogwa laama li nde mu ofiri ekolo mu baara balagha.»<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu dzuhu binkpa-mihi byele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10.46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Yiisu ya binduono bi nde bu bakapala mu bvulu lili Dzeriko mpwumu a baara yi nene yíluono nde. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Ya, binkpa-mihi byele bíbwi nsini mu mukogho a nzili. Bo bu bagyughu ti Yiisu li mu okaluru, bábwi okehe bingubu: «Mfumu, Mwana a Dabvide, mono bihi nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Mpwumu a baara yífyeẽ bo mu ebaghala mu kuulu bo bakala pii. Lo bo bábvulu ofirikakehe bingubu mu mpini: «Mfumu, Mwana a Dabvide, mono bihi nyiĩ!» <verse eid="MAT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yiisu bu atemene, áti bo mbili ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Emakye be lidzyi ti me nsa mu be?» <verse eid="MAT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Bo bábvuhulu nde ti: «Mfumu, nyaã we dzubulu bihi mihi!» <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yiisu ámono bo nyiĩ, áberene a mihi mi bo, ya ŋaana oŋo, bo bábwi omono ya bánama nde.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu somo mu Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Dzã 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Bu bayabehene ya Yerusaleme ya bato ŋa Betefadze, ŋa bele a Munguo wu a mi-Olibve, Yiisu ágweghe binduono byele. <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ligye ku bula bu buli ŋa nkulu a be, ya oŋo, be sa limono eburu e aane ki baakuru ya mwana a nde. Linyana ya liyabiri me bye. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Ya kala ti mbwuru lyele be ndagha, be libvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu li a nzala a bye.” Ya nde sa anyaã bye bigye.» <verse eid="MAT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Mandagha ma mábwi mu kuulu mi ólyele mubighili mitswighi:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />«<char style="qt">Lilyele kundaa mutughu wu a Siyõ ti:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">Mono mukogho a we li mu ogya kundaa we,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">nga-a-edzuunu, ya nde aakumu ŋa yulu a eburu e aane,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">ŋa yulu a pulu li aane, mwana a nyama wu akabiri bi biri</char>.»<verse eid="MAT 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Binduono bígyene ya bísi bwunu a bu ótumu bo Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Bo bágyene a eburu e aane ya pulu li aane, bátwulu ŋa yulu a biko bi bo, ya Yiisu ábwi nsini ŋa yulu a nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Mpwumu a baara yi alagha yíkagyala binkuru mu nzili, baara babake bátsyiri matsyiri ma miti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Matsyiri ma miti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ku ebaana basono ti: Bakatsyiri mampala ma miti ya bakagyala mo mu nzili (mu osa Yiisu nsia)</char></note> ya bágyala mo mu nzili. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Mampwumu ma máli ku nkulu ya ma máli ku mbihi a nde mákabulubiili bingubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">«<char style="qt">Odzaana kundaa Mwana a Dabvide</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Liseme kundaa munde wu li mu ogya mu nkwumu a Mfumu</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Odzaana mu bibini bi bili ku nkara a yulu!»</char><verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Yiisu bu asomo mu Yerusaleme, bvulu lwohono línyiŋi ya baara bákalyele ti: «Wu nande?» <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Mampwumu mákabvuhulu ti: «Wu me Yiisu, mubighili wu a ku Nadzarete, mu Ngalile.»<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu mu nzo a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Dzã 2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Yiisu bu asomo mu nzo a Nzaami, nde ábyi bo bwohono ba bákatyeghe ya ba bákaswumu munsa nzo a Nzaami, átsili batabele ba baakasobo nzi ya bipehe bi minta-nkaala a mabeeme ku mbala. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Ya nde ályele kundaa bo ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">«<char style="qt">Básono ti: “Nzo a me sa bata yo nzo yi a lisamana</char>”.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:13">
    <char style="qt">Lo be liikirili yo ngala a bantwumu!»</char><verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Binkpa-mihi ya banga-a-bipfwumu báyasele kundaa nde munsa nzo a Nzaami, ya nde ádzuhu bo. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya baluo-mikyene ka bámono esee o, bu bamono mandagha mama okiŋimi ma ókagyighili Yiisu, ya bike-bike bi bíkabiili bingubu munsa Nzo a nzaami ti: «<char style="qt">Odzana</char> kundaa Mwana a Dabvide!» <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />Bo bályele kundaa nde ti: «Bunu, we li mu ogyughu bu bali mu okalyele bo?» Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Eẽ! Bunu, be nkini ka lítala o ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="qt">“We ási kuulu ti miŋma mi mana bike-bike ya mimi ba bali mu okaŋma mabyene, miwa we masyighi?</char>”»<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Ya bu abulusihi bo oŋo, nde ápala mu bvulu ya ágyene ku Betani, ku áluhu nde mpyibi.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu gwi muti a finge epwolo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11.12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Mu minkya-nkya, Yiisu bu akayabvughuru ku bvulu, nzala yifuru nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Yiisu bu ataala mufinge mu mukogho a nzili, áyabehene ya nde, lo nde ka ámono elogho o, yini a matsyiri. Nde ályele kundaa nde ti: «Si okala ka bunu, we ka kughu ofiriburu bimburu o!» Ya mufinge ásaakee. <verse eid="MAT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Binduono bu bimono obo, bíkiŋimi ya bílyele ti: «Bunu-abo mufinge aasaakee?» <verse eid="MAT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mu engaŋma me ndyele kundaa be ti, kala ti be lili a kana ya ka lisi mikeme o, be ka ligyighili yini a mi nsi me mu mufinge o, lo be lilyele kundaa munguo wu ti: “Mara oŋo ya yibwa mu mubu”, lo sa okala obo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Nswe ki akala liiluomo be mu lisamana, bu lisi kana, be sa libagha kye.»<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Litumu li Yiisu kunu liikafa?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11.27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Yiisu ásomo mu nzo a Nzaami. Mu matala ma ákaluo nde, bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakwuru ba ba-Dzwife báyasele ya bályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu nsa litumu we li mu okabulugyighili mamo? Ya na aagwi we litumu lilo?» <verse eid="MAT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Mehe si ndi a efwulu, yini a emõ ki aangwa me be, kala ti be ligwi me mvuru, mehe si sa ndyele kundaa be munsa litumu me ndi mu okabulugyighili mamo. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />“Nande áagweghe Dzã mu oboghoro baara? Nzaami bwunu we baara?” Bo báfuhunu bo-a-bo ndiri: Kala lilyele ti: “Nzaami”, nde sa alyele kundaa bihi-a-be ti: “Bu mu emakye be liigwene okasa kana mu nde?” <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Ya limana olyele ti: “Baara”, bihi-a-be lifaana osa mayele mu mpwumu a baara, mu kuulu baara bwohono baakagwolo Dzã ti mubighili.» <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Mu obo, bo bábvuhulu kundaa Yiisu ti: «Bihi ka lisoolo.» Ya ndehe si ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mehe si ka andyele be munsa litumu me ndi mu okabulugyighili mamo o.»<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a baana buolo ba babaghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yiisu áfirilyele ti: «Be bunu litsimi mu ndagha yi? Baghala mumõ áli a baana buolo. Bu ayasele kundaa wu a nsomo, ályele kundaa nde ti: “Mwana me, gye yisala lolo ku nseghe a bviini.” <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Mwana ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Me ka ndzyi o”. Ya mana matala bu maluru, mwana ásobo bitsimi ya ágyene ku nseghe a bviini. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Nde bu ayasele kundaa wu a buolo, ályele kundaa nde bwunu obo. Mwana ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu, me ndi mu ogye”. Lo, ka ágyene o. <verse eid="MAT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />Mu bo buolo nande aasi waa li taara a nde?» Bo bábvuhulu ndiri: «Wu a nsomo». Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mu engaŋma, me ndyele kundaa be ti, mintolo-mpagha ya bakaha banga-a-enkwunu sa batswama nkulu ya be mu Emfumu e Nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Buulu Dzã ali aagyi kundaa be mu nzili yi a bunsumu, ya be ka liisi kana mu nde o, lo mintolo-mpagha ya bakaha banga-a-enkwunu baasi kana mu nde. Ya ku nkulu, be bu limono obo, be ka liigyiŋi mayele o mu osa kana mu nde.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi binkamana bi bviini bi bibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />«Ligyughu nkumu yinke. Óli a nga-a-nzo wu ákunu nseghe a bviini. Nde ási yo ekagha, átsimi dzunu li baakakamana mala ya átwu nzo yi mutele wu mula. Ya ŋa mbihi, nde ágwihini ya binkamana bi bviini bikasalala o bo yo, ya nde ágyene midzye.» <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Matala mama otolo bimburu bu mato, nde ágweghe basala ba nde kundaa binkamana bi bviini mu ogwolo kaba lili ndaa nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Lo binkamana bi bviini bíbwirili basala ba nde, mumõ bákaha nde nswa-nswa, wunu bádzwi nde, wu muke bádzwi nde mu mameẽ. <verse eid="MAT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />Nde áfirigweghe basala babake ba babvulu olagha ya baba nsomo, ya bágyighili bumõ kundaa bo si. <verse eid="MAT 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />Ŋa masini, nde ágweghe bo mwana a nde, ya ályele ti: «Bo sa bagwa mwana a me budziri.» <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Lo binkamana bi bviini bu bimono mwana, bíbili bo-a-bo ti: «Wu me wu aagwolo pfa li taara a nde! Ligya, litswe lidzwa nde ya ligwolo pfa li nde.» <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Bu babwirili nde, bátsili nde ku mbala a nseghe a bviini ya bádzwi nde. <verse eid="MAT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Obo me buulu, ŋa akala oogya mfumu a nseghe a bviini, nde bunu aasa mu binkamana bi bviini bi? <verse eid="MAT 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Nde sa adzwa ba babi babo ku ogwene a nyiĩ, ya nde sa agwihini ya binkamana bi bviini bikimi bikasalala o bo yo, bi akala bikagwa nde bimburu mu matala ma bye.» <verse eid="MAT 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Ya Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Bunu, be nkini ka lítala mi básono o:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">“Limeẽ li ootsili ba baakatwu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">me lo ayi lili li linsomo ŋa mutswunu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">ndagha oyo yifi kundaa Mfumu</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">ya ŋa mihi mi bihi, yili ndagha yi okiŋimi</char>!”»<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />«Me mu obo me ndyele kundaa be ti: Emfumu e Nzaami, sa bamaha be kye, mu ogwa kye kundaa ekaana ekimi ki eeburu bimburu mu kye. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />[ Nswe munde wu akala aabwa ŋa yulu a limeẽ li sa atsaŋama, ya nswe munde wu liibwirili lo, sa apweẽ.]» <verse eid="MAT 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya ba-Faridzyẽ bu bagyughu mankumu mamo, bábaghala ti Yiisu me mu bo ákabili. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Bo bákasagha bunu baasyimi nde, lo bábara nzalamweẽ a mampwumu ma baara, mu kuulu mo mákagwolo Yiisu ti mubighili.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi kyiri kii mabala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Yiisu áfiribili kundaa bo mu mankumu, ya ályele ti: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />«Emfumu ki mayulu efaana ya mukogho mutsyini wu áagyighili kyiri ki mabala ma mwana a nde. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Nde ágweghe basala ba nde mu oyita ba bágwi mpighi a kyiri kii mabala mbili, lo bo ka bádzyi ogya o. <verse eid="MAT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />Nde áfirigweghe basala bakimi ya ályele bo mu otuoho mukyene wu kundaa ba bágwi mpighi: “Mu matala ma, baamana onaã bi-odza, baadzwi bangoomo ya bibuolo bi me bibi maala, byehene biikughu, ligya ku odza!” <verse eid="MAT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />Lo babo ba bágwi mpighi, bágyene obo ku ogwene okihi mbili, mumõ ku manseghe ma ndeme, wu muke ku nkaala a nde, <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />bana bu babwirili basala ba nde, bátughu bo ya bádzwi bo. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Mukogho ákolo nkehe. Nde ágweghe bambumbulu ba nde mu oyidzwa babo ba baadzwi basala ba nde ya otsughu bvulu li bo mbaa. <verse eid="MAT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />Ŋa nseele, nde ályele kundaa basala ba nde ti: “Byehene bibi kyiri kii mabala biikughu, lo ba baagwi mpighi ka baakakala ba bafaana o. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Ligye mu mapfulu, ya lita baara bwohono ba liimono be mbili bagya ku kyiri.” <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Basala ba nde bápala, bágyene mu manzili ya bábvughu baara bwohono ba bámono bo, ba babi ya ba babwe. Mbala a kyiri yílwulu mu baara. <verse eid="MAT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />Mukogho bu agyi mu okabulutala ba baagyi ku kyiri, nde ámono mbwuru wuulu ka álaha enkuru kii kyiri o. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Nde áfwulu kundaa nde ti: “Ndughu a me, we bunu aasi mu osomo mu kuu ogwene a enkuru kii kyiri?” Lo mbwuru munde ka ábvuhulu nde ndagha o. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Mu obo mukogho ályele kundaa basala ba nde ti: “Likuru nde misyi mu myili ya mu myaã, litsili nde ku mbaala ku oli mpyibi, oko ku ookala bilili ya odza myini.” <verse eid="MAT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Baara balagha báti mbili, lo ba básuolo bali ndaama.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofiri mpagha kundaa Sedzare</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Mu obo, ba-Faridzyẽ báyikuru mfwunu bunu baaleghebe Yiisu mwere mu mi aabili nde. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Ŋa mbihi bo bágweghe kundaa nde binduono bi bo, emõ ya baara baba emvuŋunu ki Erode mu olyele ti: «Muluo, bihi ligyahaba ti we nga a engaŋma ya ti we li mu okabululuo baara nzili a Nzaami mu engaŋma, ku ogwene a obara mbwuru, mu kuulu we ka aakatala baara mu bidzili o. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Lo lyele bihi, we bunu tsimi mu ndagha yi: Oli a muswa mu ofiri mpagha kundaa Sedzare bwunu we pele?» <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Lo Yiisu bu asoolo bitsimi bi bo bi bibi, ályele kundaa bo ndiri: «Bampibi! Mu emakye be lidzyi otsihi me? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Lisuo me mupara wu baakafiri mpagha.» Bo básuo nde denali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Denye, mupara wu esyeẽ wu bákafiri mpagha mu nde</char></note> mumõ. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Nde áfwulu kundaa bo ti: «Edzili ki ya bisono bi bibi na?» <verse eid="MAT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Bibi ndaa Sedzare.» Mu obo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Libvurulu bibi Sedzare kundaa Sedzare, ya bibi Nzaami kundaa Nzaami.» <verse eid="MAT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Bo, bu bagyughu mandagha mamõ, bákiŋimi, bábulusihi nde ya bágyene.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Efwulu mu osighili mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12.18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Mu etsughu ekye, ba-Saduseyẽ ba baakalyele ti osighili mu lipfu ka oli o, báyabehene ku bele a Yiisu ya bo báfwulu nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />«Muluo, Moyidze ályele ti: <char style="qt">“Kala ti baghala kpi ku ogwene oburu baana, mbwee a nde sa akie mupfiili, mu oburu nde baana</char>”. <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Ku bula bu bihi óli a baana nsaama ba baghala baba taara mumõ. Wu a nsomo, kie mukala, kpi ku ogwene a baana, ya sihi mukala a nde kundaa mbwee wu aanama nde. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Bumõ si kundaa wu a buolo, kundaa wu batere ya tee mu bo bwohono nsaama. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ŋa nseele, ŋa mbihi a bo bwohono, mukaha kpi. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Lo ŋa akala oosighili baara mu lipfu, nde mukala a na aakala, buulu bo bansa nsaama áli balumu ba nde?» <verse eid="MAT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Be liigwuŋumu, mu kuulu ngu okala Bisono, ngu okala lileene li Nzaami, be ka lisoolo bye o. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ŋa akala oosighili baara mu lipfu, ka okala a balumu o, bwunu we bakala o, lo bo sa bakala ti anga bangye-yulu mu yulu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Ya, mu mi mitala osighili o ba bákpi, be ka lítala ndagha yi ólyele be Nzaami o ti: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" />“<char style="qt">Me ndi Nzaami a Abarahame, Nzaami a Idzake, ya Nzaami a Dzakobe</char>?” Nde ka li Nzaami a ba bákpi o, lo nde li Nzaami a baba mweẽ.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Mampwumu ma baara mákiŋimi ŋa mágyughu mo maluo ma nde.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukyene wu bvulu bunene</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Ba-Faridzyẽ bu bagyughu ti Yiisu aakuru miŋma mi ba-Saduseyẽ, bo bábvuŋunu ŋa ebini kyini ekye. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Ya mumõ mu bo, muluo-mikyene bu adzyi otsihi Yiisu, áfwulu nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />«Muluo, nsa mukyene bvulu bunene mu Mikyene?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: « “<char style="qt">Dzyi Mfumu Nzaami a we mu mukolo a we wohono, mu mugwumu a we wohono ya mu mayele ma we mwohono</char>”. <verse eid="MAT 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38" />Munde me mukyene wu bvulu bunene ya wu a nsomo. <verse eid="MAT 22:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Wu a myele wu a faana a nde me wu: “<char style="qt">Dzyi nganda-mbwuru a we ti budzyi weme</char>”. <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Mikyene myehene ya mibighili mili kunsa mikyene myele mi.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kriste ya Dabvide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12.35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Buulu ba-Faridzyẽ áli bábvuŋunu, Yiisu áfwulu kundaa bo ti: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />«Etsimi e be bunu eli mu nkooro a Kriste? Nde mwana a na ali?» Bo bábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Wu a Dabvide.» <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Lo bunu-a-bo, mu Mufulu, Dabvide áti nde “Mfumu”, ŋa ályele ti:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />
    <char style="qt">Mfumu aalyele kundaa Mfumu a me ti:</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">Bwa nsini ŋa kwogho e me kii babaghala</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">tee ŋa aantwulu me mitaara mi we ŋa nsie a myili mi we</char>?<verse eid="MAT 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />Kala ti Dabvide li mu ota nde “Mfumu”, lo bunu nde akughu ofirikala mwana a nde?» <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />Mbwuru si mumõ ka ákughu ogwa Yiisu mvuru mu ndagha nsyini o. Ya obaana etsughu ekye, ka oli a mbwuru wu áafirikabagha bukyini mu ogwa nde bifwulu o.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s1">Osa mayele mu Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar 12.38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luk 11.43</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20.45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Mu obo Yiisu ábili kundaa mampwumu ma baara ya kundaa binduono bi nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />«Esala ki Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ me mu okabaala Mikyene mi Moyidze. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Be, liikagyighili ya liikakebe mandagha mwohono ma baakalyele bo be, lo ka likanama bigyighili bi bo o, mu kuulu bo baakabili, lo ka baakagyighili mi baakabili o. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Bo baakakuru matsulu [mama leme ya mpara mu obiri] ya baakanaã mo ŋa yulu a bisaŋama bi baara. Lo bomo, ka baakaberene a mo mu mulyeme o. <verse eid="MAT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />Bigyighili bi bo byehene bili mu nzala a omoŋono ŋa mihi mi baara. Bo baakagyighili mipa mi minene mu básono mandagha ma Nzaami mi baakalaha ŋa yulu a mbwi bwunu we ŋa kwogho mu matala ma baakasamana bo, ya baakalabala manto ma binkuru bi bo. <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Bo badzyi bibini bi binsomo mu byiri bibi odza ya bibini bi binsomo mu manzo ma lisamana ma ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Ya bo badzyi ti bakagwa bo mamboro mu bibini bibi baara bwohono, ya badzyi ti baara bakata bo <char style="qt">Muluo </char>.<verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />Lo be, banyaã okata be <char style="qt">Muluo</char>, mu kuulu be lili a Muluo yini a mumõ, ya be bwohono lili bakulu ya bambwee. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Ka likata mbwuru si mumõ “Taara” a be ŋa nsie o. Mu kuulu be lili a nde yini a mumõ, Taara wu li ku yulu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Banyaã si okata be “Mugyihi wu munene”, mu kuulu be lili a mugyihi yini a mumõ, ngu Kriste. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Wu bvulu bukwuru ŋa kara li be akala musala a be. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />Munde wu aakumu sa basurulu nde, ya munde wu aasughuru sa bakuhubu nde.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />«Nyiĩ kundaa be Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ! Be lili bampibi, mu kuulu be liikakahaba baara osomo mu Emfumu ki mayulu. Beme ka liikasomo omo o, ya be ka liikagwa baara ba badzyi osomo omo nzili o!» [<verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />Nyiĩ kundaa be Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ! Be lili bampibi, mu kuulu be liikagwolo busini bwohono bubu bapfiili baba bakaha ya be liikasa nsamana yi nda mu kuulu baara bamono be. Me mu obo, Nzaami sa alamana be mu nkehe.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />Nyiĩ kundaa be Baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ, be lili bampibi! Mu kuulu be liikadzye mu bibini byehene bibi ŋa nsie ya mu mibu mu obagha mbwuru mumõ wu aakihi osomo mu emvuŋunu e be. Ya be bu libagha nde, be likirili nde mwana wu a mungele a mbaa, wu bvulu be mansa mwolo.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />Nyiĩ kundaa be, mimbiri mi binkpa-mihi mi miikalyele ti: «Munde wu aalaba mukihi mu nzo a Nzaami, ka li a ndagha o. Lo munde wu aalaba mukihi mu oore li nzo a Nzaami, nde faana okuhu mukihi a nde.» <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Be lili biwulu ya binkpa-mihi! Emakye ebvulu mupfunu: Oore bwunu we nzo a Nzaami yi aakagwa lo bungili? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Ya be liifirikalyele ti: «Munde wu aalaba mukihi mu ebini ki baakatsughu bikaba ka li a ndagha o. Lo munde wu aalaba mukihi mu ekaba ki baatwulu ŋa yulu a ebini ekye, nde faana okuhu mukihi a nde.» <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Binkpa-mihi! Emakye ebvulu mupfunu: Ekaba bwunu we ebini ki baakatsughu bikaba eekasa ti ekaba ekala kii ngili? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />Munde wu aalaba mukihi mu ebini ki baakatsughu bikaba aakalaba nde mu ebini e kye ya mu bilogho byehene bi bili ŋa yulu a kye. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />Ya munde wu aakalaba mukihi mu nzo a Nzaami aakalaba nde mu yo ya mu munde wu aakakala munsa yo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />Munde wu aalaba mukihi mu nkwumu a yulu, aakalaba mukihi mu likubu li Nzaami ya mu munde wu aakabwa nsini ŋa yulu a lo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />Nyiĩ kundaa be baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ baara baba bampibi! Mu kuulu be liikagwa kaba lili kwumu lili mampihi-a-mpihi ya lili miswoho mimi nkwumu anete ya kumine, ya be liikameŋene bi bibvulu mupfunu mu mikyene: Bunsumu, mukolo wu a nyiĩ ya kana. Me mimye be likaakasa ya ogwene a omeŋene mi mike si. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Mimbiri mi ókpi mihi, be liikakele mala ma be mu omaha bimpimpi, lo be liikamini nyama wu baakata syamo wu mutsyini!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />Nyiĩ kundaa be baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ, be lili bampibi! Mu kuulu be liikatsehebe mbihi a ebaha ya mbihi a ndoŋo, lo kunsa kara bilwulu mu bilogho bibi pfyibi ya mu nzala a mandagha ma mabi. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />We mu-Faridzyẽ wu enkpa-mihi! Matswama otsehebe ebaha mu kara, mu kuulu ebaha ekala si ki etsyeme ku mbala.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />Nyiĩ kundaa be baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ be lili bampibi! Mu kuulu be lili ti anga mampyeme ma bágyogho mpeeme. Ku mbala mo maakamoŋono ma mabwe. Lo kunsa kara mo malwulu mu miwehe mi ba bákpi ya nyara yi alagha. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Bumõ si kundaa be, ku mbala be liikamoŋono ti baba bunsumu, lo kunsa kara be lili bampibi ya liilwulu mu bubi.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />Nyiĩ kundaa be baluo-mikyene ya ba-Faridzyẽ be lili bampibi! Be ba liikatwu mampyeme ma mibighili ya be liikabwehe mampyeme ma baba bunsumu, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />ya be liikalyele ti: «Kala ti bihi áli liili mu matala mama bataara ba bihi, nkini bihi ka líkaakala mfwunu mõ ya bo mu otsala makili ma mibighili o.» <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Mu obo, be lili bampughulu ba beme ti be lili baana ba babo ba bádzwi mibighili. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Lo be, limana esala ki óbaana bataara ba be! <verse eid="MAT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />Be lili bantaala, etswumu kii bampili! Bunu-abo be likughu ogweŋẽ masyeme ma mungele a mbaa?<verse eid="MAT 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Me mu obo, me ngweghe mibighili, bansughu ya baluo-mikyene kundaa be. Be sa lidzwa bana mu bo ya likomo bo ŋa kuruwa, be sa likaha babake nswa-nswa mu manzo mama lisamana ma ba-Dzwife, ya be sa libyi bo mu mabvulu ya mabvulu. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Mu kuulu makili ma baba bunsumu mwohono ma mátsaŋama ŋa nsie, obaana makili ma Abele, wu a bunsumu tee mu Dzakari mwana a Baraki, wu lídzwi be ŋa kara li ebini ki baakatsughu bikaba ya ngwumu yi a ngili, mabwa ŋa yulu a be. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" /><char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele kundaa be ti: «Masyeme mwohono mamo sa mabwa ŋa yulu a eseene ki!»<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lili mu nkooro a Yerusaleme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luk 13.34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />«Yerusaleme, Yerusaleme, we wu aakadzwa mibighili ya wu aakadzwa bantumu ba baakagweghe we mu mameẽ. Matala malagha me aakansagha obvughu baana ba we ti anga bu ookakogho nsuhu baana ba nde kunsa mapaba. Lo we ka dzyi o. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Mono! Nzo a be sa yisyili mukaŋana. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Mu kuulu, me ndyele kundaa be ti be akala ka liifirimono me o, tee mu matala ma liilyele be ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 23:39">
    <char style="qt">Munde wu aagya mu nkwumu a Mfumu, li wu liseme!</char>»<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu bighili otsaŋama o Nzo a Nzaami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Yiisu ápala mu Nzo a Nzaami, ya bu abaana ogye, binduono bi nde bíyasele kundaa nde mu osuo nde bu bátwu Nzo a Nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Nde ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Be lili mu okamono bilogho byehene bi? <char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele be, ka akala osyili limeẽ ŋa yulu a limeẽ ŋa ebini ki o, byehene sa bitsaŋama.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masini ya makimini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13.3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Bu abwi nsini ŋa Munguo wu a mi-Olibve, binduono bíyasele kundaa nde mu libee, ya bílyele nde ndiri: «Lyele bihi, munsa matala mandagha mamo akala maamoŋono, ya nsa elyimi eesuo ogya o we ya masini ma nsie.» <verse eid="MAT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «Lisa mayele, mbwuru anyaã odzihibi be. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Mu kuulu, balagha akala baagya mu nkwumu a me, ya sa balyele ti: “Me ngu Kriste!” Ya sa badzihibi baara balagha. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Be sa ligyughu bakabili mu mamvulu ya mu nsia a mamvulu mama ku la. Likala yeelee! Ka likala a nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu mandagha mamo mafaana ogya, lo mamo nkini ka mali masini o. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Mu kuulu baara ba nsie mõ sa batemene mu oyidzwana a baara baba nsie yinke, ya mukogho mumõ sa atemene mu oyidzwana a mukogho wu muke, sa okala a munzyala, ya nsie sa yinyiŋi mansa malagha. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Myehene mimye ngu ebaana ki misuo mii oburu. <verse eid="MAT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />Mu matala mamõ sa batara be mu kuulu bamwehẽ be kimini, ya sa badzwa be, sa babele be kundaa bikaana byehene mu nkooro a nkwumu a me. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Ya mu matala mamo, balagha akala baabwa, bo-a-bo sa batara bambaala ya sa babele bambaala. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Mibighili milagha mimi mpya sa mipala ya sa midzihibi baara balagha. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Mu nkooro a bubi ba buubvulu, dzyi li baara balagha sa liwolo. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Lo munde wu asa mukama tee ku masini, sa abvwughu. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Sa batsala Nsia yi Mbwe yi a Emfumu yi mu nsie yohono, mu kuulu yo yisuo bumpughulu kundaa bikaana byehene. Me oŋo akala masini maagya.»<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimini li lilagha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />«Ŋa akala liimono be mu ebini kii ngili <char style="qt">Ngughu a bubi ba buukabyihi</char>, bu áli ólyele mubighili Danyele, nyaã wu li mu otala abaghala. <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />Mu matala mamo, babo ba baakala mu Yude, nyaã babara ku yulu a minguo. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Munde wu aakala ku yulu a see li nzo lili eyala, anyaã osughuru mu otolo bilogho bi bili munsa nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Munde wu aakala ku manseghe, anyaã obvughuru ku mbihi mu oyigwolo enkuru ki ela kii kobo. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Nyiĩ kundaa bakaha ba baakala a mayimi ya ba baakala mu otsyaha baana mu bitsughu bibye! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Lisamana Nzaami mu kuulu be linyaã obara mu ndo yi a mpie yi alagha, ya mu etsughu kii sabate. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Mu kuulu oŋo sa okala a mpara yi alagha, yiili nkini ka yimaabwa o, obaana ku ebaana e nsie tee mu matala ma, ya kimini lii obo ka lifirikala o. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Ya kala ti mutala a bitsughu bibye ka bási nde wu a sala o, nkini mbwuru si mumõ ka ákaabvwughu o. Lo mu nkooro a ba ósuolo Nzaami, bitsughu bibye sa bikala bi bisala. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Me mu obo, kala ti mbwuru lyele kundaa be ti: “Kriste li ŋa!” Bwunu we: “Nde li ŋanii!” Ka lisa nde kana o. <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Mu kuulu, bakriste baba mpya ya mibighili mimi mpya sa batemene. Bo sa basa bilyimi bi binene ya mandagha mama okiŋimi mu eteese kii odzihibi, ngu oli ba básuolo kala ti okughu okala. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Me aangyehe be!<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luk 17.23-24</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:37">37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />Lo kala balyele kundaa be ti: “Limono, nde li ku syehe”, ka ligye oko o. Bwunu we balyele ti: “Limono nde aasweme ŋa”, ka lisa nde kana o. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Mu kuulu, bwunu a bu ookasehene musehene a nzele ku ookapala tala tee ku ookadzyama tala, bwunu obo si ogya o Mwana a mbwuru akala ookala. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Ŋa ebini ki ookala ebyimi, me oŋo bango-mbimi akala baabvuŋunu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ogya o Mwana a mbwuru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13.24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />«Ŋaana oŋo, ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bibye bibi kimini lili lagha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">tala sa likala mpyibi</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">mweele wu a ngoono ka afirigwa otsyeme o</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">baŋomaŋomo sa babwa ŋa nsie</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">ya lileene lili mayulu sa linyiŋi</char>.<verse eid="MAT 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />Oŋo elyimi e Mwana a mbwuru sa epala mu yulu, ya baara baba bitswumu byehene bi bili ŋa nsie sa basyama mu bilili, ya sa bamono <char style="qt">Mwana a mbwuru bu aagya mu bidzi bi mayulu</char> mu lileene ya mu nsia yi nene. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Ya nde sa agweghe bangye-yulu ba nde ya mvulu-a-mvulu yi nene, ya bo sa babvughu baba ndaa nde ba ásuolo mu manto ma nsie mansa mana, tee mu nto ya nto yi a mayulu.»<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi a mufinge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13.28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />«Libaghala nkumu yi a mufinge: Manto ma mampala ma nde kala ayi mineŋe ya kala ti matsyiri maafulu, lo be lisoolo ti dzwa liibehene. <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Bumõ si, ŋa akala liimono be mandagha mwohono mamo, lo be lisoolo ti Mwana a mbwuru ayi aayabehene, nde ayi be-bele. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" /><char style="qt">Mu ngaŋma</char> me ndyele kundaa be ti, eseene ki ka eluru o, nsomo mandagha mwohono mamo maakughu.<verse eid="MAT 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Yulu ya nsie sa biluru, lo mandagha ma me ka maluru o.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yini a Nzaami soolo matala mama masini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13.32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luk 17.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">17.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />«Mu mi mitala etsughu ekye ya matala mamo, mbwuru si mumõ ka soolo bye o, ngu okala bangye-yulu ba mayulu, ngu okala Mwana, yini a Taara nde ngasighi. <verse eid="MAT 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />Bwunu a bu óli mu bitsughu bi Nowe, bwunu obo si ogya o Mwana a mbwuru ookala. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Bwunu a bu óli baara [babo] mu bitsughu bi bítswama ndwuru a madza yi nene, bo bákadza ya bákaŋma, bo bákakie ya bákakwehe, tee mu etsughu ki ósomo Nowe mu bwara ba bunene. <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />Bo ka bákasoolo o, tee ŋa ógyi ndwuru a madza yi nene yi áabiri bo bwohono. Me bwunu obo [si] ookala ogya o Mwana a mbwuru. <verse eid="MAT 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />Mu obo, mu baara buolo ba baakala mu nseghe, sa bagwolo mumõ, ya sa basihi wu muke. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Mu bakaha buolo ba bali mu okasighi mburu ŋa yulu a limeẽ li baakasighi mburu, sa bagwolo mumõ, ya sa basihi wu muke.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />Mu obo, be likahala mihi, mu kuulu be ka lisoolo o nsa etsughu Mfumu a be akala aagya.<verse eid="MAT 24:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Be lisoolo ti kala nga-a-nzo áli gyahaba matala mama mpyibi ma oogya muturu, nkini nde ákaakahala mihi, ya ka ákaatala o ti babulu nzo a nde. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Me mu obo, behe si, likala yeelee, mu kuulu Mwana a mbwuru sa agya mu matala maala be ka likala a etsimi o.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Musala wu bunsumu ya wu gwene a bunsumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luk 12.41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />«Nande li musala wu bunsumu ya wu li a mayele, wuulu mfumu aagwi nde litumu ŋa yulu a baara ba nzo a nde mu ogwa bo bi-odza mu matala ma mafaana? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Esee kundaa musala munde, wuulu mfumu a nde bu agyi yabagha nde ŋa yulu a esala ekye. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" /><char style="qt">Mu ngaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa be ti, nde sa agwa nde emfumu ŋa yulu a bilogho bi nde byehene. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Lo, kala ti musala li wu mubi ya etsimi kunsa mukolo a nde ti: “Mfumu a me ka ali mu obaagya o”, <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />ya bwi okaha banganda ba nde baba esala, bwi odza ya oŋma ya binkolo-mala, <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />mfumu a musala munde sa agya mu etsughu kiili nde ka ali mu okakebe nde o, ya mu matala maala nde ka agyahaba o. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Mfumu sa abyi nde ya musala munde sa ebagha masyeme emõ ya bampibi, oko ku ookala bilili ya odza myini.»<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi batughu kwumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />«Emfumu ki mayulu efaana a batughu baba nkyini kwumu, baala bu bagwolo miindi mi bo, bápala mu oyibwana mulumu. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Bataana mu bo báli biwulu, ya bataana babake báli ya mayele. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Batughu baba biwulu, bu bagwolo miindi, ka bágwolo maala o. <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Lo batughu baba mayele bágwolo miindi mi bo ya maala mu mana a mambwara. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Mulumu bu ágwene obaagya, bo bwohono bátuo ensama ya bágyoŋomo tolo. <verse eid="MAT 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />Mu kara-a-kara li mpyibi, engubu ébwi: “Mulumu ndeghe! Lipala liyibwana a nde.” <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Mu obo batughu bwohono básighili ya bábwi ogyighili miindi mi bo. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Batughu baba biwulu bályele kundaa batughu baba mayele ti: “Ligwa bihi mana ndaama a maala ma be, mu kuulu miindi mi bihi mili mu okagye ku odzimi.” <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Lo babo baba mayele bábvuhulu kundaa bo ti: “Pele! Mo ka makughu mu bihi ya mu be o. Ligye kundaa minta-nkaala ya liswumu maala mama ndaa beme.” <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Mu matala ma bágyene bo ku oyiswumu maala, mulumu áyato, ya batughu ba báli yeelee básomo munsa nzo a kyiri kii mabala, ya bákuru muŋma a nzo. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Ŋa mbihi oŋo, batughu bataana babake bágyi, ya bákalyele ti: “Mfumu, mfumu, dzubulu bihi nzo!” <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Lo nde ábvuhulu ti: “<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele kundaa be ti, me ka nsoolo be o.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />«Me mu obo, likahala mihi, mu kuulu be ka lisoolo o, ngu okala etsughu, ngu okala matala.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkumu yi batalanta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luk 19.11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />«Sa okala ti anga mbwuru wu li mu okagye ku midzye, nde áti basala ba nde mbili ya ágwi bo busini bu nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Kundaa mumõ nde ágwi batalanta bataana, kundaa wunu nde ágwi buolo, kundaa wu muke nde ágwi mumõ, bwunu a bu oli mpini a mbwuru-mbwuru, ya nde ágyene midzye. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Musala wu áabagha batalanta bataana áyisalala mu bo ya ábagha bataana bakimi ŋa yulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Bwunu obo si, wu bágwi batalanta buolo ábagha batalanta buolo bakimi. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Lo munde wu bágwi talanta mumõ, áyitsimi dzunu mu nsie ya ásweghe nzi a mfumu a nde omo.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />Matala malagha bu maluru, mfumu a basala áyabvughuru. Ya nde áfwulu bo bunu-a-bo básalala nzi a nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Munde wu bágwi batalanta bataana áyasele ya ásuo batalanta bataana bakimi ya ályele ndiri: “Mfumu, we áli aagwi me batalanta bataana, mono batalanta bataana bakimi ba aafirimbagha me.” <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Mfumu a nde ályele kundaa nde ndiri: “Bubwe! We li musala wu mubwe ya wu a bunsumu. We aasuo bunsumu mu bi bisala, me sa ngwa we litumu mu bi bibvulu mupfunu. Gya, ya kala mu esee ya mfumu a we.” <verse eid="MAT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />Ŋa mbihi, munde wu bágwi batalanta buolo áyasele ya ályele ti: “Mfumu, we áli aagwi me batalanta buolo, mono batalanta buolo bakimi ba aambagha me.” <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Mfumu a nde ályele kundaa nde ndiri: “Bubwe! We li musala wu mubwe ya wu a bunsumu. We aasuo bunsumu bu we mu bi bisala, me sa ngwa we litumu mu bi bibvulu mupfunu. Gya, ya kala mu esee ya mfumu a we.” <verse eid="MAT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />Ŋa masini, wu bágwi talanta mumõ bu ayasele si, nde ályele ti: “Mfumu, me nsoolo ti we li mbwuru nga-a-mukolo mpini, we aakatolo mburu ŋa ebini kiili ka oli we aakunu o, we aakakwu mburu ŋa ebini kiili ka we aanyahala o. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Mu nzalamweẽ, me áayindzyighi talanta a we ku nsini a nsie. Gwolo talanta a we!” <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Lo mfumu a nde ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “We li musala wu mubi ya mubolo! We gyighili osoolo ti me aakantolo mburu ŋa ebini kiili ka oli me aankunu o, ya me aakankwu mburu ŋa ebini kiili ka me aanyahala o. <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Nkini áli we aatwulu nzi a me ku banke, mu kuulu ŋa aayamvughuru me, me ngwolo yo ya ndaana ŋa yulu. <verse eid="MAT 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />Ligwolo nde talanta wu ali a nde ya ligwa nde kundaa munde wu li a batalanta kwumu. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Mu kuulu, kundaa munde wu li a elogho, sa bafirigwa nde bi bibvulu, ya nde sa akala a bye bi bilagha. Lo, kundaa munde wuulu ka ali a elogho o, sa bamaha nde si okala enda-ndaama ki ali a nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Musala wu gwene a mupfunu wu, litsili nde kunsa mpyibi yi a ku mbala, oko ku ookala bilili ya odza myini.”»<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumfwunu wu masini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />«Ŋa akala oogya Mwana a mbwuru munsa nsia a nde, nzili mõ ya bangye-yulu bwohono, nde sa abwa nsini ŋa likubu li nde lili nsia. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Bikaana byehene sa bibvuŋunu ŋa nkulu a nde, ya nde sa akabala baara mu makaba mwolo, ti bu ookakabala munkaala-bibuolo bindoomo ya bantaba. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Nde sa atwulu bindoomo ku ngo-kwogho e nde ya bantaba ku engbambogho e nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />Oŋo mukogho sa alyele kundaa ba baakala ku ngo-kwogho e nde ti: “Ligya, be ba óseme Taara a me, libyala pfa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.34</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pfa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bwunu we mukobo, busini bu ookasihi mbwuru wu aakpi</char></note> li Emfumu ki bágyighili mu be obaana ku ebaana e nsie. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Mu engaŋma me aandi a nzala, ya be liigwi me bi-odza, me aandi a nyoro, ya be liigwi me bi-oŋma, me aandi munzyi, ya be liibwana a me. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Me aandi mpene, ya be liigwi me binkuru, me aandi mubyele ya be liiyatala me, me aandi mu boloko, ya be liiyatala me.” <verse eid="MAT 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />Mu obo, baara baba bunsumu sa babvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu, bu nki matala bihi ali liimono we ya nzala ya bihi liigwi we bi-odza, we ya nyoro, ya bihi liigwi we madza? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Bu nki matala bihi ali liimono we munzyi ya bihi liibwana a we, mpene ya bihi liigwi we binkuru? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Nki matala bihi ali liimono we mubyele bwunu we mu boloko, ya bihi liigyi kundaa we?”» <verse eid="MAT 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />Ya mukogho sa abvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe ŋa liikasa be obo kundaa mumõ mu ba babvulu osala ba, ba bali bambwee ya banaana ba me, me kundaa me be liikasa obo!»<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />«Ŋa nseele, mfumu sa alyele kundaa ba bali ku engbambogho e nde ti: “Be ba bágwi epwolo, ligye la ya me, ku mbaa yi aagwene okadzimi yi bágyighili mu nkooro a dyabulu ya bangye-yulu ba nde. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Mu kuulu me aandi ya nzala ya be ka liigwi me bi-odza o, me aandi ya nyoro ya be ka liigwi me madza o. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Me aandi munzyi ya be ka liibwana a me o, me aandi mpene ya be ka liigwi me binkuru o, me aandi mubyele ya mu boloko, ya be ka liiyamono me o.” <verse eid="MAT 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />Mu obo, boho si sa babvuhulu kundaa nde ti: “Mfumu, nki matala bihi áli liimono we ya nzala bwunu we ya nyoro, munzyi bwunu we mpene, mubyele bwunu we mu boloko, ya bihi liikwono oyabaha we?”» <verse eid="MAT 25:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />Nde sa abvuhulu kundaa bo ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa be ti: “Nswe ŋa liikwono osa be obo kundaa mumõ mu ba babvulu osala ba, me kundaa mehe si be liikwono osa obo!” <verse eid="MAT 25:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />Ya, bo sa bagye ku masyeme mama mibvu ya mibvu, ya baara baba bunsumu ku laama lili mibvu ya mibvu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12.2</ref></char></note>»<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s1">Mfwunu yi odzwa Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Dzã 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Yiisu bu amana ogwa maluo mwohono mamo, nde ályele kundaa binduono bi nde ti: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />«Be lisoolo ti, bitsughu byele bisyili mu oto kyiri kii Paake<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Opa 12.1-27</ref></char></note>, ya Mwana a mbwuru sa bagwa nde ŋa myaã mi baara mu kuulu bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Mu obo, bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu baba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife bábvuŋunu ku mbala nzo a mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami wu a nkwumu a Kayife. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Bo bákuru mfwunu mu osyimi Yiisu mu mayele mu kuulu badzwa nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Lo bo bákalyele ti: «Ka ŋa kara li kyiri o, mu kuulu mpaatsala yinyaã obwa ŋa nsa baara.»<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaha gyiri mananaase ŋa yulu a mutswi a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14.3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Dzã 12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Ya Yiisu bu áli ku Betani, ku nzo a Simõ nga-a-bwala, <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />mukaha mumõ áyasele kundaa nde ya mbwara yi a mu alabatere yi áalwulu mu mananaase mama ntala. Nde ágyiri mo ŋa yulu a mutswi a Yiisu ŋaala bo bábwi nsini ŋa tabele. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Binduono bu bimono obo, ka bímono esee o ya bílyele ti: «Mu emakye bapfihili mananaase ma? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Mu kuulu, ali bakughu otyeghe mo mu ntala yi alagha, ya ogwa nzi oyo kundaa bawele!»<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yiisu bu asoolo ndagha oyo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mu emakye be lili mu omweẽ mukaha wu mpara? Nde aagyighili ndagha yimbwe mu me. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Mu kuulu bawele, be sa likala ya bo mu matala mwohono<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Det 15.11</ref></char></note>. Lo me ka ankala ya be mu matala mwohono o. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Nde bu agyiri mananaase ma mu nyuru a me, nde aasi me mansagha ma baadzyighi me<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:8">Mar 14.8</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" /><char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele kundaa be ti: Nswe ebini ki akala baatsala Nsia yi Mbwe mu nsie nsyini, sa babili si mu yo, bu balibili nde mweẽ mu ndagha yi aagyighili nde.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda sagha bu aatyeghe Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Mu obo, mumõ mu kwumu ya buolo (12) wu a nkwumu Yuda Isikaryote, ágyene kundaa bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami, <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Be emakye liigwa me mu kuulu me ntyeghe nde kundaa be?» Bo bágwi nde makwumu matere (30) ma mipara<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Dza 11.12</ref></char></note> mimi bisyeẽ. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Obaana oŋo, nde ábwi osagha matala ma mabwe mu kuulu nde atyeghe bo Yiisu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu tumu binduono bi nde bibwehẽ kyiri kii Paake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14.12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luk 22.7-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">22.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Dzã 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Mu etsughu kii nsomo kii mampa ma magwene a pfini, binduono bíyalyele kundaa Yiisu ti: «Kunu-ako we dzyi ti bihi linaã we bi-odza bibi kyiri kii Paake?» <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Nde ályele ti: «Ligye ku bvulu kundaa mfu-nga-empele ya lilyele nde ti: “Muluo bu alyele ti: Matala ma me maabehene, ku nzo a we me aandza kyiri kii Paake ya binduono bi me.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Binduono bísi bwunu a bu ótumu bo Yiisu ya bábwehẽ kyiri kii Paake.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Nkonkolo bu yito, nde ábwi nsini ŋa tabele ya binduono kwumu ya byele (12).<verse eid="MAT 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele ti sa batyeghe nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:18-21">Mar 14.18-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22.21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Dzã 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Mu matala ma bákadza bo, Yiisu ályele ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char> me ndyele be, mumõ ŋa kara li be sa atyeghe me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Bo bányoõ ku olagha, bábaana olyele kundaa nde mumõ-mumõ ti: «Mfumu, me?» <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Nde ábvuhulu ti: «Munde wu aalo kwogho mu ndoõ sa limõ ya me<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mar 14.20. Bo bwohono áli okadza mu ndoŋo mo. Otala si mu Bik 41.10. </char></note>, me nde aatyeghe me. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Mwana a mbwuru li mu ogye bwunu a bu básono mu nde<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2-19">Bik 22.2-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Edz 53</ref></char></note>, lo nyiĩ kundaa munde wu li nzili yi baatyeghe Mwana a mbwuru! Ali bubwe banyaã oburu mbwuru munde!» <verse eid="MAT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Yuda wu aatyeghe nde ályele kundaa nde ti: «<char style="qt">Muluo</char>, me?» Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Weme lyele yo!»<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bi-odza bi Yiisu bibi masini ya binduono bi nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14.22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Kor 11.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Mu matala ma bákadza bo, Yiisu ágwolo limpa, ya bu aseme lo, nde átsyiri lo, nde ágwi lo kundaa binduono bi nde, ya nde ályele ti: «Ligwolo, lidza, yi me nyuru a me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Bu agwolo ebaha ya bu abvurulu matuono, ágwi bo kye ya ályele ti: «Liŋma kye be bwohono, <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />mu kuulu ma me makili ma me, makili mama ogwihini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Opa 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Dze 31.31-34</ref></char></note> ma maatsaŋama mu nkooro a baara ba balagha, mu kolokolo a masumu. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Me ndyele kundaa be ti: Me ka amfiriŋma mala ma bviini ma o tee mu etsughu ki akala aamfiriŋma me mo ma manyaghara emõ ya be mu Emfumu e Taara a me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Bu bamana ogyimi bikwumu bibi masyighi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bikwumu bi bákagyimi bo mu etsughu kii Kyiri kii Paake áli kii 113 tee kii 118, mu mukaana wu Bikwumu.</char></note>, bo bápala mu ogye ku Munguo wu a mi-Olibve.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu lyele ti Piere sa atunu nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Dzã 13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Mu obo Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mu mpyibi yiyi, be bwohono sa libwa mu nkooro a me. Mu kuulu básono ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">Me sa nkaha munkaala-bibuolo</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">ya bindoomo bibi mukaã a bibuolo sa bitsaŋama</char>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Dza 13.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note><verse eid="MAT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />Lo, ŋa akala aansighili me mu lipfu, me sa nswama ku Ngalile.» <verse eid="MAT 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />Piere ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Ngu okala ti bwohono sa babwa mu nkooro a we, si okala ka bunu, me ka ambwa o.» <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «<char style="qt">Mu engaŋma</char>, me ndyele kundaa we, mu mpyibi yi, nsomo mulumu a nsuhu akuolo, we sa tunu me mansa matere.» <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Piere ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ngu okala ti me mfaana okpa emõ ya we, si okala ka bunu, me ka ntunu we o.» Ya binduono byehene bílyele bwunu obo si.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu buono Nzaami ku Ngetesemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14.32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Yiisu bu ayato ya bo ŋa ebini kii nkwumu Ngetesemane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nkwumu Ngetesemane </char><char style="ft" closed="false">yidzyi olyele ti: ebini ki baakakamana maala. </char></note>, nde ályele kundaa binduono ti: «Libwa mansini ŋa, mu matala ma aayinsamana me Nzaami ŋanii.» <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Bu abiri Piere ya baana ba Nzebede bansa buolo, nde ábaana omono nyiĩ ya mukolo maã-maã. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Mu obo, nde ályele kundaa bo ti: «Muwumunu a me ayi ya nyiĩ tee mu eteese kii lipfu. Likala ŋa ya likahala mihi ya me.» <verse eid="MAT 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Nde bu agyene mana etiiri ki ela, ábwi edzili ŋa nsie, ábuono Nzaami ya ályele ti: «Taara a me, kala ali bukughu okala, nyaã ebaha ki eluru la ya me! Lo, ka bu ndzyi me o, lo bu dzyi we!» <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Nde áyabvughuru kundaa binduono ya nde ámono bye bigyoŋomo ensama. Nde ályele kundaa Piere ti: «Bu me buulu be ka liibagha mpini yi okeele ya me mu tala limõ o!» <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />«Likahala mihi ya lisamana mu kuulu be linyaã obwa mu bigyeele. Mufulu li a mpini, lo nyuru yikolo.» <verse eid="MAT 26:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Nde áfirigye la mu sa lili ywolo, ásamana ya ályele ti: «Taara a me, kala ti ebaha ki ekughu oluru kuulu me kye oŋma we, nyaã waa li we likala!» <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Ŋa mbihi, nde áfiriyabvughuru ya áyabagha bo mu ensama, mu kuulu mihi mi bo áli míleme. <verse eid="MAT 26:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Nde bu asihi bo, áfirigye la ya bo ya ásamana Nzaami mu sa lili tere. Nde áfirilyele mandagha maana mamõ. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Mu obo nde ábvughuru kundaa binduono ya lyele kundaa bo ti: «Mu matala ma, ligyoŋomo ya ligwumu o be! Mono, tala liibehene, ya Mwana a mbwuru sa bagwa nde ŋa myaã mi banga-a-masumu. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Litemene! Liyatswe! Limono, munde wu aatyeghe me maayabehene!»<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Basyimi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Dzã 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Nde áli nkini mu okabili, mono, Yuda, mumõ mu binduono kwumu ya byele (12), áyato ya mpwumu a baara yi nene yi áali a mapee ya mankwogho, ba ógweghe bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu baba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Ya munde wu aakatyeghe nde ágwi bo elyimi, ályele ti: «Munde wu aanyuburu me, me munde, lisyimi nde!» <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Ŋaana oŋo, nde áyasele kundaa Yiisu ya ályele ti: «<char style="qt">Muluo</char>, mboro a we!» Ya nde ányuburu nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Ndughu a me, esala ki aayasa we, sa kye!» Bu bayasele, bábwirili Yiisu ya básyimi nde. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Ya mono, mumõ mu ba bali ya Yiisu, bu apaha lipee li nde, átini musala a mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami, átsyiri nde tswi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:26">Dzã 18.26</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 26:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Mu obo, Yiisu ályele kundaa nde ti: «Bvurulu lipee li we ŋa likukuru li lo, mu kuulu babo ba baakagwolo lipee, sa bakpa mu lipee. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />We bunu tsimi, ti me ka nkughu obuono Taara a me o, mu kuulu nde agwa me ŋa-ŋa mikaã mi bangye-yulu kwumu ya myele (12)? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Lo bunu-abo Bisono bi biilyele ti ofaana okala obo biikeele?»<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Ŋa nseele, Yiisu ályele kundaa mampwumu ti: «Be liipala ya mapee ya mangbala mu osyimi me ti anga ntwumu! Nswe etsughu me aakambwa nsini munsa nzo a Nzaami mu okaluo, lo be ka liisyimi me o. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Lo myehene mimye miimoŋono mu kuulu mi básono ya mi ólyele mibighili mikeele.» Oŋo binduono byehene bíbulusihi nde ya bíbara.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ŋa nkulu a emvuŋunu ki ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14.53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22.63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Dzã 18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Ba básyimi Yiisu bábiri nde kundaa Kayife mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami, oko ku óbvuŋunu baluo-mikyene ya bakulu ba ba-Dzwife. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" />Piere ákanama nde la-la tee kunsa mbala a nzo a Mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami. Bu asomo kunsa kara, ábwi nsini ya bankyele ba Kayife mu omono bunu ndagha yi yiisughu.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya ekwuru ki ba-Dzwife kyehene bákasagha bumpughulu bubu mpya mu Yiisu mu kuulu batsyiri nde mukakana wu lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Lo bo ka bábagha o, ngu okala ti bampughulu baba mpya balagha báyamoŋono. Ŋa masini, babaghala buolo bágyi <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />ya bályele ti: «Mbwuru wu aakalyele ti: “Me nkughu otsala nzo a Nzaami ya ofiritwu yo mu bitsughu bitere.”» <verse eid="MAT 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami bu atemene, ályele kundaa nde ti: «We ka li a ndagha yi aabvuhulu mu bumpughulu bu baara ba mu we o?» <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Lo Yiisu ka átsughu ndagha o. Mukwuru a bangaa ba nzaami ályele kundaa nde ti: «Mu nkwumu a Nzaami wu a mweẽ, me nduomo we mu olyele bihi, kala ti we me Kriste, Mwana a Nzaami.» <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yiisu ábvuhulu kundaa nde ti: «Weme lyele yo. Lo me ndyele kundaa be ti, obaana matala ma, be sa limono <char style="qt">Mwana a mbwuru</char> ábwi nsini ŋa ngo-kwogho ki Nga-a-lileene ya <char style="qt">li mu okagya mu bidzi mu mayulu</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Bik 110.1</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Mu obo mfumu a bangaa ba nzaami ákaghala binkuru bi ndeme ya ályele ti: «Nde aatsaala Nzaami. Mu emakye bihi liifirikala a nzala a bampughulu? Be liigyughu bu aatsaala nde Nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Be bunu litsimi?» Bo bábvuhulu ti: «Nde faana okpa!» <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Oŋo bo bábwi otswulu nde manteẽ ku edzili ya okaha nde minkono, bana bákaha nde mampala<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Edz 50.6</ref></char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />ya bákalyele ti: «Kriste, bighili, nande mu bihi aakaha we?»<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Piere tunu Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14.66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luk 22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15">Dzã 18.15</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Piere áli ábwi nsini ku mbala a nzo. Musala mumõ wu mukaha bu ayasele kundaa nde, ályele ti: «Wehe si aakakala ya Yiisu wu a ku Ngalile!» <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Lo nde átunu ŋa nkulu a baara bwohono, ya ályele ti: «Me ka nsoolo ndagha yi dzyi we olyele o.» <verse eid="MAT 26:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Ŋa nseele, Piere bu ákagye ku bele a edzughubu ki enene ki ekagha, musala mukimi wu mukaha ámono nde ya ályele kundaa ba báli oŋo ti: «Mbwuru wu aakakala ya Yiisu musi Nadzarete.» <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Nde áfiritunu ya ályele ti: «Me ndaba mukihi, me ka nsoolo mbwuru wu o!» <verse eid="MAT 26:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Ŋa mbihi a edzighi ebi, ba báli oŋo báyasele ya bályele kundaa Piere ti: «Mu engaŋma, wehe si li wu a ndaa bo! Mu kuulu mbiili a we yi li mu ofwunu we.» <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Mu obo nde álaba mukihi mu okabiili mpwoho ti: «Me ka nsoolo mbwuru wu o!» Ya ŋaana oŋo mulumu a nsuhu ákuolo. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Ya Piere álibili mweẽ mu ndagha yi ólyele nde Yiisu: «Nsomo mulumu a nsuhu akuolo, we sa tunu me mansa matere.» Ya nde bu apala ku mbala, ábuulu mukaba a elili kii minyoõ.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu ŋa nkulu a Pilate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luk 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Dzã 18.28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Bwihi bu buki, bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami bwohono ya bakulu ba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife bákuru mfwunu yi otsyiri Yiisu mukakana wu lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Ya bu bakuru nde misyi, bábiri nde ya bágwi nde ŋa myaã mi Pilate, mfumu a etsulu e nsie.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda dzwi nyuru a nde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Big 1.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Yuda wu aatyeghe Yiisu, bu amono ti baatsyiri nde mukakana wu lipfu, ásobo bitsimi, ya áyibvurulu makwumu matere ma mipara (30) mimi bisyeẽ kundaa bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu ba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife, <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Me aansi masumu bu aantyeghe makili mama wu gwene osoolo ndagha!» Lo bo bályele ti: «Ka mitala bihi o! Oyo ndagha a we!» <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Nde ábulutsili mipara mimi bisyeẽ mu nzo a Nzaami, ápala ya áyilele swe.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami bágwolo mipara mimi bisyeẽ mimye ya bályele ti: «Ka oli a muswa mu olo mye mu baakabunu nzi a nzo a Nzaami o, mu kuulu mye mili mutala a makili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ntala a makili bwunu we ntala a laama li mbwuru. </char></note>.» <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Bo bákuru mfwunu, báswumu nseghe a wu aakagyighili bilogho bi bámyene mu mubweẽ mu mipara mimye mu kuulu yikala mampyeme ma banzyi. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Me mu obo tee mu matala ma, baakata nseghe oyo «nseghe a makili». <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Obo me bu ókeele mi áli ólyele mubighili Dzeremi: «<char style="qt">Bo baagwolo makwumu matere (30) ma mipara mimi bisyeẽ, munde me mutala wu ólyele baana ba Isarayele, wu bákehe mu mbwuru munde</char>, <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" />ya bo baagwi mipara mimye mu nseghe a wu wu aakagyighili bilogho bi bámyene mu mubweẽ, <char style="qt">bwunu a bu ógwi me Mfumu litumu</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bu babvughu </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Dza 11.12-13</ref></char> ya <char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 18:2-3">Dze 18.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:1-2">19.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:6-15">32.6-15</ref></char>, oŋo babagha ndagha oyo. </note>.»<verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilate gwi Yiisu bifwulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15.2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luk 23.3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Dzã 18.33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Bábiri Yiisu ŋa nkulu a Mfumu a etsulu e nsie. Nde áfwulu nde ti: «Bunu, we me mukogho a ba-Dzwife?» Yiisu ályele ti: «Weme lyele yo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" />Lo mu matala ma ókafwulu nde bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu ba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife, nde ka ábvuhulu ndagha o. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Mu obo, Pilate ályele kundaa nde ti: «Bunu, we ka li mu okagyughu mandagha mwohono ma bali mu okakwighi we o?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Lo Yiisu ka ábvuhulu nde mvuru o, ya mfumu a etsulu e nsie ákiŋimi ku olagha.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakehe Yiisu mukakana wu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15.6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Dzã 18.39–19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Mu nswe kyiri kii Paake, mfumu a etsulu e nsie ekye áli a epfu kii okapaha mbwuru a boloko mumõ, wu odzyi mpwumu a baara. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Mu matala mamo óli a mbwuru a boloko mumõ wu a nsia, nkwumu a nde [Yiisu] Barabase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mikaana milagha mi mikulu mídzimini osono nkwumu yi a Yiisu. </char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Pilate áfwulu kundaa mpwumu yi áabvuŋunu ti: «Nande be lidzyi ti me nyaã, [Yiisu] Barabase, bwunu we Yiisu wu baakata Kriste?» <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Mu kuulu, nde ásoolo ti bo baatyeghe Yiisu mu nkooro a ebaa e bo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Mu matala ma ábwi nde nsini ŋa epehe kii muyala, mukala a Pilate ágweghe mbwuru alyele kundaa nde ti: «Ka somo mu ndagha a mbwuru wu bunsumu wu o! Mu kuulu lolo mu nzolo me aamono mpara alagha mu nkooro a nde.»<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu ba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife bápeene a mampwumu ma baara mu kuulu mo maluomo Barabase ya badzwa Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Bu afiribili, mfumu a etsulu e nsie áfwulu kundaa bo ti: «Mu bo buolo, be na lidzyi me nyaã?» Bo bábvuhulu ti: «Barabase!» <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilate áfwulu kundaa bo ti: «Emakye me aansa mu Yiisu, wu baakata ti Kriste?» Bo bwohono bábvuhulu ti: «Bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Nde áfirifwulu bo ti: «Nde nsa bubi aagyighili?» Lo bo bákakehe bingubu mu mpini ya bákalyele ti: «Bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa!»<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:15">Mar 15.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:24-25">Luk 23.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:16">Dzã 19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Pilate bu amono ti nswe yi aalyele nde ka yifirikala a mupfunu o, lo mpaatsala yiikabvulu, nde ágwolo madza ya áswagha myaã ŋa nkulu a mpwumu a baara, ya ályele ti: «Me ka nsoolo ndagha mu makili ma o. Mitala beme!» <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Baara bwohono bábvuhulu ti: «Nyaã makili ma nde mabwa ŋa yulu a bihi, ya ŋa yulu a baana ba bihi!» <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Oŋo, nde ányaã bo Barabase. Lo Yiisu, bu bamana okaha nde nswa-nswa, Pilate ágwi nde ŋa myaã mi bo mu kuulu bakomo nde ŋa kuruwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bambumbulu basi Yiisu munkulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:11">Luk 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Dzã 19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Mpwumu yohono yi a bambumbulu ba mfumu a etsulu e nsie yíbiri Yiisu mu nzo a emfumu, ya yídzyi nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Bo bádzwulu nde binkuru ya bálaha nde enkuru ki ela kii mungala. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Bátwu ebara kii mansiene ya bákwighi nde kye ŋa yulu a mutswi. Bágwi nde edzyara akwara ŋa ngo-kwogho. Bu bakunu mabuo ŋa nkulu a nde, bábwi osa nde munkulu ya bákalyele ti: «Mukogho a ba-Dzwife, mboro a we!» <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Bo bátswulu nde manteẽ, bágwolo edzyara ya bábwi okakaha nde ŋa mutswi. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ya bu bamana osa nde munsensehẽ, bádzwulu nde enkuru ki ela ya báfirilaha nde binkuru bi ndeme. Ya bábiri nde mu okomo nde ŋa yulu a kuruwa.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bakomo Yiisu ŋa yulu a kuruwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Dzã 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Bo bu bapala mu bvulu, bámono mbwuru mumõ wu a ku Sirene, nkwumu a nde Simõ, bákwighi nde kuruwa li Yiisu obiri.<verse eid="MAT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Bo báto ŋa ebini ki baakata ti, «Ngolongota», mbaala ti, «etye ki mutswi a mbwuru». <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Báŋmihi nde mala ma bviini li bábvughu ya nsogho-ŋmeẽ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Bik 69.22</ref></char></note>. Bu alyini lo, nde ábihi oŋma.<verse eid="MAT 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Bu bamana okomo nde ŋa yulu a kuruwa, <char style="qt">bákaba binkuru bi nde mu empa kiili nga-a-bwehe me wu aagwolo</char>. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Ya bo bábwi nsini mu okakebe nde oŋo.<verse eid="MAT 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Bo bátwulu liyu-yulu li mutswi a nde ebili ki lipfu li nde, básono ti: «Wu me Yiisu, mukogho a ba-Dzwife.»<verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Mu matala maana mamo, bambumbulu bákomo emõ ya nde ŋa yulu a makuruwa, bantwumu buolo, mumõ ku ngo-kwogho, wu muke ku engbambogho.<verse eid="MAT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Baara ba bákaluru bákatughu nde ya bákanyihi mitswi mi bo<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Bik 22.8</ref></char></note>, <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />ya bákalyele ti: «We wu aatsala nzo yi a ngili ya ofiritwu yo mu bitsughu bitere<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Dzã 2.19</ref></char></note>, bvwuhu nyuru a we weme. Kala ti we li Mwana a Nzaami, sughuru ŋa kuruwa!»<verse eid="MAT 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Bumõ si bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami, Baluo-mikyene ya bakulu ba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife, bákasa nde munsensehẽ ya bákalyele ti: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />«Nde aabvwuhu babake, lo ka kughu obvwuhu nyuru a ndeme o! Nde li mukogho a Isarayele, mu bu nyaã asughuru ŋa kuruwa, ya bihi sa lisa kana mu nde! <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" /><char style="qt">Nde ási mukolo a nde mu Nzaami, nyaã Nzaami akwulu nde mu matala ma</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:9">Bik 22.9</ref></char></note>, <char style="qt">kala ti nde dzyi nde</char>, mu kuulu nde aalyele ti: “Me ndi Mwana a Nzaami!”»<verse eid="MAT 27:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Bantwumu ba bákomo ŋa yulu a makuruwa emõ ya nde bákatughu nde bwunu obo si.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu li Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Dzã 19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Obaana mu tala lili embehe tee mu tala lili matere, mpyibi yíbwi ŋa yulu a nsie yohono. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Ku bele a tala lili matere, Yiisu ásyama mu likyi lili mpini ya ályele ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 27:46">
    <char style="qt">«Eli, Eli, lema sabakatani?»</char></para>
  <para style="m" vid="MAT 27:46">Mbaala ti: <char style="qt">«Nzaami a me, Nzaami a me, mu emakye we aanyaghala me?</char><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Bik 22.2</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="MAT 27:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Mu ba báli oŋo, bu bagyughu, bana bályele ti: «Ligyughu, nde li mu ota Eli mbili!» <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Ŋaana oŋo, mumõ mu bo ábara áyigwolo nsana, átsubu mu bviini lili ŋeẽ, ya bu akuru yo mu edzyara, ágwi nde aŋma<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Bik 69.22</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Lo babake bályele ti: «Makebe, litswe limono kala ti Eli sa ayabvwuhu nde!» <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Lo Yiisu áfirisyama mu likyi lili mpini, ya átaghaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ya mono, nkpaŋa eko yi aakakabala nzo yi a ngili<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Opa 26.31-33</ref></char></note> yíkagha mu bipa byele, obaana ku yulu tee ku nsie. Nsie yínyiŋi, mameẽ ma manene mábaghala. <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />Mampyeme mádzubulu, baara balagha baba ngili baala áli bákpi, básighili mu lipfu. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Bo bápala mu mampyeme, ya ŋa mbihi a osighili o Yiisu mu lipfu, bo básomo mu bvulu lili ngili ya bámoŋono kundaa baara balagha.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Mukwuru a bambumbulu nkama (100) ya ba bákakebe Yiisu, bu bamono bu ónyiŋi nsie ya mi míbwi, bábagha nzalamweẽ yi alagha ya bályele ti: «Ngaŋma, wu ali Mwana a Nzaami!»<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Badzyighi Yiisu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Dzã 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Oŋo óli a bakaha balagha ba bákatala la-la. Bo bákanama Yiisu obaana ku Ngalile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.55 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Obaana mu matala ma óbaana Yiisu esala, bakaha babo bákabulunama nde.</char></note>, ya bákakaba nde bi-odza. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Mu bo oli a Mari musi Mangadala, Mari ngughu a Dzake ya Dzodzefe, ya ngughu a baana ba Nzebede.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Nkonkolo bu yito, baghala mumõ wu esini wu a nkwumu a Dzodzefe, musi Arimate, ágyi. Ndehe si áli enduono e Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Nde áyimono Pilate ya áluomo nde nyuru a Yiisu. Pilate ágwi litumu ti bagwa nde yo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Dzodzefe bu agwolo nyuru a Yiisu, ádzyi yo kunsa nkpaŋa yi a lino li linyaghara. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Nde átwulu yo mu dzunu li ndeme li linyaghara li átsimi kunsa limeẽ, ákimini limeẽ li linene mu okyi dzunu ya ágyene o nde. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" />Mari musi Mangadala ya Mari wu muke áli bábwi nsini ŋa nkulu a mpyeme.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Batwulu bambumbulu mu okebe mpyeme a Yiisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Etsughu ki eluono áli etsughu ki ékanama etsughu ki baakabwehẽ sabate. Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya ba-Faridzyẽ bágyene mu emvuŋunu kundaa Pilate, <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />bo bályele ti: «Mfumu, bihi liilibili mweẽ ti nga-a-mpya munde, ŋa aali nde mweẽ, nde ályele ti: “Ŋa mbihi a bitsughu bitere, me sa nsighili mu lipfu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Mu obo, gwa litumu mu kuulu bakebe mpyeme tee mu bitsughu bitere, mfangolo binduono bi nde biyaturu nde ya bilyele kundaa baara ti: “Aasighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi!” Ya mpya yi masini oyo sa yibvulu yi a nsomo.» <verse eid="MAT 27:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilate ályele kundaa bo ti: «Be lili a babo ba baakakebe. Ligye likebe mpyeme bwunu a bu lidzyi be.» <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Ya bo bu bagyene, bákebe mpyeme, bu bakuru yo mu limeẽ ya basi yo bilyimi, bátwulu ba baakakebe oŋo.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s1">Yiisu sighili mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar 16.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Dzã 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Ŋa mbihi a etsughu kii sabate, mu epala-epala kii etsughu kii nsomo mu limiŋi, Mari musi Mangadala ya Mari wu muke, báyitala mpyeme. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Ya mono, nsie yínyiĩ ku olagha. Ngye-yulu a Mfumu áfi ku yulu, áyakimini limeẽ ya ábwi nsini ŋa yulu a lo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Nde ákasehene ti anga musehene a nzele ya enkuru e nde éli kii buŋu lili nkara olagha. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Bambumbulu ba bákakebe mpyeme bu bamono nde, bábwi oteghere mu nzalamweẽ ya bákala ti anga bibyimi. <verse eid="MAT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Lo ngye-yulu átsughu ndagha ya ályele kundaa bakaha ti: «Be ka likala a nzalamweẽ o, mu kuulu me nsoolo ti be Yiisu wu baakomo lili mu okabulusagha. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Nde ka li ŋa o, mu kuulu nde aasighili mu lipfu bwunu a bu áli ályele nde. Ligya, limono ebini ki ali baalaha nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Ya lisa maswa liyilyele kundaa binduono ti: “Nde aasighili ŋa kara li ba bákpi, ya mono, nde aatswama ku Ngalile, oko be liimono nde.” Limono, me ndyele be yo.» <verse eid="MAT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Bo bámara ku mpyeme mu maswa, ya nzalamweẽ ya esee ki elagha, bábara ntyini báyilyele nsia kundaa binduono. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Lo mono, Yiisu áyibwana a bo ya ályele kundaa bo ti: «Mboro a be!» Bo báyasele kundaa nde, bákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ŋa nkulu a nde ya bákwara myili mi nde. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Oŋo Yiisu ályele kundaa bo ti: «Ka likala a nzalamweẽ o. Ligye, liyitwoho nsia kundaa banaana ya bambwee ba me, bagye ku Ngalile, me oko bo baamono me.»<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mi ólyele bambumbulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Bo áli nkini mu nzili, mono, ndaama mu bankyele bágyi ku bvulu ya bátwoho nsia yi a mandagha mwohono ma mábwi kundaa bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Bakwuru ba bangaa ba nzaami ya bakulu baba ekaana ki ba-Dzwife bábvuŋunu ya bákuru mfwunu. Bu bagwi mutala a nzi wu afaana kundaa bambumbulu <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />bátswi bo mukele wu: «Liyilyele bu: “Binduono bi nde biigyi mu mpyibi ya biituru nde, mu matala ma liikagyoŋomo bihi.” <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Ya kala ti mfumu a etsulu e nsie gyughu ndagha yi, bihi akala liibwihi [nde] mukolo, bihi liisa ti be linyaã okala mu mpara.» <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Bo bágwolo nzi ya bágyighili bwunu a bu báluo bo. Ndagha oyo yítsaŋama kundaa ba-Dzwife tee mu etsughu kii lolo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yiisu moŋono kundaa binduono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Dzã 20.19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Big 1.6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Binduono kwumu ya emõ (11) bígyene ku Ngalile, ku munguo wu áli ólyele bo Yiisu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Bo bu bamono nde, bákunu mabuo ŋa nsie ŋa nkulu a nde, lo babake báli a mikeme. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yiisu bu ayasele, ályele kundaa bo ti: «Litumu lwohono bágwi me lo ku yulu ya ŋa yulu a nsie. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Mu obo, bu liigye, lisa ti bikaana byehene bikala binduono bi me, liboghoro bo mu nkwumu yi a Taara, ya yi a Mwana, ya yi a Mufulu a Ngili<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Big 1.8</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />Liluo bo bakakebe mandagha mwohono ma aantumu me be. Ya mono, me ndi ya be bitsughu byehene, tee ku masini ma matala.»<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>